    "><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 "Cream / Moss" | 7A Premium Unisex Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Double-Layered Stripe Heritage Minimalist</strong></h3><p>The <a href="https://google.com/search?q=Onitsuka+Tiger+Mexico+66+Cream+/+Moss+Unisex+size+7.5&amp;prds=catalogid%3A10936242832639548493%2Cgpcid%3A3438779114705865607%2CheadlineOfferDocid%3A12672088432658397067%2Cmid%3A576462918665934300%2Cproductid%3A2185026534477478975%2Cpvo%3A38%2Cpvt%3Aa%2Crds%3APC_8386017194126777439%7CPROD_PC_8386017194126777439&amp;ibp=oshop&amp;gemcid=c_9e3e4e1f88054e5a&amp;gemrid=r_bf2c1df5dfebfa51&amp;pvo=38&amp;opi=103135050&amp;gl=IN&amp;hl=en&amp;noiga=1&amp;gemsp=AVZ_HgxYb3rguegozFyE0hx7vMXDiFnvCvcPJqN4IDHMifa7K82m6P669w">Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</a> in <strong>Cream / Moss</strong> (Style Code: <strong>1183C679-102</strong>) adds extra textural depth to the classic 1966 track silhouette. Built on a smooth <strong>warm cream leather upper</strong>, this release features <strong>double-layered Moss Green tiger stripes</strong> with visible contrast stitching along the side panels, paired with voluminous laces and a soft tonal suede T-toe cap.</p><p>This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> matches the slim, low-slung profile, cross-reinforced heel construction, and fold-down heel flap of the official release. Its muted cream and earthy moss-green palette pairs cleanly with neutral streetwear, denim, and casual rotations.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica engineered with exact panel alignments, soft leather uppers, and clean double-stitching throughout.</li><li><strong>Double-Layered Moss Tiger Stripes:</strong> Features dimensional, layered moss-green stripes across the midfoot for added depth over the standard flat-stripe design.</li><li><strong>Warm Cream Leather &amp; Voluminous Laces:</strong> Smooth cream leather base paired with slightly thicker, textured laces and tonal suede toe-box reinforcements.</li><li><strong>Cross-Reinforced Heel &amp; Flap:</strong> Complete with the signature X-shaped heel cross reinforcement and fold-down heel tab displaying printed Onitsuka Tiger branding.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile EVA Cushioning:</strong> Slim, responsive EVA foam midsole paired with a grooved rubber outsole for flexible, natural foot movement.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory "Premium" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class="table"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Heritage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><a href="https://luxe.ajio.com/onitsuka-tiger-mexico-66-lace-up-sneakers/p/703810705_white#gmf">Rs. 16,500</a> to <a href="https://pickyourkiicks.com/products/mexico-66-1183c679?color=CREAM/MOSS">Rs. 24,999</a> (Official Store &amp; Sourced Import Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Color</strong></td><td>Warm Cream / Moss Green / Tonal Cream Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Natural &amp; Synthetic Leather, Suede Overlays &amp; Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Fits true to size with a classic narrow, low-slung footprint. If you have broad feet or prefer extra toe box room, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for optimal comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean the cream leather upper using a soft, damp microfiber cloth and mild sneaker cleanser. For the front suede T-toe cap, brush gently with a dry soft suede brush. Avoid submerging in water.</p></blockquote></div>
