      '    "><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 "Light Grey Suede / Tan &amp; Reddish-Brown Stripes" | 7A Premium Unisex Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Earthy Full-Suede Vintage Runner</strong></h3><p>The <a href="https://google.com/search?q=Onitsuka+Tiger+Mexico+66+Vin+White/Grey/Brown+sneakers+Gray&amp;prds=catalogid%3A18298263548192475420%2CheadlineOfferDocid%3A2174118331953215462%2Cproductid%3A2174118331953215462%2Cpvo%3A38%2Cpvt%3Aa%2Crds%3APC_10618845232494980667%7CPROD_PC_10618845232494980667&amp;ibp=oshop&amp;gemcid=c_9e3e4e1f88054e5a&amp;gemrid=r_038e047e29c2e495&amp;pvo=38&amp;opi=103135050&amp;gl=IN&amp;hl=en&amp;noiga=1&amp;gemsp=AVZ_HgzHCyWKMum3lXVf5kPDmfUYetNdGhn8rZJ1_cHPUwu68vJOwg6PDg">Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</a> in <strong>Light Grey Suede / Tan / Reddish-Brown</strong> (similar to the <strong>Vanilla / Espresso</strong> and <strong>Birch / Metropolis</strong> suede packs) brings warm, autumn-ready textures to the 1966 track silhouette. Built on a soft <strong>light grey brushed suede upper</strong>, it has layered <strong>tan leather primary tiger stripes</strong> intersected by rich <strong>reddish-brown secondary stripes</strong>, finished with <strong>cream flat cotton laces</strong>.</p><p>This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> matches the slim, low-slung shape, cross-reinforced heel counter, and fold-down heel flap of the heritage release. Its muted grey suede and warm earth-toned stripes pair easily with dark denim, khaki chinos, and casual streetwear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica engineered with exact panel alignments, plush suede uppers, and clean double-stitching throughout.</li><li><strong>Soft Light Grey Full-Suede Upper:</strong> Supple brushed grey suede base with tonal suede T-toe and heel overlays for a rich, matte vintage texture.</li><li><strong>Two-Tone Tan &amp; Reddish-Brown Stripes:</strong> Warm tan leather racing stripes layered with deep reddish-brown accents deliver balanced, earthy contrast.</li><li><strong>Cream Cotton Laces &amp; Heel Flap:</strong> Off-white cream laces soften the upper palette, paired with the signature X-shaped heel cross reinforcement and fold-down heel tab.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile EVA Cushioning:</strong> Slim, responsive EVA foam midsole paired with a grooved rubber outsole for flexible, natural foot movement.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory "Premium" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class="table"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Heritage Suede Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 16,500 to Rs. 29,185 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Import Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Color</strong></td><td>Light Grey Suede / Warm Tan / Reddish-Brown / Cream Laces</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Brushed Suede Upper, Leather Stripes &amp; Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Fits true to size with a classic narrow, low-slung footprint. If you have broad feet or prefer extra toe box room, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for optimal comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Because the entire upper is crafted from brushed suede, avoid water and liquid cleaners. Brush gently in one direction with a dry soft suede brush or use a suede eraser for scuffs, and apply a water-repellent suede protector spray before wearing.</p></blockquote></div>',
