 herringbone tread pattern for a \"grounded\" feel and reliable urban grip.Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Color Labeling)Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product TagsBranded Crew or Ankle Socks (Beige or Green)Premium Canvas Carry BagProduct SpecificationsFeatureDetailsQuality Grade7A Premium / Master QualityRetail PriceRs. 12,500 (Official Store Price 2026)Market Price (7A)Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,500 (Current Indian Price)Sizes AvailableEuro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)ColorwayBeige / Grass Green / OatmealSKU Reference1183C102.250Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)Direct Dispatch: Usually shipped from premium footwear hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai within 24 hours.Estimated Timeline: 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via BlueDart or Delhivery Air.Payment Details:Cash on Delivery (COD): Available. Most 7A sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of Rs. 300?500 to confirm the order.Prepaid Benefits: Often includes Free Shipping and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe.Sizing &amp; Care TipFit Note: The Mexico 66 is known for its narrow, slim-fit profile. If you have wider feet or prefer a bit more room in the toe box, it is highly recommended to order a half size up (e.g., if you wear UK 9, go for a UK 9.5).Care: To maintain the \"Beige\" leather, use a soft damp cloth for the main panels. For the \"Grass Green\" stripes, a soft-bristled brush will remove dust without dulling the pigment. Applying a water-repellent spray is advised to prevent the light beige from staining.</p></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
