6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Classic Red / Black\" | 7A Premium Unisex Sneakers</strong>[cite: 2]</h2><h3><strong>The Bold High-Contrast Track Heritage Icon</strong>[cite: 2]</h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Classic Red / Black\"</strong> delivers one of the most assertive, vibrant colorways in the brand's long-standing heritage collection[cite: 2]. Built with a rich full-grain <strong>Classic Red leather upper</strong>, this pair is dramatically punctuated by deep <strong>Black Onitsuka tiger stripes</strong> across the side panels[cite: 2] and a matching light grey/birch suede T-toe cap[cite: 2].</p><p>This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> accurately replicates the slim, low-profile footprint, cross-reinforced heel construction, and fold-down heel flap of the original 1968 Olympics training shoe[cite: 2]. It serves as an eye-catching, high-contrast statement sneaker for streetwear, casual denim, and active lifestyle fits[cite: 2].</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica crafted with exact panel alignment, supple full-grain leather, and precise double-stitching throughout[cite: 2].</li><li><strong>Vibrant Classic Red Leather Upper:</strong> Premium full-grain leather upper finished in bold red, offering a sleek, durable, and flexible feel[cite: 2].</li><li><strong>High-Contrast Black Tiger Stripes:</strong> Jet black leather stripes along the quarter panels deliver maximum visual impact and brand signature[cite: 2].</li><li><strong>Reinforced Suede T-Toe &amp; Heel Flap:</strong> Soft suede overlay on the toe box for structural durability, paired with the iconic cross-reinforced heel and fold-down heel tab[cite: 2].</li><li><strong>Low-Profile EVA Cushioning:</strong> Slim, responsive EVA foam midsole paired with a grooved rubber outsole for flexible, natural foot movement[cite: 2].</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Heritage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 14,700 to Rs. 23,200 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Import Rates in India)[cite: 2]</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Classic Red / Jet Black / Birch Grey Suede[cite: 2]</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Full-Grain Leather, Suede Overlays &amp; Rubber Outsole[cite: 2]</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Enjoys <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Fits true to size with a classic narrow, low-slung footprint[cite: 2]. If you have broad feet or fall between sizes, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for optimal toe box comfort[cite: 2].</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean the red leather upper with a soft, damp microfiber cloth and mild sneaker cleanser. Use a dry suede brush on the front suede T-toe cap. Air dry away from direct heat or sunlight to preserve leather color vibrancy.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+5uk@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
