[&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD \"Clay Canyon / Clay Canyon\" | 7A Premium Mens Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Earthy Monochromatic Luxury Icon</strong></h3><p>The <a href=\"https://google.com/search?q=Onitsuka+Tiger+Mexico+66+SD+%27Clay+Canyon%27+1183C115-200+US+5%C2%BD&amp;prds=headlineOfferDocid%3A614243624082230954%2Cproductid%3A614243624082230954%2Cpvo%3A38%2Cpvt%3Ahg&amp;ibp=oshop&amp;gemcid=c_9e3e4e1f88054e5a&amp;gemrid=r_3234bfb217594bf3&amp;pvo=38&amp;opi=103135050&amp;gl=IN&amp;hl=en&amp;noiga=1\">Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD Clay Canyon</a> brings a rich, sophisticated monochromatic aesthetic to the brand's premium Super Deluxe (SD) lineup. Moving away from traditional high-contrast stripe combinations, this edition features a luxurious <strong>all-over earthy terracotta brown leather upper</strong> paired with matching <strong>Clay Canyon leather tiger stripes</strong>.</p><p>As a core piece of the upgraded SD series, it replaces basic canvas or thin panels with ultra-premium, supple full-grain leather. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> masterfully replicates the signature low-slung racing stance, pristine tonal stitch detailing, and modern interior cushioning that elevates this retro track shoe into a high-end lifestyle statement piece.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality SD Variant Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 replica featuring a <strong>supple core grain leather upper</strong> paired with matching premium suede overlays around the toe cap. It beautifully preserves the authentic ultra-slim profile and lightweight structure.</li><li><strong>Monochromatic Clay Canyon Palette:</strong> Designed with a rich, uniform <strong>terracotta/clay brown leather body</strong> layered with matching tonal leather racing stripes. This sophisticated, earthy colorway acts as an excellent warm neutral that pairs perfectly with olive cargos, vintage denim, or smart-casual trousers.</li><li><strong>Upgraded FuzeGEL™ Cushioning:</strong> Unlike standard flat retro track models, the premium SD core features a dual-density, <strong>gel-infused foam midsole</strong> concealed within the slim sole unit, providing exceptional daily shock absorption and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</li><li><strong>Premium Tonal Accents:</strong> Outfitted with refined, color-matched athletic shoelaces threaded through high-end <strong>metal eyelets</strong> and finished with cleanly engraved metal aglets, giving the upper a distinctly premium edge.</li><li><strong>Classic Archive Accents:</strong> Retains the traditional cross-stitched <strong>T-toe suede overlay</strong> for toe-box reinforcement, along with the signature fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> detailed with crisp logo branding.</li><li><strong>Moisture-Wicking OrthoLite Insole:</strong> Upgraded inside with a dense, contoured <strong>OrthoLite cushion bed</strong> designed for top-tier breathability, arch support, and effective moisture control during extended city commutes.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo SD Series Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Super Deluxe Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 15,000 to Rs. 24,400</strong> (Official Sourced &amp; Retail Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Clay Canyon Brown / Terracotta Tonal</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Full-Grain Leather, Suede Overlays &amp; Textured Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and protect against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders processed upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 SD collection is engineered with a <strong>distinctly narrow, form-fitting, and low-to-the-ground profile</strong>. If you have broad feet or usually wear a half-size, it is highly recommended to <strong>go one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to guarantee comfortable toe box room.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the rich clay leather panels and tonal overlays, avoid rigid wire brushes or aggressive chemical washes. Clean surface dust and dirt gently using a <strong>soft microfiber cloth or a dedicated suede brush</strong> mixed with a drop of mild sneaker shampoo. Store them in a cool, dry area away from direct summer sunlight to protect the leather structure and prevent color fading.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
