ety suede leather upper</strong>. It captures the narrower profile and sleeker toe-box structure that separates the SD line from standard models.</li><li><strong>Earthy Minimalist Palette:</strong> The warm <strong>Beige base</strong> is balanced by rich <strong>Forest/Grass Green cross stripes</strong> and heel accents. It functions as an organic neutral that pairs effortlessly with olive cargos, off-white linen trousers, or classic blue denim.</li><li><strong>Upgraded Super Deluxe Cushioning:</strong> Replicates the modern internal architecture with an <strong>AmpliFoam heel wedge</strong> embedded in the midsole for shock absorption, paired with a springy <strong>OrthoLite™ X-40 footbed</strong> for supreme step-in comfort.</li><li><strong>Refined Hardware &amp; Accents:</strong> Finished with thin, elegant dress-style laces and durable <strong>metal eyelets</strong> that elevate the shoe from a vintage runner to a luxury casual staple.</li><li><strong>Proprietary Herringbone Sole:</strong> Features a low-profile cream rubber outsole utilizing the classic <strong>herringbone tread pattern</strong> for solid multi-surface traction and lightweight flexibility.</li><li><strong>Full \"Super Deluxe\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger SD Premium Box (Correct SKU: 1183A872-254)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Crew Socks (Cream or Green)</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / SD Master Quality (1:1 Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 14,500 to Rs. 16,500</strong> (Official Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 4,100 to Rs. 4,600</strong> (Current Indian Market Rate)<