      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | Silver/White (Men's 7A Quality)</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Metallic Urban Icon</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"Silver/White\" is a high-shine, contemporary take on the 1966 training classic. This <strong>7A Premium Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica captures the futuristic metallic aesthetic that has made the \"Silver\" colorway a viral sensation in street fashion. It blends the iconic slim profile of the original Limber shoe with a striking mirrored finish, offering a bold statement piece that transitions effortlessly from high-fashion looks to casual urban wear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> An elite-tier replica featuring the classic thin-sole architecture and signature heel-flap reinforcement.</li><li><strong>High-Shine Metallic Finish:</strong> Crafted with a <strong>Metallic Silver</strong> synthetic leather upper that provides a mirrored, reflective look, accented by crisp <strong>White</strong> Tiger stripes.</li><li><strong>Iconic Silhouette:</strong> Maintains the narrow, low-profile 1960s track shape with the recognizable \"T-toe\" reinforcement in matching silver or off-white suede.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Comfort Lining:</strong> Includes a soft textile lining and an <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> for moisture management and all-day city walking.</li><li><strong>Flexible Traction:</strong> Features the classic slim-profile <strong>rubber outsole</strong> with a textured tread pattern for reliable grip on urban surfaces.</li><li><strong>Signature Branding:</strong> Features the \"Onitsuka Tiger\" logo on the tongue patch and the \"Mexico 66\" gold-foil or printed branding on the side.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,900 (Typical Indian 7A Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Metallic Synthetic Leather / Suede Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipped via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong> from major distribution hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically confirmed via WhatsApp and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for tier-2/3 regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Most premium 7A sellers offer COD with a small advance \"token\" fee (Rs. 200?Rs. 500) to secure the shipment.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>slim and narrow fit</strong>. It is generally recommended to <strong>order your true UK size</strong>. However, if you have wider feet or prefer a bit of extra room, consider <strong>sizing up by one</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) as the metallic finish on the leather can feel slightly stiffer than standard leather models initially. To maintain the silver shine, avoid harsh chemical cleaners; instead, wipe with a soft, dry microfiber cloth to remove dust and smudges.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
