ield spikes, featuring a distinctive thin sole with a slightly rolled-up toe.</li><li><strong>Engineered for Comfort:</strong> Includes a padded tongue and collar alongside an <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> for superior cushioning and all-day shock absorption.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Limited-Time Sale:</strong> Promotional pricing is currently available on this essential White/Black edition.</li><li><strong>Universal Fit:</strong> Available in a full range of unisex sizes, providing a comfortable, glove-like fit for both men and women.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Enjoy complimentary delivery straight to your door on this heritage order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
