ightly rolled-up toe.</li><li><strong>All-Day Comfort:</strong> Includes a padded tongue and collar alongside a cushioned midsole for superior shock absorption during urban exploration.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Discount Sale:</strong> Limited-time promotional pricing is currently available on this Green/White/Yellow edition.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a complete range of unisex sizes to ensure the perfect fit for everyone.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Enjoy complimentary delivery straight to your door on this special order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
