ext-lg [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Serrano \"Midnight / Dragon Fruit\" | 7A Premium Unisex Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Bold Navy &amp; Neon-Pink 1970s Track Spike Runner</strong></h3><p>The Onitsuka Tiger Serrano in <strong>Midnight / Dragon Fruit</strong> brings high-contrast energy to the brand's 1970s track-inspired runner. Built on a featherweight <strong>deep Midnight Navy nylon and textile upper</strong>, it has dual-overlay <strong>tonal navy suede panels</strong> at the toe cap and heel, paired with vibrant <strong>Dragon Fruit (hot pink) tiger stripes</strong> along the sides.</p><p>Defined by its signature <strong>upturned front rubber outsole</strong> that mimics vintage track spikes, this <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> reproduces the ultra-light build, padded tongue and collar, and sleek low-profile shape of the official release.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica engineered with exact panel alignments, featherweight textile uppers, and clean double-stitching throughout.</li><li><strong>Lightweight Midnight Nylon &amp; Dual Suede:</strong> Breathable deep navy textile base paired with dual-layered suede overlays on the T-toe and heel counter for authentic vintage structure.</li><li><strong>Vibrant Dragon Fruit Tiger Stripes:</strong> Bold hot-pink leather racing stripes along the midfoot deliver sharp visual contrast against the dark navy backdrop.</li><li><strong>Signature Upturned Track Outsole:</strong> Flexible, spiked-pattern rubber outsole curves upward at the front toe bumper for enhanced propulsion and retro track flair.</li><li><strong>Padded Collar &amp; Cushioned Insole:</strong> Softly padded tongue and ankle collar paired with a high-rebound foam footbed for all-day walking comfort.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Retro Track Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><a href=\"https://luxury.tatacliq.com/onitsuka-tiger-unisex-serrano-midnight-dragon-fruit-sneakers/p-mp000000008587946\">Rs. 10,500</a> to <a href=\"https://dawntown.co.in/products/onitsuka-tiger-serrano-midnight-dragon-fruit?variant=47238300893438&amp;country=IN&amp;currency=INR&amp;utm_medium=paid&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_content=feed&amp;utm_campaign=google_feed\">Rs. 16,999</a> (Official Store &amp; Sourced Import Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Color</strong></td><td>Midnight Navy / Dragon Fruit Pink / Tonal Navy Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Lightweight Nylon/Textile, Suede Overlays &amp; Curved Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Serrano has a sleek, tapered toe box inspired by track spikes. If you have wide feet or prefer extra room in front, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for ideal all-day comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Spot-clean the midnight navy textile upper using a soft cloth dampened with mild sneaker cleaner and cold water. Brush the front and heel suede overlays gently with a dry soft suede brush. Air dry away from direct sunlight.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":1}]
