     [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Serrano \"Arctic Sky/White Peach\" | Men?s 7A Premium</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Ethereal Track Silhouette</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Serrano in \"Arctic Sky/White Peach\"</strong> is one of the most visually refreshing colorways in the Serrano lineup. Inspired by 1970s track spikes, this model features a light, airy blue (Arctic Sky) nylon base paired with soft, muted orange (White Peach) Tiger stripes. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition perfectly captures the \"feather-weight\" feel and the vintage racing aesthetic that defines the Serrano.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica using a high-density <strong>nylon and synthetic leather</strong> upper. It features the signature dual-overlay suede on the toe cap and heel, providing that authentic retro-sport structure.</li><li><strong>Arctic Sky &amp; White Peach Palette:</strong> A unique, pastel-leaning combination. The cool \"Arctic Sky\" blue body is accented by \"White Peach\" stripes, making it a standout choice for spring/summer outfits and light-toned streetwear.</li><li><strong>Classic Spiked Outsole:</strong> Includes the iconic knobby gum rubber outsole that wraps slightly over the toe. Originally designed for track traction, it offers a distinct \"spiked\" look and excellent urban grip.</li><li><strong>Streamlined Low-Profile:</strong> Maintains the ultra-slim, thin-soled design that provides a \"grounded\" walking experience and a sleek, non-bulky silhouette.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Serrano Branded Box (Correct SKU 1183B400-405)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Light Blue)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Arctic Sky / White Peach / Cream</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183B400-405</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 - 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Serrano is known for its <strong>narrow, racing-style fit</strong>. It is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10) for a comfortable daily fit, especially if you have slightly wider feet.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep the Arctic Sky blue and White Peach stripes vibrant, avoid heavy water exposure. Use a soft-bristled brush for the suede overlays and a damp microfibre cloth for the nylon panels.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
