Outsole:</strong> Outfitted with a flexible, spiked-pattern rubber outsole that curves upward at the front toe bumper for enhanced propulsion and retro track flair.</li><li><strong>Padded Collar &amp; Cushioned Insole:</strong> Softly padded tongue and ankle collar paired with a high-rebound foam footbed for all-day walking comfort.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Retro Track Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 9,000 to Rs. 18,899 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Import Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Warm Cream / Wood Crepe Tan / Neutral Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Lightweight Nylon/Textile, Suede Overlays &amp; Curved Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Serrano features a sleek, tapered toe box inspired by track spikes. If you have wide feet or prefer extra room in front, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for ideal all-day comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Spot-clean the cream textile upper using a soft cloth dampened with mild sneaker cleaner and cold water. Brush the front and heel suede overlays gently with a dry soft suede brush. Air dry away from direct sunlight.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":1}]
