plete with a distinctive slightly rolled-up toe for added character.</li><li><strong>All-Day Comfort:</strong> Features a padded tongue and collar along with an <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> to provide superior cushioning and shock absorption.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Discount Sale:</strong> Limited-time promotional pricing is currently available on this Oyster Grey/White edition.</li><li><strong>Unisex Sizing:</strong> Available in a full range of sizes, designed to provide a comfortable fit for both men and women.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Enjoy complimentary delivery straight to your door on this special order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
