at curves slightly up at the toe. Originally designed for track traction, it now provides a distinct vintage finish and reliable city grip.</li><li><strong>Feather-Light Comfort:</strong> Known for being one of the lightest sneakers in the Onitsuka range, it features a padded tongue and a cushioned OrthoLite-style insole for all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Serrano Series Branded Box</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Navy or White)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Midnight / Pure Gold / White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183B400.400</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major sneaker hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Serrano has a <strong>very narrow and slim fit</strong>. It is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10) for a comfortable fit, especially if you have wider feet.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the metallic gold stripes, avoid harsh scrubbing. Use a soft-bristled brush for the suede overlays and a damp microfibre cloth for the nylon panels. Avoid wearing them in heavy rain to prevent the suede from bleeding into the nylon.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
