aturing a slightly rolled-up toe for a distinct visual edge.</li></ul><h3><strong>All-Day Comfort:</strong> Includes a padded tongue and collar alongside an <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> for superior cushioning and shock absorption during urbane<br><br><strong>Product Highlights</strong>&nbsp;</h3><ul><li><strong>70s Track Inspiration:</strong> A contemporary lifestyle shoe that pays homage to high-performance track spikes from the 1970s.</li><li><strong>Lightweight Construction:</strong> Features a breathable nylon upper reinforced with premium suede overlays on the toe and heel.</li><li><strong>Classic Color Palette:</strong> The \"Birch\" (off-white) base is paired with \"Peacoat\" (navy) stripes for an effortlessly versatile, vintage-sporty aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Unique Outsole:</strong> A slim, textured rubber sole that wraps slightly around the toe and mimics the grip of traditional racing shoes.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Comfort:</strong> Includes a padded tongue and collar, plus an <strong>OrthoLite®</strong> sockliner for superior daily cushioning compared to flatter models.<br>&nbsp;</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Discount Sale:</strong> Limited-time promotional pricing is currently available on this Birch/Peacoat edition.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a complete range of unisex sizes to ensure the perfect fit for everyone.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Enjoy complimentary delivery straight to your door on this special order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
