ted by clean Birch cream tiger stripes. This earth-toned profile shifts effortlessly from casual streetwear to understated casual luxury.</li><li><strong>Streamlined Retro Silhouette:</strong> Retains the 1970s racing DNA with a low-profile midsole that keeps the foot closer to the ground, offering a lighter \"barefoot\" urban commuting experience.</li><li><strong>Signature Spiked Outsole:</strong> Features the classic <strong>knobby rubber outsole</strong> tread that wraps slightly onto the toe and heel, providing excellent multi-surface traction and a distinctive vintage visual look.</li><li><strong>Padded Collar Comfort:</strong> Designed with a padded tongue, lined collar, and a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> for reliable moisture management and all-day ease.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct Style: <strong>1183B400 305</strong> Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Socks (Cream or Green)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 16,999</strong> (Official Retail &amp; Sourced Market Rates)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,999</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Kelp / Birch / Olive Green</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Lightweight Nylon Base &amp; Soft Premium Suede Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped directly from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> <strong>3–5 working days</strong> for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Chennai, Hyderabad) via air services like <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available across India. Most sellers require a <strong>Rs. 300–500 advance</strong> as a booking commitment fee.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often features <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% cash discount for final payments handled via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Serrano profile is noted for its <strong>slim and narrow-fit design</strong>. If you have wider feet or fall between sizes, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to ensure comfort across the forefoot.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":1}]
