mp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Year of the Horse\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Zodiac Heritage Edition</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Year of the Horse\"</strong> is a rare and highly sought-after special edition from the brand's Chinese Zodiac series. This model stands out through its unique material play, often featuring <strong>faux pony hair</strong> or specialized textured leather to represent the horse's coat. It is a bold, tactile departure from the standard smooth leather models, designed for collectors who appreciate cultural storytelling in their footwear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Texture:</strong> This premium edition replicates the specialized <strong>textured upper</strong>?often a mix of \"pony hair\" overlays and premium leather?maintaining the exotic look of the original release.</li><li><strong>Intricate Branding:</strong> Typically features unique tongue labels and heel insoles with specialized \"Year of the Horse\" calligraphy or zodiac symbols.</li><li><strong>Earthy &amp; Rich Palette:</strong> Often released in tonal browns, tans, or cream variations to reflect a natural equestrian aesthetic, accented by the signature Tiger stripes.</li><li><strong>Heritage Build:</strong> Retains the classic Mexico 66 silhouette, including the T-toe suede overlay, the \"X\" heel reinforcement, and the iconic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Traction:</strong> Equipped with the traditional thin, flexible rubber outsole with a herringbone tread for a vintage \"grounded\" feel.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Special Edition\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Zodiac Edition Branded Box</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price (Collector)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 15,000 to Rs. 20,000</strong> (Limited Edition Release)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,800 to Rs. 5,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Equestrian Brown / Cream / Tan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Special Feature</strong></td><td>Faux Pony Hair / Textured Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from specialized premium hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 200 to 500</strong> to confirm special edition orders.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, slim-fit design</strong>. Due to the specialized textured materials in this edition, the upper may feel slightly more rigid than standard canvas. It is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 9.5 or 10).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Because of the textured/hair-on-hide materials, <strong>do not use liquid cleaners</strong>. Use a soft, dry brush to remove dust. If it gets wet, let it air dry naturally away from direct heat to prevent the material from stiffening.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Copy Onitsuka","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":1}]
