&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Viny \"Birch / Beet Juice\" | 7A Premium Unisex Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Layered-Lace Vintage Track Evolution</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Viny \"Birch / Beet Juice\"</strong> reimagines the classic 1966 runner with a contemporary, layered-lace design and a sleek, slightly glossy finish. Built on a soft <strong>warm birch (cream beige) upper</strong>, this edition is accented by rich <strong>Beet Juice (deep burgundy maroon) tiger stripes</strong> across the quarter panels and matching suede T-toe overlays.</p><p>Defined by its signature <strong>dual-layer lacing system</strong>—combining standard flat laces with an integrated elastic cord—this <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> faithfully replicates the updated VINY upper treatment, cross-reinforced heel counter, and iconic fold-down heel tab.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica engineered with exact panel alignments, sleek upper finishes, and precise double-stitching throughout.</li><li><strong>Dual-Layered Lacing Construction:</strong> Features the signature Mexico 66 VINY layered lace setup, pairing traditional laces with elastic cords for a modern look and secure, adaptive fit.</li><li><strong>Birch Base &amp; Beet Juice Stripes:</strong> Warm cream-birch upper contrasted by deep burgundy-red tiger stripes and tonal suede reinforcements on the toe box.</li><li><strong>Cross-Reinforced Heel &amp; Flap:</strong> Complete with the classic X-shaped heel cross reinforcement and fold-down heel tab displaying printed Onitsuka Tiger branding.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile EVA Cushioning:</strong> Slim, responsive EVA foam midsole paired with a grooved rubber outsole for flexible, natural foot movement.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Modern VINY Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 20,500 to Rs. 27,900 (Official Boutique &amp; Imported Retail Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Warm Birch Cream / Beet Juice Burgundy / Neutral Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Treated Leather/Synthetic Upper, Suede Overlays &amp; Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h2><strong>2. Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Viny \"Off-White / Iron Navy\" | 7A Premium Unisex Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Crisp Monochrome &amp; Navy Layered-Lace Classic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Viny \"Off-White / Iron Navy\"</strong> brings a sharp, clean-cut palette to the updated VINY series. Constructed with a smooth <strong>off-white leather and synthetic upper</strong>, this pair is punctuated by deep <strong>Iron Navy tiger stripes</strong> along the side panels and a subtle light grey suede T-toe overlay.</p><p>Highlighted by its standout <strong>layered lace construction</strong>, this <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> accurately mirrors the modern detailing, slim low-profile silhouette, cross-reinforced heel, and fold-down heel flap of the authentic release. It serves as a versatile, smart-casual daily staple that pairs effortlessly with denim, chinos, and minimalist streetwear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica crafted with exact panel alignments, smooth off-white uppers, and clean double-stitching throughout.</li><li><strong>Dual-Layered Lacing Construction:</strong> Outfitted with the signature Mexico 66 VINY layered lace system, combining regular shoelaces with elastic cord detailing for a distinctive multi-lace aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Off-White Upper &amp; Iron Navy Stripes:</strong> Clean off-white base paired with deep midnight-navy tiger stripes and a soft suede T-toe cap for structural contrast.</li><li><strong>Cross-Reinforced Heel &amp; Flap:</strong> Retains the iconic X-shaped heel cross reinforcement and fold-down heel tab displaying printed Onitsuka Tiger branding.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile EVA Cushioning:</strong> Lightweight, flexible EVA foam midsole paired with a textured rubber outsole for reliable all-day urban grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Modern VINY Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 20,500 to Rs. 25,000 (Official Boutique &amp; Imported Retail Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Off-White / Iron Navy / Light Grey Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Treated Leather/Synthetic Upper, Suede Overlays &amp; Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India — Applies to Both Variants)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip (Applies to Both Variants)</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Fits true to size with a classic narrow, low-slung footprint. Because of the layered elastic-and-lace instep setup, the midfoot feels snugly locked in. If you have broad feet, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for ideal toe box comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Wipe the off-white/birch upper clean using a soft, damp microfiber cloth and mild sneaker cleaner. For the front suede T-toe cap, brush gently with a dry soft suede brush. Avoid submerging in water.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":1}]
