Row: [{"productId":81109,"productName":"Onitsuk_a Tiger Serrano Kelp Birch 7A Premium Mens Sneakers D-2076","productDateCreation":"2026-08-03 20:27:44","productLastUpdated":1795157204330,"productPrice":null,"productPriceWithoutDiscount":null,"productOriginalPrice":2399,"productFetchedFrom":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com","productUrl":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com/products/SKU1779018665657668","featuredimg":"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1779018663_TA2Dvz.webp","imageUrl":"[\"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1779018663_TA2Dvz.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1779018661_Or9O6e.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1779018662_UBnCdq.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1779018664_DfZ7YM.webp\"]","videoUrl":"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/videos/1779205077_bVOXyF.mp4","productShortDescription":"<div class=\"\n      [&amp;_ul]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ul]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ul]:text-left\n      [&amp;_ol]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ol]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ol]:text-left\n      [&amp;_a]:text-blue-600\n      [&amp;_a]:underline\n      hover:[&amp;_a]:text-blue-800\n      [&amp;_p]:text-left [&amp;_p]:opacity-90\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-left [&amp;_h1]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-left [&amp;_h2]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-left [&amp;_h3]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-left [&amp;_h4]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-left [&amp;_h5]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-left [&amp;_h6]:mb-2\n\n      /* Responsive heading and paragraph font sizes, margin below */\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-2xl md:[&amp;_h1]:text-3xl [&amp;_h1]:font-bold [&amp;_h1]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-xl md:[&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-lg md:[&amp;_h3]:text-xl [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h3]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-base md:[&amp;_h4]:text-lg [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Serrano \"Kelp / Birch\" | 7A Premium Mens Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Earthy Track-Inspired Evolution</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Serrano in \"Kelp / Birch\"</strong> is a sophisticated addition to the heritage track line. Inspired by competitive 1970s track spikes, this fresh colorway blends <strong>Kelp Green</strong> with a soft, warm <strong>Birch</strong> cream tone. It injects a sense of organic freshness into the classic racing profile while offering a calm, versatile look. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> captures the slim silhouette, lightweight feel, and unique textured overlays that make it a favorite for casual smart dressing.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 high-tier replica featuring a premium <strong>synthetic fiber and soft natural leather upper</strong>. The construction maintains the original Serrano's signature lightweight design and flexible forefront.</li><li><strong>Calm Kelp &amp; Birch Palette:</strong> The rich Kelp Green base mimics the freshness of tender greenery, beautifully accented by clean Birch cream tiger stripes. This earth-toned profile shifts effortlessly from casual streetwear to understated casual luxury.</li><li><strong>Streamlined Retro Silhouette:</strong> Retains the 1970s racing DNA with a low-profile midsole that keeps the foot closer to the ground, offering a lighter \"barefoot\" urban commuting experience.</li><li><strong>Signature Spiked Outsole:</strong> Features the classic <strong>knobby rubber outsole</strong> tread that wraps slightly onto the toe and heel, providing excellent multi-surface traction and a distinctive vintage visual look.</li><li><strong>Padded Collar Comfort:</strong> Designed with a padded tongue, lined collar, and a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> for reliable moisture management and all-day ease.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct Style: <strong>1183B400 305</strong> Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Socks (Cream or Green)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 16,999</strong> (Official Retail &amp; Sourced Market Rates)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,999</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Kelp / Birch / Olive Green</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Lightweight Nylon Base &amp; Soft Premium Suede Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped directly from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> <strong>3–5 working days</strong> for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Chennai, Hyderabad) via air services like <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available across India. Most sellers require a <strong>Rs. 300–500 advance</strong> as a booking commitment fee.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often features <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% cash discount for final payments handled via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Serrano profile is noted for its <strong>slim and narrow-fit design</strong>. If you have wider feet or fall between sizes, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to ensure comfort across the forefoot.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
