h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | Iron Navy/Birch</h2><h3><strong>Effortless Style Meets Heritage Design</strong></h3><p>Experience the perfect blend of classic aesthetics and modern convenience. The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"Iron Navy/Birch\" is a refined take on the legendary 1960s trainer that debuted during the Olympic pre-trials. This colorway swaps the traditional high-contrast tricolor for a deep, sophisticated \"Iron Navy\" leather base accented by \"Birch\" (off-white) stripes, offering a versatile and grounded look for the modern wardrobe.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Iconic 1966 Silhouette:</strong> Combines elements of the 1961 LIMBER-UP™ training shoe and the 1966 Limber shoe, which was the first to feature the brand's iconic stripes.</li><li><strong>Sophisticated Heritage Palette:</strong> Features a premium <strong>Iron Navy</strong> leather upper with contrasting <strong>Birch</strong> stripes and tonal suede overlays, providing a sleek, low-profile aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Premium Leather Construction:</strong> Built from buttery-soft natural leather and durable suede panelling on the T-toe and heel for a high-end feel and longevity.</li><li><strong>Signature Stability:</strong> Incorporates the classic X-shaped heel-cross reinforcement and the branded \"Tiger\" heel flap, ensuring a stable fit and an authentic retro profile.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Comfort Tech:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> that delivers high-rebound cushioning and shock absorption for all-day wear.</li><li><strong>Track-Inspired Grip:</strong> Sits on a thin, flexible rubber outsole with a textured tread pattern for reliable traction and a lightweight feel.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Versatile Daily Essential:</strong> The Iron Navy/Birch edition is a popular choice for those seeking a neutral alternative to the traditional white/blue/red colorways.</li><li><strong>Unisex Sizing:</strong> Available in a full range of sizes; it is designed for a snug, \"glove-like\" fit, though those with wider feet often prefer to size up a half size.</li><li><strong>Free Delivery:</strong> Benefit from complimentary shipping straight to your door on this special heritage order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
