shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>slim and narrow fit</strong>. For most users, it fits true to size. However, if you have wider feet or prefer a slightly roomier feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9). To maintain the vibrant \"White/Yellow/Green\" look, wipe the leather with a damp cloth and use a soft brush for the suede toe cap.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
