, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Fits true to size with a classic slim, low-slung footprint. If you have broad feet or prefer extra room in the toe box, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for optimal comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean the white leather upper using a damp microfiber cloth with mild sneaker cleanser. For the front grey suede T-toe cap, brush gently with a dry soft suede brush. Avoid direct submersion in water.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+5uk@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
