re Stability:</strong> Incorporates the iconic X-shaped heel-cross reinforcement and the branded \"Tiger\" heel flap, providing essential support and a distinct retro profile.</li><li><strong>Modern Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> that delivers high-rebound support and all-day shock absorption.</li><li><strong>Lightweight Grip:</strong> Features a slim, flexible rubber outsole designed for a lightweight, on-your-toes sensation with reliable traction.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Promotional Pricing:</strong> Limited-time seasonal offers are currently available for this classic tricolor edition.</li><li><strong>Universal Sizing:</strong> Available in a full range of unisex sizes; most find they run true to size, though wide-foot wearers may prefer to size up a half size.</li><li><strong>Free Delivery:</strong> Benefit from complimentary shipping straight to your door on this special heritage order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Copy 0n!+5Uk@","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
