   [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><p>helo</p><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 VIN White/Brown | Men's 7A Premium First Copy</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Authentic Vintage Heritage</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"VIN\" (Vintage)</strong> series is specifically designed to mimic the look and feel of 1960s track shoes. This <strong>7A Premium First Copy</strong> replica captures the \"lived-in\" aesthetic of the White/Brown colorway, featuring a creamier, vintage-tinted white leather base rather than a stark optic white. With its rich chocolate brown Tiger stripes and weathered suede accents, this pair offers a sophisticated, old-school charm that pairs perfectly with vintage denim or heritage workwear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Vintage Build:</strong> Crafted with \"Antique Rave\" synthetic leather that features a subtle, pre-aged texture for an authentic retro appearance.</li><li><strong>Chocolate Brown Contrast:</strong> The iconic Tiger stripes are finished in a deep matte brown, complemented by a matching brown heel counter and tongue logo.</li><li><strong>Aged Suede \"T-Toe\":</strong> Includes the signature reinforced toe cap in a muted grey or beige suede, treated to look like an archival original.</li><li><strong>Vintage-Tinted Midsole:</strong> Unlike standard models, the VIN edition features a slightly yellowed or \"bone\" colored midsole to complete the 1960s aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile OrthoLite Comfort:</strong> Fitted with a high-density cushioned insole for moisture management and all-day urban comfort without losing the grounded feel.</li><li><strong>Classic Traction Outsole:</strong> A thin, flexible rubber outsole with the traditional herringbone tread for reliable grip and a flexible stride.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct VIN Style Labeling)</li><li>Branded Tissue Paper &amp; Care Instruction Card</li><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Carry Bag</li><li>Standard Flat Cream/White Laces</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (VIN Series)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>&nbsp;Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11 / Men's Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Dark Brown / Cream (Vintage Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Antique Faux Leather / Suede Accents</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major premium hubs like <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, and Mumbai; orders are typically dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 200?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10?15% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 VIN has a <strong>notoriously slim and narrow profile</strong>. It is true to size for narrow feet, but if you have a broader foot, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10). To maintain the vintage finish, do not use heavy liquid cleaners; simply wipe with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth to preserve the \"antique\" texture of the leather.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
