own base</strong> with soft <strong>Paper Bag tan racing stripes</strong> and a matching fold-down heel flap, offering a sophisticated alternative to basic black or white sneakers.</li><li><strong>Classic Archival Architecture:</strong> Preserves the signature crossed-leather heel reinforcement, thin athletic lacing system, and the iconic fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel tab</strong> stamped with crisp logo branding.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Flexible Outsole:</strong> Built on a thin, highly flexible rubber frame featuring a textured herringbone tread for dependable urban traction and an authentic retro track stride.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Daily Footbed:</strong> Outfitted inside with an upgraded <strong>dense foam cushion bed</strong> engineered for effective impact absorption, long-lasting shape retention, and arch comfort during all-day city wear.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Silk Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Classic Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 13,500 to Rs. 24,499</strong> (Official Store &amp; Sourced Resale Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Clay Canyon Brown / Paper Bag Tan / Cream</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Full-Grain Leather, Suede Overlays &amp; Textured Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 collection is engineered with a <strong>distinctly narrow, form-fitting, and low-to-the-ground profile</strong>. If you have broad feet or usually wear a half-size, it is highly recommended to <strong>go one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to guarantee comfortable toe box room.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+5uk4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
