<li><strong>OrthoLite X-40 Insole:</strong> Equipped with a high-rebound, moisture-managing sockliner for \"springy\" comfort that is ideal for all-day urban walking.</li><li><strong>Refined Hardware:</strong> Features slim, waxed shoelaces and durable <strong>metal eyelets</strong> that contribute to an elegant and sophisticated impression compared to the standard model.</li><li><strong>Updated Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features a revised outsole compound designed for superior grip, even on wet city surfaces, while maintaining the iconic thin-sole aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Retains the signature cross-stitched heel parts and the iconic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap that distinguishes the Mexico 66 family.</li></ul><h3><strong>What's in the \"Full Kit\"?</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Full Kit</strong> designation ensures a complete premium unboxing experience, typically including:</p><ul><li><strong>Premium SD Series Box:</strong> A sturdy, brand-accurate \"Super Deluxe\" Onitsuka Tiger box.</li><li><strong>Branded Dust Bag:</strong> A soft fabric bag for shoe protection during storage or travel.</li><li><strong>Authentication Documents:</strong> Replicated brand tags, \"SD\" series care guides, and certificate cards.</li><li><strong>Optional Accessories:</strong> Often includes an extra set of contrasting laces for a customized look.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Super Deluxe Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>?3,499 to ?4,500 (Full Kit premium in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Colorway</strong></td><td>Birch (Cream) / Peacoat (Navy) / Green</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Nationwide Reach:</strong> Fast shipping is available to all major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24?48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most 7A sellers may request a small advance \"token\" fee (Rs. 200? Rs. 500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 SD is built on a <strong>slimmer and longer profile</strong> than the regular 66. For narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) as the SD model is more tapered through the midfoot. To clean, use a soft suede brush for the toe overlays and a damp cloth for the leather panels; avoid water saturation to preserve the \"SD\" cushioning.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
