ng>Signature Stability Features:</strong> Includes the iconic X-shaped heel-cross reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for a stable fit and a distinct vintage profile.</li><li><strong>All-Day Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> that delivers high-rebound support and comfort for long hours of wear.</li><li><strong>Vintage-Inspired Sole:</strong> Sits on a thin, off-white midsole and a durable rubber outsole with a textured tread for reliable daily traction.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Seasonal Edition:</strong> This \"Airy Green/Verdigris Green\" colorway (Style Code: 1183A201-304) is a popular seasonal release frequently featured in premium sneaker marketplaces.</li><li><strong>Unisex Sizing:</strong> Available in a full range of sizes; while generally true to size, some wearers with wider feet may prefer to go up a half size for a more relaxed fit.</li><li><strong>Global Delivery:</strong> Available with free delivery on qualifying orders from official Onitsuka Tiger stores and select luxury retail partners.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+5Uk@ TIGER","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
