istic aesthetic anchored by contrasting <strong>matte black leather racing stripes</strong>.</li><li><strong>Classic Archive Architecture:</strong> Retains the traditional stitched <strong>T-toe suede overlay</strong> for added toe box reinforcement, slim athletic laces, and the signature fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> in black.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Vulcanized Sole:</strong> Sits on a thin, flexible off-white and black rubber outsole equipped with a textured herringbone tread layout for reliable urban traction and a close-to-the-ground track feel.</li><li><strong>Shock-Absorbing Cushion Footbed:</strong> Upgraded inside with a dense, contoured foam insole that features heel-cross reinforcement for enhanced stability and comfortable support during daily city commutes.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Metallic Series Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Metallic Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500 to Rs. 16,999</strong> (Official Store &amp; Premium Sourced Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Pure Silver / Core Black / Metallic Chrome</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Metallic Leather, Suede Overlays &amp; Flexible Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> across major Indian metros via reliable premium air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to protect against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders processed upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 collection features a <strong>narrow, form-fitting, and low-to-the-ground profile</strong>. If you have broad feet or usually wear a half-size, it is highly recommended to <strong>go one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to ensure comfortable toe room.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the specialized liquid metallic silver leather finish, avoid using stiff plastic brushes or harsh chemical cleansers. Clean surface dust gently with a <strong>soft, dry microfiber cloth</strong> or a dedicated sneaker wipe. Store them in a cool environment out of direct, intense sunlight to prevent the metallic coating from fading or peeling over time.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+$Uk@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
