ent and heel for a classic, multi-dimensional texture.</li><li><strong>Classic Heel Features:</strong> Retains the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap, essential for that authentic 1966 silhouette.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Comfort:</strong> Designed with a thin, flexible rubber outsole for a grounded feel, complemented by a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> for all-day urban wear.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Finished with the Onitsuka Tiger logo patch on the tongue and the classic lace-up design that debuted for the 1968 Olympic Games.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Depending on seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Synthetic/Artificial Leather &amp; Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipping to all major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders typically ship within <strong>24 hours</strong> after verification.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"token\" fee (?200??500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>slim, tapered fit</strong>. For most men, it fits true to size. However, if you have wider feet or prefer a slightly roomier feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9). To maintain the \"Cream/Grey\" finish, use a soft suede brush for the grey accents and a damp cloth for the cream panels; avoid using harsh chemicals that could yellow the cream base.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
