ontrast.</li><li><strong>Bold Black Tiger Stripes:</strong> High-contrast black leather stripes along the midfoot panels deliver the signature Onitsuka heritage visual identity.</li><li><strong>Cross-Reinforced Heel &amp; Flap:</strong> Outfitted with the classic X-shaped heel cross reinforcement and fold-down heel tab featuring printed branding.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Cushioning:</strong> Lightweight, flexible EVA foam midsole paired with a grooved rubber outsole for all-day grip and comfort.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Heritage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 12,500 to Rs. 21,999 (Official Store &amp; Imported Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Men's Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Warm Ivory / Birch Suede / Jet Black Stripes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Full-Grain Soft Leather, Suede Overlays &amp; Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Enjoys <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Fits true to size with a classic narrow, low-profile footprint. If you have wide feet or prefer extra room for thick socks, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for maximum toe box comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean the ivory leather using a damp microfiber cloth with mild sneaker cleaner. For the front suede T-toe, brush gently with a dry soft suede brush. Avoid submerging in water.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+$UK4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
