rong>Heritage Build:</strong> Retains the classic Mexico 66 silhouette, including the T-toe suede overlay, the \"X\" heel reinforcement, and the iconic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Traction:</strong> Equipped with the traditional thin, flexible rubber outsole with a herringbone tread for a vintage \"grounded\" feel.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Special Edition\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Zodiac Edition Branded Box</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price (Collector)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 15,000 to Rs. 20,000</strong> (Limited Edition Release)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,800 to Rs. 5,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Equestrian Brown / Cream / Tan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Special Feature</strong></td><td>Faux Pony Hair / Textured Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from specialized premium hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 200 to 