Row: [{"productId":113126,"productName":"0n!+$Uk@ Tiger Mexico 66 Brown Camel Suede 7A Premium Sneakers D-2137","productDateCreation":"2026-10-02 21:20:22","productLastUpdated":1795157206050,"productPrice":null,"productPriceWithoutDiscount":null,"productOriginalPrice":2299,"productFetchedFrom":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com","productUrl":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com/products/SKU1790937400409864","featuredimg":"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/af8e5c8c-c47e-4c4a-ab05-ce45b4f165bd.webp","imageUrl":"[\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/af8e5c8c-c47e-4c4a-ab05-ce45b4f165bd.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/da39ab22-a4f3-4b34-8bf4-6289f0fe4f30.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/46f8cffa-3b2a-43e8-95ba-4cee567535d2.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/5f603f01-20cb-4715-b875-41048641b3d8.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/c6c2602f-4ef8-4f39-b357-18add10af222.webp\"]","videoUrl":"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/videos/1790937399_WojZwl.mp4","productShortDescription":"<div class=\"\n      [&amp;_ul]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ul]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ul]:text-left\n      [&amp;_ol]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ol]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ol]:text-left\n      [&amp;_a]:text-blue-600\n      [&amp;_a]:underline\n      hover:[&amp;_a]:text-blue-800\n      [&amp;_p]:text-left [&amp;_p]:opacity-90\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-left [&amp;_h1]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-left [&amp;_h2]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-left [&amp;_h3]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-left [&amp;_h4]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-left [&amp;_h5]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-left [&amp;_h6]:mb-2\n\n      /* Responsive heading and paragraph font sizes, margin below */\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-2xl md:[&amp;_h1]:text-3xl [&amp;_h1]:font-bold [&amp;_h1]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-xl md:[&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-lg md:[&amp;_h3]:text-xl [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h3]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-base md:[&amp;_h4]:text-lg [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h3><strong>The Earthy Vintage Luxe Daily Staple</strong>[cite: 2]</h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Brown Camel Suede\"</strong> introduces a rich, tactile aesthetic to the brand's iconic 1968 Olympic runner silhouette[cite: 2]. Crafted with a buttery-soft <strong>camel tan suede upper</strong>[cite: 2], this edition features deep chocolate brown leather tiger stripes across the quarter panels[cite: 2] and a matching tonal suede T-toe cap[cite: 2].</p><p>This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> accurately replicates the slim, low-profile footprint, cross-reinforced heel construction, and fold-down heel flap of the original track classic[cite: 2]. Its warm, neutral earth-toned palette serves as a versatile statement option for autumn styling, casual denim, and elevated streetwear rotations[cite: 2].</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica engineered with exact panel alignments, plush suede leather, and clean double-stitching throughout[cite: 2].</li><li><strong>Plush Camel Suede Upper:</strong> Built with a rich camel tan suede base that offers a soft texture and refined vintage aesthetic[cite: 2].</li><li><strong>Chocolate Brown Tiger Stripes:</strong> Smooth, deep brown leather racing stripes along the side panels deliver high-contrast visual depth[cite: 2].</li><li><strong>Cross-Reinforced Heel &amp; Flap:</strong> Complete with the iconic X-shaped heel cross reinforcement and fold-down heel tab displaying printed Onitsuka Tiger branding[cite: 2].</li><li><strong>Low-Profile EVA Cushioning:</strong> Slim, responsive EVA foam midsole paired with a grooved rubber outsole for flexible, natural foot movement[cite: 2].</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Heritage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 18,999 to Rs. 22,999 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Import Rates in India)[cite: 2]</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Camel Tan Suede / Chocolate Brown / Warm Cream Midsole[cite: 2]</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Suede Leather Upper &amp; Durable Rubber Outsole[cite: 2]</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+5uk@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
