mp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Cream / Pine Green\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Earthy Heritage Icon</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 in \"Cream / Pine Green\"</strong> is one of the most sought-after vintage colorways in the heritage line. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition perfectly captures the \"Birch\" or cream-toned base contrasted by deep, forest-inspired <strong>Pine Green Tiger stripes</strong>. It?s a versatile, sophisticated sneaker that bridges the gap between 1960s track aesthetics and modern smart-casual fashion.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 high-grade replica that mirrors the original?s <strong>slim racing profile</strong>, lightweight feel, and technical stitching.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Mix:</strong> Crafted from soft <strong>natural-feel leather</strong> on the cream upper, complemented by <strong>Pine Green suede overlays</strong> on the T-toe and the iconic heel flap for a rich, textured finish.</li><li><strong>Classic Comfort:</strong> Features a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> designed for moisture management and all-day urban wear.</li><li><strong>Signature Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the legendary <strong>heel-cross reinforcement</strong> for stability and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>Durable Traction:</strong> The slim, flexible rubber outsole features the traditional <strong>herringbone tread pattern</strong> for reliable grip on city streets.</li><li><strong>Full \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU/Labeling)</li><li>Authentic-style Tissue Paper &amp; Branded Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Socks (Black or White)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Copy (Luxury Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 11,500 to Rs. 17,500</strong> (Official Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,499 to Rs. 4,800</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (UK 3 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Cream / Pine Green / Birch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183A201-304 / 1183B771-111</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Dispatch Hubs:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped from <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery Timeline:</strong> Expect delivery in <strong>3 to 5 working days</strong> for metro cities via premium couriers like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong> * <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available; most sellers require a small advance \"security\" deposit of <strong>Rs. 200 to 500</strong> to confirm.<ul><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, slim-fit silhouette</strong>. If you have wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9). For narrow feet, stay true to size.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Use a <strong>soft suede brush</strong> specifically for the green suede parts to maintain the deep pigment. For the cream leather panels, a <strong>damp microfiber cloth</strong> is best. Avoid using a washing machine to preserve the integrity of the materials.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
