l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Sabot \"Cream / Kale Green\" | 7A Premium Unisex Clog / Mule</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Effortless Open-Heel Summer Heritage Mule</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Sabot \"Cream / Kale Green\"</strong> transforms the brand's iconic 1966 runner into a backless, clog-style mule built for effortless daily wear. Crafted with an ultra-breathable coarse cream mesh base, this pair is reinforced with rich <strong>Kale Green leather tiger stripes</strong> and a suede T-toe overlay.</p><p>This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> faithfully replicates the open-heel Sabot design, lightweight mesh-and-suede upper, and cushioned OrthoLite-inspired footbed. It serves as a stylish, breathable luxury slip-on ideal for summer rotations, casual errands, and relaxed streetwear looks.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Sabot Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica engineered with exact backless mule proportions, precise side stripe positioning, and durable stitching.</li><li><strong>Breathable Mesh &amp; Suede Upper:</strong> Constructed with a lightweight cream mesh upper for maximum airflow, paired with premium suede overlays on the toe cap and heel counter.</li><li><strong>Kale Green Tiger Stripes:</strong> Contrast dark kale green leather racing stripes deliver the signature Onitsuka heritage visual identity against the cream backdrop.</li><li><strong>Easy Open-Back Slip-On Design:</strong> Backless Sabot construction allows for instant slip-on, slip-off convenience without sacrificing the classic Mexico 66 front profile.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Impact Insole:</strong> Outfitted with an ergonomic, high-density foam footbed designed for long-lasting arch support and all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Slim All-Terrain Rubber Sole:</strong> Built on a low-profile, flexible rubber outsole providing reliable traction across daily indoor and outdoor surfaces.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Clog/Mule Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 19,999 to Rs. 24,000</strong> (Official Boutique &amp; Imported Retail Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Cream / Dark Kale Green / Neutral Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Breathable Mesh, Leather Stripes, Suede Overlays &amp; Rubber Sole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Enjoys <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Sabot backless mule fits slightly snug across the instep. Since there is no back heel collar, if you have broad feet or fall between sizes, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 7, choose UK 8) to ensure your heel sits comfortably inside the footbed edge.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean the mesh upper by wiping gently with a barely damp microfiber cloth and mild sneaker cleaner. Use a soft dry brush on the front suede T-toe cap. Do not submerge in water.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+5UK@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
