h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><p>helo</p><h2><i><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | Black/Yellow (Men's 7A Quality)</strong></i></h2><h3><strong>The Urban Stealth Icon</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"Black/Yellow\" (Black/Tiger Yellow) is a sleek, moody counterpart to the famous \"Kill Bill\" colorway. This <strong>7A Premium Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica meticulously captures the 1966 racing DNA with a deep black base that allows the vibrant yellow Tiger stripes to pop. It is a top-tier choice for men who want a more versatile, \"stealth\" aesthetic that retains the iconic retro silhouette while offering the comfort needed for modern urban living.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> An elite-level replica designed to match the original's ultra-slim aerodynamic profile and signature lightweight feel.</li><li><strong>Bold Contrast Palette:</strong> Built on a premium <strong>Black</strong> upper with high-contrast <strong>Tiger Yellow</strong> stripes and matching branding on the tongue and heel flap.</li><li><strong>Signature T-Toe Design:</strong> Retains the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the classic suede-style T-toe cap for enhanced durability and a vintage track finish.</li><li><strong>All-Day Walking Comfort:</strong> Equipped with an <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> for superior moisture management and improved shock absorption over standard flat soles.</li><li><strong>Mixed Material Construction:</strong> Typically crafted from a combination of <strong>high-grade synthetic leather</strong> and soft suede-style overlays for a premium, multi-textured look.</li><li><strong>Traditional Heel Flap:</strong> Features the original foldable \"Tiger\" branded heel flap, allowing you to wear it upright or folded for a customized look.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,400 (Typical Indian 7A Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Synthetic Leather / Suede Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipped via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong> from major distribution hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically verified via WhatsApp and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3–5 working days for metros; 5–7 days for smaller cities.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Most premium 7A sellers offer COD. A small advance \"token\" fee (Rs. 200– Rs. 500) is often required to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>slim and narrow fit</strong>. It generally fits true to size for standard feet. However, if you have wider feet or prefer a bit of extra room, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) as the structured leather can feel slightly snug initially. To maintain the \"Black/Yellow\" look, wipe the black panels with a soft damp cloth and use a suede brush for the toe cap; avoid liquid cleaners on the yellow stripes to prevent potential color bleeding.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+5UK4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
