ipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>narrow, slim fit</strong>. If you have standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. For those with <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) to ensure comfort across the ball of the foot. To clean, wipe with a clean, dry cloth for dust, and use a specialized leather cleaner for tougher stains to keep the black and red contrast looking fresh.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
