cludes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, slim-fit profile</strong>. If you have wider feet or prefer a more relaxed feel in the toe box, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 9.5 or 10).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the \"Beige\" leather, use a soft, slightly damp microfibre cloth. For the suede T-toe, use a dry, soft-bristled brush to remove dust. Avoid wearing them in heavy monsoon rain to prevent the beige color from water-spotting.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Copy Onitsuk_a","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
