ap for enhanced durability and retro appeal.</li><li><strong>Urban Walking Comfort:</strong> Equipped with an <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> designed to provide superior moisture management and all-day shock absorption.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Construction:</strong> Typically crafted from a combination of <strong>high-grade synthetic leather</strong> and soft suede overlays for a multi-textured finish.</li><li><strong>Iconic Heel Flap:</strong> Includes the signature \"Tiger\" branded heel flap, allowing for a personalized look when folded or kept upright.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,600 (Current Indian 7A Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Synthetic Leather / Suede Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipped via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong> from major distribution hubs.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically verified via WhatsApp and shipped within <strong>24?48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for smaller cities.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (Rs. 200?Rs. 500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>slim, tapered fit</strong>. For most men, it fits true to size. However, if you have wider feet or prefer a bit of room for thick socks, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) to ensure comfort across the bridge of the foot. To maintain the \"White/Dried Berry\" look, wipe the white panels with a damp cloth and use a soft suede brush for the toe cap; avoid liquid cleaners on the berry stripes to prevent potential color bleeding.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
