is-Shield Tongue Wings:</strong> Specialized inner tongue gusset design prevents sand, dirt, and grass from entering the shoe during course play.</li><li><strong>Turf Traction Rubber Outsole:</strong> Fitted with an upgraded, slip-resistant rubber outsole featuring aggressive lug geometry for swing stability and urban traction.</li><li><strong>Shock-Absorbing Footbed:</strong> Outfitted with an ergonomic, high-rebound sockliner designed for long-lasting arch support during full rounds of walking.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Golf Performance Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 27,500 to Rs. 29,500 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Retail Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Metallic Pure Silver / Off-White Midsole / Chrome</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Metallic Finished Leather &amp; Waterproof Golf Turf Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Golf series features a snug, low-slung fit. If you have broad feet or intend to wear thick athletic socks, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, choose a UK 9) for ideal toe box comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To protect the metallic silver coating, wipe light dirt and grass stains off using a soft, barely damp microfiber cloth. Do not use harsh solvent cleaners or abrasive brushes, and store away from direct sunlight.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+$uK4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
