ong>Cinematic \"Tai-Chi\" Palette:</strong> Combines a rich, eye-catching <strong>Tai-Chi Yellow leather base</strong> with high-contrast <strong>Jet Black leather tiger stripes</strong> and matching heel flap branding, delivering an undeniable retro statement.</li><li><strong>Upgraded SD Impact Protection:</strong> Built true to the Super Deluxe specifications with an <strong>AMPLIFOAM™ heel wedge</strong> and an internal gel-infused cushioning core for superior daily shock absorption and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</li><li><strong>Premium Rebound Footbed:</strong> Outfitted inside with a plush, contoured <strong>OrthoLite® X-40 sockliner</strong> that delivers high-rebound response, moisture management, and breathability for all-day wear.</li><li><strong>Refined Metal Hardware:</strong> Accentuated with durable <strong>metal lacing eyelets</strong> and fitted with sleek black athletic laces for an upgraded, premium finish.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile High-Grip Outsole:</strong> Sits on a thin, highly flexible rubber frame featuring a textured herringbone tread pattern for dependable urban traction and an authentic retro stride.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo SD Series Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Super Deluxe Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 11,500 to Rs. 16,500</strong> (Official Store &amp; Sourced Resale Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Tai-Chi Yellow / Jet Black / Vintage Off-White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Full-Grain Leather, Suede Overlays &amp; High-Grip Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 SD collection is engineered with a <strong>distinctly narrow, form-fitting, and low-to-the-ground profile</strong>. If you have broad feet or usually wear a half-size, it is highly recommended to <strong>go one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to guarantee comfortable toe box room.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the vibrant yellow leather finish and bold black tiger stripes, avoid rigid wire brushes or machine washing. Clean surface dirt gently using a <strong>soft microfiber cloth or a soft-bristled sneaker brush</strong> mixed with a mild sneaker cleaner. Store in a cool, dry area away from direct summer sunlight to protect the leather structure and prevent color fading.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+5uK@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
