_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><p>helo</p><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"White / Sky / Navy Blue\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Airy Heritage Refresh</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 in \"White / Sky / Navy Blue\"</strong> offers a crisp, multi-tonal take on the brand's most famous color scheme. While the \"Sky Blue\" and \"Navy Blue\" stripes pay homage to the classic tricolor heritage, the addition of the lighter sky-blue layer adds a contemporary, airy feel to the 1966 silhouette. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition is crafted to replicate the lightweight agility and vintage track aesthetics that have made the Mexico 66 a global streetwear staple.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>full-grain leather upper</strong> with signature T-toe suede reinforcements. The materials are selected for their soft feel and durability, matching the original?s flexible construction.</li><li><strong>White, Sky &amp; Navy Palette:</strong> A clean white base accented by stacked Tiger stripes in deep navy and bright sky blue. This colorway is highly versatile, pairing perfectly with light-wash denim, navy joggers, or neutral linen trousers.</li><li><strong>Classic Low-Profile Sole:</strong> Equipped with a thin, flexible rubber outsole featuring the traditional herringbone tread pattern for reliable grip and a minimalist \"ground feel.\"</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the iconic \"X\" reinforced heel stitching and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in navy or sky blue.</li><li><strong>All-Day Comfort:</strong> Features a cushioned insole designed for urban walking, maintaining a lightweight profile without sacrificing support.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Heritage\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Blue)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500 to Rs. 14,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Sky Blue / Navy Blue</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Leather &amp; Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and extra discounts for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 features a <strong>slim and narrow-fit design</strong>. If you have wider feet or prefer a slightly roomier feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep the white leather and light sky-blue stripes crisp, use a damp microfibre cloth for regular cleaning. For the suede T-toe, a dry suede brush or eraser is best. Apply a water-repellent spray before the first wear to protect against stains and dust.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+$uK@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
