ive comfort technology, including a <strong>fuzeGEL? technology</strong> heel wedge for impact protection and a high-rebound <strong>OrthoLite? X-40</strong> style insole for a plush walking experience.</li><li><strong>Refined Luxury Details:</strong> Features metallic eyelets, thin waxed laces, and a more streamlined silhouette. It retains the signature \"X\" heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>High-Performance Outsole:</strong> Equipped with a specialized rubber compound designed for superior grip on urban surfaces while maintaining the iconic low-profile look.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"SD Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger SD Series Branded Box (Correct SKU 1183A391-200)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Extra Set of Laces (Birch or Metropolis)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / SD Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 16,500 to Rs. 18,500</strong> (Official SD Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 5,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Birch / Metropolis / Cream</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183A391-200</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The SD series is built on a <strong>narrower, more modern last</strong> for a streamlined fit. It is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10) for maximum daily comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To preserve the Birch leather's cream tone, use a dedicated leather cleaner and avoid harsh chemicals. For the Metropolis stripes, a damp microfibre cloth is sufficient. Store in a cool, dry place to maintain the leather's suppleness.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+5uK4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
