 <strong>OrthoLite?</strong> style insole for a cushioned, \"cloud-like\" walk.</li><li><strong>Polished Luxury Details:</strong> Features thin, waxed laces, metallic eyelets, and a more streamlined silhouette. It retains the signature \"X\" heel reinforcement and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in bright orange.</li><li><strong>High-Performance Outsole:</strong> Equipped with a specialized rubber compound designed for superior grip on urban surfaces while maintaining the iconic low-profile look.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"SD Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger SD Series Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Orange or White)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / SD Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 16,500 to Rs. 18,500</strong> (Official SD Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 5,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Cream / Black / Orange</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Upper Material</strong></td><td>Premium Full-Grain Leather</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The SD series is built on a <strong>narrower, more modern last</strong> for a streamlined fit. It is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10) for maximum daily comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To preserve the light cream leather and vibrant orange accents, use a dedicated leather cleaner or a damp microfibre cloth. Avoid harsh chemicals. A leather protector spray is recommended before the first wear to help repel stains and dust.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
