h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | White/Gold (Men's 7A Luxury First Copy)</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Gold Standard of Casual Luxury</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"White/Gold\" is a premium lifestyle sneaker that blends 1960s track heritage with modern urban luxury.1 This <strong>7A Master Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica for men captures the iconic \"White/Pure Gold\" aesthetic, featuring a clean white leather base paired with brilliant <strong>Metallic Gold</strong> Tiger stripes. It is widely considered the most versatile \"dressy\" sneaker in the collection, offering a slim, sophisticated alternative to bulky trainers.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A top-tier 1:1 replica that mirrors the original’s featherweight construction, authentic slim profile, and signature heel flap.</li><li><strong>Luxury White/Gold Palette:</strong> Features a <strong>Pure White</strong> leather upper with high-shine <strong>Champagne Gold</strong> Tiger stripes and a matching gold heel tab for a refined, premium finish.</li><li><strong>Material Composition:</strong> Crafted from soft, fine-grain leather with the classic light grey <strong>suede overlays</strong> on the T-toe and heel-cross for structural reinforcement and retro texture.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Design:</strong> Modeled on the original 1966 racing last, providing a sleek, grounded silhouette that pairs perfectly with chinos, denim, or smart-casual trousers.</li><li><strong>Superior Underfoot Feel:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> designed to provide all-day comfort and shock absorption for city walking.</li><li><strong>Herringbone Traction Outsole:</strong> Features a thin, flexible rubber outsole with the traditional herringbone tread for reliable grip and durability.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Luxury Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Standard 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Approx. 350g–450g per shoe (Extremely lightweight)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate drawer-style box</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metro cities; 5–7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?200–?500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>notoriously slim and narrow cut</strong>.6 If you have standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) for a comfortable fit. To maintain the metallic gold stripes, wipe them gently with a soft microfiber cloth; avoid harsh cleaners or stiff brushes, which can cause the gold finish to peel or dull over time.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"VaNs Old","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
