e Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a slim, flexible rubber outsole that provides superior traction and all-day support.<br>&nbsp;</li></ul><h3><strong>Social Media Snippet 🍑⚓</strong><br>&nbsp;</h3><ul><li><strong>Caption:</strong> Navy meets neon. ⚓🍑 The Mexico 66 \"Peacoat/Guava\" brings a fresh twist to our most iconic silhouette. The deep navy leather sets the stage for those vibrant guava stripes to shine. Retro style, modern vibes.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Discount Sale:</strong> Limited-time promotional pricing is currently available on this Peacoat/Guava edition.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a complete range of sizes to ensure the perfect fit for every wearer.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Enjoy complimentary delivery straight to your door on this special order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
