:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned OrthoLite-style insole for moisture management and all-day walking comfort.</li><li><strong>Durable Traction Outsole:</strong> A thin, flexible rubber outsole in black or white features the classic herringbone tread pattern for excellent urban grip.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (with correct SKU/style labeling)</li><li>Branded Tissue Paper &amp; Authenticity Card</li><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Carry Bag</li><li>Set of Flat Cotton Laces (Standard Black)</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11 / Men's Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Black / White / Grey Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Faux Leather / Suede Toe</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major premium hubs like Surat, Delhi, and Mumbai; orders are typically dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 200?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10?15% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>very slim and narrow profile</strong>. While they are true to size in length, if you have broad feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10). To keep the black leather looking deep and sharp, wipe with a damp microfiber cloth and avoid using harsh liquid polishes; use a dry suede brush to keep the \"T-toe\" cap dust-free.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
