Row: [{"productId":81020,"productName":"Onitsuka Tiger MeXico 66 Graphite Grey Nippon Made 7A Premium Sneakers D-2048","productDateCreation":"2026-08-03 20:27:40","productLastUpdated":1795157208221,"productPrice":null,"productPriceWithoutDiscount":null,"productOriginalPrice":2099,"productFetchedFrom":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com","productUrl":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com/products/SKU1777881784860332","featuredimg":"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1777881779_iYcQvm.webp","imageUrl":"[\"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1777881779_iYcQvm.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1777881780_6Sur2y.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1777881780_tf8Fxs.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1777881781_pc5k9J.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebnship.in/products/images/1777881781_u4Wkgr.webp\"]","videoUrl":"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/videos/1784623084_bo8bsx.mp4","productShortDescription":"<div class=\"\n      [&amp;_ul]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ul]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ul]:text-left\n      [&amp;_ol]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ol]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ol]:text-left\n      [&amp;_a]:text-blue-600\n      [&amp;_a]:underline\n      hover:[&amp;_a]:text-blue-800\n      [&amp;_p]:text-left [&amp;_p]:opacity-90\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-left [&amp;_h1]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-left [&amp;_h2]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-left [&amp;_h3]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-left [&amp;_h4]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-left [&amp;_h5]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-left [&amp;_h6]:mb-2\n\n      /* Responsive heading and paragraph font sizes, margin below */\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-2xl md:[&amp;_h1]:text-3xl [&amp;_h1]:font-bold [&amp;_h1]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-xl md:[&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-lg md:[&amp;_h3]:text-xl [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h3]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-base md:[&amp;_h4]:text-lg [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Graphite Grey\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Industrial Minimalist</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 in \"Graphite Grey\"</strong> is a sleek, modern take on the heritage runner. Ditching the traditional bright whites and creams, this colorway embraces a dark, metallic \"Graphite\" charcoal tone. Often found in the <strong>SD (Super Deluxe)</strong> or <strong>GORE-TEX</strong> upgraded lineups, it is prized for its ability to hide wear and tear while maintaining a sharp, professional appearance that fits perfectly with the \"Dark Academia\" or tech-wear aesthetic.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>matte-finish leather or high-density canvas upper</strong> (depending on the specific batch). It captures the deep, saturated charcoal grey that doesn't fade into \"washed-out\" black.</li><li><strong>Graphite &amp; Carrier Grey Palette:</strong> A tonal masterpiece. The dark graphite body is typically paired with \"Carrier Grey\" or \"Silver\" stripes, creating a subtle contrast that looks exceptional under city lights.</li><li><strong>Refined Low-Profile Silhouette:</strong> Maintains the slim, iconic 1966 shape. This colorway is particularly popular because it makes the shoe appear even more streamlined and compact.</li><li><strong>Heritage Accents:</strong> Features the signature T-toe suede overlay in a matching dark grey, the \"X\" reinforced heel stitching, and a tonal \"Tiger\" branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>All-Day Comfort:</strong> Built with a flexible rubber outsole featuring the classic herringbone tread. High-quality 7A batches often include a cushioned insole to mimic the comfort of the retail SD series.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Graphite\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU 1183B500.020)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Black or Dark Grey)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 13,500 to Rs. 16,500</strong> (Official SD/Special Edition Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Graphite Grey / Carrier Grey / Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Matte Leather or High-Grade Canvas</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow and slim-fit design</strong>. Because the Graphite Grey model often uses a more structured matte leather, it may feel a bit firm at first. It is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9) for a more comfortable experience.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> This is one of the easiest colorways to maintain. Use a damp microfibre cloth for regular wipes. For the suede T-toe, a simple suede eraser or dry brush will keep the nap looking fresh. Avoid liquid cleaners on the matte finish to prevent unwanted \"shine.\"</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
