nct panel shapes and narrower toe box structure unique to the luxury SD line.</li><li><strong>Futuristic Platform Silhouette:</strong> Updated with a <strong>modern, chunkier sole unit</strong> that adds subtle height and volume while maintaining the iconic low-profile racing aesthetic.</li><li><strong>High-Contrast Metallic Palette:</strong> The high-luster <strong>Pure Silver upper</strong> wraps completely around the toe cap, eyestays, and heel pull-tab. It is smoothly balanced by soft <strong>Cream leather racing stripes</strong> along the sides.</li><li><strong>Upgraded Cushioning &amp; Comfort:</strong> Replicates the premium platform interior with <strong>fuzeGEL cushioning</strong> integrated directly into the heel wedge of the midsole and a responsive <strong>OrthoLite™ X-40 style footbed</strong> for all-day springy step comfort.</li><li><strong>Premium Accents:</strong> Outfitted with <strong>metal lace eyelets</strong> and sleek, slim shoelaces that transition the shoe seamlessly from a sport heritage classic to a luxury streetwear statement.</li><li><strong>Full \"Platform Deluxe\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger SD PF Premium Box (With Brand-Accurate Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks (White or Grey)</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / SD Master Quality (1:1 Platform Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 15,500 to Rs. 17,500</strong> (Official SD PF Store Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 4,800</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Pure Silver / Cream (Style: 1183C156-020)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Metallic Coated Calf/Kidskin Leather</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
