 tiger stripes</strong> and a black heel tab. This bold color scheme serves as an instant center-piece for minimal streetwear, monochrome tracking outfits, or dark cargo setups.</li><li><strong>Modern Platform Midsole:</strong> Built with a moderately thick <strong>platform rubber wedge midsole</strong>, updating the classic sleek low-top format to align with contemporary street fashion trends while softening city walking impacts.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Interior Support:</strong> Equipped with a dense <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned footbed</strong> that offers effective moisture management and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</li><li><strong>Signature Design Roots:</strong> Preserves the essential <strong>T-toe suede overlay</strong> for toe-box structural integrity and features the classic fold-down branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>Full \"Platform Deluxe\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger PF Premium Box (With Brand-Accurate Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Graphic Product Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks (White or Yellow)</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Platform Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 14,500 to Rs. 16,500</strong> (Official Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Tai-Chi Yellow / Black / White Midsole</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Grained Calf Leather &amp; Select Suede Accents</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;<