t grey suede</strong> overlays on the T-toe and heel-cross for structural reinforcement and vintage texture.</li><li><strong>Signature Heel Detail:</strong> Retains the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap that provides stability and a distinct heritage look.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Insole:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing, cushioned footbed designed to offer modern comfort and shock absorption within a vintage frame.</li><li><strong>Herringbone Traction Outsole:</strong> Features a thin, flexible rubber outsole with the traditional herringbone tread for reliable city grip and flexibility.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Chrome Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Standard 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11 / Men's)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Materials</strong></td><td>Calf Leather / Suede / Rubber Outsole</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs (Surat, Delhi, Mumbai).</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metro cities; 5–7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"token\" fee (?200–?500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 5–10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. For men with standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) for a more comfortable fit across the midfoot. To maintain the silver stripes, wipe them gently with a soft microfiber cloth; avoid harsh brushes or chemical cleaners, which can cause the metallic chrome finish to peel or dull over time.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
