g> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI or Bank Transfer.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, slim silhouette</strong>. For men with standard or narrow feet, stay true to your usual size. However, if you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) for a comfortable fit. To clean, wipe with a damp cloth and use a soft brush for the suede sections; avoid heavy chemicals to preserve the \"vintage\" finish of the yellow leather.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
