amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Beige/Burgundy\" | Men?s 7A Premium</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Sophisticated Retro Essential</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 in \"Beige/Burgundy\"</strong> is a masterclass in classic color blocking. This pair moves away from the sporty tricolor look in favor of a more \"lifestyle-first\" aesthetic. The warm, neutral beige base is perfectly complemented by deep burgundy Tiger stripes, creating a rich, autumnal look that pairs exceptionally well with chinos, dark denim, or earth-toned outfits. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition captures the timeless 1966 track silhouette with high-grade materials.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a high-density <strong>premium leather upper</strong> with the signature T-toe suede overlay in a matching beige tone for a seamless, textured look.</li><li><strong>Beige &amp; Burgundy Palette:</strong> A refined color combination. The light beige body provides a clean, versatile canvas, while the burgundy stripes add a pop of sophisticated color that isn't overly bright.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the iconic \"X\" reinforced stitching on the heel and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in burgundy, ensuring the classic Onitsuka branding is front and center.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Ground Feel:</strong> Features the traditional thin, flexible rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern, offering the signature \"light-on-your-feet\" experience.</li><li><strong>Breathable Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned insole and a slim tongue design, making it a comfortable choice for all-day urban wear.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Branded Box</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Beige)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 12,000</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Beige / Burgundy / Off-White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Leather &amp; Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow and slim-fit design</strong>. If you have wider feet or prefer a bit more room, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the beige leather, use a damp microfibre cloth for regular cleaning. For the burgundy suede stripes, use a specialized suede brush to keep the nap looking fresh. Avoid wearing them in heavy rain to prevent the burgundy dye from bleeding into the beige leather.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
