base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><p>Step into the future of footwear with the Adidas Yeezy Boost 350 V2 Natural, a perfect blend of style, comfort, and innovation. Featuring a minimalistic design with a stunning natural colorway, this sneaker embodies modern luxury while ensuring you stand out effortlessly. Crafted with a breathable Primeknit upper, it offers a sock-like fit that conforms to your foot for ultimate comfort. The signature Boost midsole provides exceptional cushioning, making each step feel light and energized. Whether you’re hitting the gym or running errands.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>- 🌟 Iconic Yeezy style for a standout look &nbsp;<br><br>- 👟 Primeknit upper delivers a comfortable, adaptive fit &nbsp;</p><p>- 💨 Boost midsole offers unparalleled cushioning and energy return &nbsp;</p><p>- 🏃‍♂️ Versatile design perfect for both casual and performance wear &nbsp;</p><p>- 🌍 Environmentally friendly materials used in construction &nbsp;<br><br><strong>CASH ON DELIVERY AVAILABLE ALL OVER INDIA</strong></p></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Adid4s Yeezy","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
