h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 x PandaPrank® | \"Wild\" Green</h2><h3><strong>A Fusion of Art and Heritage</strong></h3><p>Experience a bold, creative reimagining of a footwear legend. The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 x PandaPrank® \"Wild\"</strong> (also known as the <i>Wilderness</i> or <i>Escape</i> edition) is a high-profile custom collaboration that fuses the iconic 1960s trainer with the avant-garde artistry of the <strong>PandaPrank®</strong> creative studio. This limited-edition series transforms the classic silhouette into a piece of \"wearable art,\" featuring an organic, textured aesthetic inspired by forest landscapes and outdoor exploration.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Artisanal Secondary Creation:</strong> Each pair is meticulously handcrafted by skilled artisans on genuine original shoes, utilizing specialized <strong>fabric-cutting customization</strong> to create the distinct, multi-layered \"Wild\" texture.</li><li><strong>Organic Green Palette:</strong> Features a premium leather and suede base in a rich <strong>Wild Green</strong>, accented by tonal Tiger stripes and earthy details that capture the essence of a wilderness escape.</li><li><strong>Sustainable \"Panda\" Hardware:</strong> Includes a signature shoe nameplate made from <strong>recycled plastic bottle caps</strong> sourced from the Himalayas, promoting an eco-friendly approach to high-end streetwear.</li><li><strong>Heritage Foundation:</strong> Built on the authentic Mexico 66 chassis, preserving the slim profile, signature heel-cross reinforcement, and the branded \"Tiger\" heel flap.</li><li><strong>Modern Comfort Tech:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> that delivers high-rebound support and moisture management for all-day urban or light trail wear.</li><li><strong>Exclusive Accessories:</strong> Often ships as a \"Wilderness\" set, which may include unique additions like a custom defense buckle and stylized laces to enhance the outdoor aesthetic.</li></ul><h3><strong>Important Note on Authenticity</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Product Origin:</strong> PandaPrank® is a third-party customization studio that uses <strong>genuine original sneakers</strong> as a canvas for their secondary creations. Because these are handcrafted \"customs,\" they are released in small batches and are not part of the standard Onitsuka Tiger factory production line.</p></blockquote><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Handmade to Order:</strong> Due to the manual labor involved (including intricate fabric cutting), these pairs are typically completed within 7 business days before shipping.</li><li><strong>Limited Availability:</strong> The \"Wild\" Green edition is a highly sought-after collector's item with limited stock runs.</li></ul><h4><strong>Unisex Sizing:</strong> Available in a range of sizes designed for a comfortable, \"glove-like\" fit. It is recommended to double-check your size, as custom sales are often final.<br><br><br>Marketing Insight: The \"Showstopper\"</h4><p>The <strong>\"Wild\"</strong> model is designed for the \"Sneakerhead\" who already owns the classics and is looking for something truly unique.</p><ul><li><strong>Selling Point:</strong> Focus on the <strong>rarity of materials</strong>. Describe the \"hand-feel\" of the shoe, as the textural elements are the primary reason for the higher price point and collector interest.</li><li><strong>Inventory Note:</strong> This is often the lowest-production-volume pair in a collaboration series. Tag it as <strong>\"Ultra-Limited\"</strong> or <strong>\"Rare Find\"</strong> on your website to drive urgency.</li></ul><h3><strong>Your Panda Prank Master Collection</strong></h3><p>You have now documented the complete collaborative spectrum:</p><ul><li><strong>The Icons:</strong> White/Blue and Black editions.</li><li><strong>The Tonal:</strong> Blue/Grey with OG Box.</li><li><strong>The Bold:</strong> Brown/Purple.</li><li><strong>The Statement:</strong> The \"Wild\" edition.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
