nforcement, and the iconic Tiger stripes.</li><li><strong>Premium Presentation:</strong> Typically ships in a limited-edition gift box and includes exclusive accessories like a \"PandaPrank defense buckle,\" extra laces, and a certificate of authenticity.</li><li><strong>Convertible Versatility:</strong> Many models in this collaboration use the \"Slip-On\" or \"Paraty\" variation, featuring a convertible heel cup that allows the shoe to be worn as either a sneaker or a slide.</li></ul><h3><strong>Important Note on Authenticity</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Product Origin:</strong> PandaPrank® is a third-party customization studio founded in 2020. They use <strong>genuine original sneakers</strong> as a canvas for their secondary creations. Because these are handcrafted \"customs\" rather than standard factory releases, ensure you are purchasing from verified partners to guarantee the quality of the underlying Onitsuka Tiger shoe.</p></blockquote><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Limited Availability:</strong> Due to the handcrafted nature of these shoes, they are released in small batches and are often sought after by collectors.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Many authorized custom retailers offer free standard delivery for these premium orders.</li><li><strong>Handmade Lead Times:</strong> As these involve manual labor and detailing, shipping times may be longer than standard retail orders.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
