p;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD \"Peacoat\" | 7A Premium Mens Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><br><strong>The Vintage Track Masterpiece in Deep Navy</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD in Peacoat Navy</strong> brings a refined, textural depth to the brand's premium Super Deluxe lineup. As captured in the product showcase, this edition steps away from standard flat leather to feature a sleek, high-density <strong>deep navy nylon-satin upper</strong> reinforced with velvety <strong>suede overlays</strong> on the toe box, lace stays, and heel counter.</p><p>The dark navy body is beautifully offset by structural <strong>silver-grey and black leather tiger stripes</strong> and finished with an iconic, rugged <strong>mustard-gum vintage toe bumper</strong>. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> perfectly replicates the ultra-slim silhouette, metal hardware accents, and upgraded comfort cushioning of the retail collectors' release.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality SD Build:</strong> A premium 1:1 replica meticulously engineered to mirror the exact lightweight profile, slim racing silhouette, and precise panel alignment of the Super Deluxe series.</li><li><strong>Mixed Material Satin &amp; Suede Upper:</strong> Combines a resilient, water-resistant <strong>navy satin-canvas base</strong> with premium <strong>navy suede overlays</strong> around the classic T-toe box and eyelet strip for a luxurious, textured aesthetic.</li><li><strong>High-Contrast Metallic &amp; Gum Accents:</strong> Features eye-catching <strong>silver-grey leather stripes</strong> outlined in dark charcoal, anchored by a retro-textured <strong>mustard-gum rubber toe cap</strong> and matching herringbone outsole.</li><li><strong>Upgraded SD Comfort Sole:</strong> True to the Super Deluxe blueprint, the low-profile sole is integrated with a dual-density, shock-absorbing <strong>FuzeGEL™ core</strong> to deliver superior cushion and rebound compared to standard flat models.</li><li><strong>Refined Metal Eyelet Detail:</strong> Features a signature <strong>polished silver top eyelet</strong> with premium navy athletic lacing, adding an upscale industrial finish to the classic track aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Classic Fold-Down Heel Flap:</strong> Retains the traditional crossed leather reinforcement panels at the heel counters, along with the iconic fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger flap</strong> at the collar.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo SD Series Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Super Deluxe Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 14,500 to Rs. 19,500 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400 (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Peacoat Navy Blue / Silver Grey / Gum / Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Satin-Canvas, Suede Panels &amp; High-Traction Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 SD collection is engineered with a <strong>distinctly narrow, form-fitting, and low-to-the-ground profile</strong>. If you have broad feet or usually wear a half-size, it is highly recommended to <strong>go one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to guarantee comfortable toe box room.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To preserve the mixed fabric and suede upper, avoid machine washing or soaking in water. Clean surface dust on the satin body with a damp microfiber cloth, and use a dedicated <strong>soft suede brush</strong> on the navy overlays. Store in a cool, dry area away from direct summer sunlight to prevent color fading.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
