p;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD \"Metropolis / Metropolis\" | 7A Premium Mens Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Urban Monochromatic Super Deluxe Icon</strong></h3><p>The <a href=\"https://google.com/search?q=ONITSUKA+TIGER+MEXICO+66+SD+METROPOLIS+8&amp;prds=headlineOfferDocid%3A1211361964632979564%2Cproductid%3A1211361964632979564%2Cpvo%3A38%2Cpvt%3Ahg&amp;ibp=oshop&amp;gemcid=c_9e3e4e1f88054e5a&amp;gemrid=r_3234bfb217594bf3&amp;pvo=38&amp;opi=103135050&amp;gl=IN&amp;hl=en&amp;noiga=1\">Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD Metropolis</a> introduces a sleek, industrial-inspired look to the brand's premium Super Deluxe (SD) lineup. Moving away from traditional high-contrast color palettes, this edition features a sophisticated <strong>monochromatic urban grey upper</strong> with matching tonal tiger stripes.</p><p>As a defining piece of the upgraded SD series, it drops standard styling in favor of specialized textiles and high-end cushioning. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> masterfully replicates the low-slung track chassis, signature raw-edged overlays, and advanced interior comfort tech that make this a versatile anchor for modern streetwear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality SD Variant Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 replica meticulously built to capture the elongated footprint and low racing profile of the Super Deluxe tier. Crafted with precise tonal stitching and premium panel alignments.</li><li><strong>Urban Metropolis Monochromatic Palette:</strong> Features a sleek <strong>Metropolis grey base</strong> with matching tonal grey racing stripes. This clean, industrial colorway serves as an excellent dark neutral that coordinates easily with raw denim, black joggers, or utilitarian cargo pants.</li><li><strong>Upgraded SD Impact Protection:</strong> True to the Super Deluxe blueprint, the midsole layer is engineered with an <strong>AMPLIFOAM™ heel wedge</strong> combined with a hidden <strong>gel-infused core</strong> for top-tier daily shock absorption and long-lasting underfoot comfort.</li><li><strong>Premium Rebound Footbed:</strong> Outfitted inside with a plush, contoured <strong>OrthoLite® X-40 sockliner</strong> that delivers high-rebound cushioning, responsive feedback, and excellent breathability for all-day city walking.</li><li><strong>Refined Metal Eyelets:</strong> The upper is accented by durable <strong>metal lacing eyelets</strong> and fitted with thin athletic laces, giving the classic track aesthetic a polished, premium finish.</li><li><strong>Classic Archive Accents:</strong> Preserves the signature crossed reinforcing panel construction at the heel, along with the iconic fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> at the collar.</li><li><strong>High-Grip Outsole:</strong> Sits on a thin, flexible, proprietary rubber blend outsole featuring an aggressive herringbone pattern for dependable urban traction.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo SD Series Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Super Deluxe Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 14,500 to Rs. 18,999</strong> (Official Store &amp; Sourced Retail Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Metropolis Grey / Tonal Carbon</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Upper Materials, Suede Overlays &amp; High-Grip Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 SD collection is engineered with a <strong>distinctly narrow, form-fitting, and low-to-the-ground profile</strong>. If you have broad feet or usually wear a half-size, it is highly recommended to <strong>go one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to guarantee comfortable toe box room.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the specialized monochromatic grey finish, avoid using rigid wire brushes or aggressive chemical washes. Clean surface dust and dirt gently using a <strong>soft microfiber cloth or a dedicated soft sneaker brush</strong>. Store them in a cool, dry area away from direct summer sunlight to protect the upper structure and prevent color fading.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
