     [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | Triple Black</h2><h3><strong>Effortless Style Meets Heritage Design</strong></h3><p>Experience the perfect blend of classic aesthetics and modern convenience. The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"Triple Black\" reimagines the legendary 1960s trainer in a sleek, monochromatic \"stealth\" finish. By removing all color contrast, this edition emphasizes the silhouette's architectural lines and the premium texture of its materials, making it a sophisticated choice for both casual and semi-formal settings.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Iconic 1960s Silhouette:</strong> Maintains the slim, low-profile design of the original trainer debuted at the 1968 Olympic pre-trials, now optimized for the modern urban landscape.</li><li><strong>Monochromatic Stealth Aesthetic:</strong> Features a 100% blacked-out design, from the premium leather upper and Tiger stripes to the laces and the iconic heel-cross reinforcement.</li><li><strong>Premium Leather Construction:</strong> Crafted with high-quality, soft-grain leather and tonal suede overlays at the T-toe and heel, offering a luxury feel with lasting durability.</li><li><strong>Signature Heel Detail:</strong> Includes the classic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and X-shaped reinforcement, providing the stable fit and retro identity the Mexico 66 is known for.</li><li><strong>Engineered for Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> that offers superior shock absorption and moisture management for all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Traction:</strong> Features a slim, flexible black rubber outsole with a low-profile tread, providing a close-to-the-ground feel with reliable grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Versatile Wardrobe Staple:</strong> The Triple Black edition is a highly sought-after model due to its ability to pair seamlessly with denim, trousers, or athletic wear.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a complete range of unisex sizes to ensure a precise, glove-like fit for both men and women.</li><li><strong>Free Delivery:</strong> Enjoy complimentary shipping straight to your door on this essential all-black heritage sneaker.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
