Mexico 66 is known for.</li><li><strong>Engineered for Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> that offers superior shock absorption and moisture management for all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Traction:</strong> Features a slim, flexible black rubber outsole with a low-profile tread, providing a close-to-the-ground feel with reliable grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Versatile Wardrobe Staple:</strong> The Triple Black edition is a highly sought-after model due to its ability to pair seamlessly with denim, trousers, or athletic wear.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a complete range of unisex sizes to ensure a precise, glove-like fit for both men and women.</li><li><strong>Free Delivery:</strong> Enjoy complimentary shipping straight to your door on this essential all-black heritage sneaker.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
