;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 NM \"Wood Crepe\" | 7A Premium Nippon Made</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Artisanal Earth-Tone Masterpiece</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 NM (Nippon Made) in \"Wood Crepe\"</strong> is an exquisite expression of Japanese minimalism and craft. Known for its hand-dyed process, the Wood Crepe colorway offers a sophisticated, monochromatic look that highlights the natural grain of the premium leather. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> replicates the distinct \"hand-finished\" texture of the Nippon Made line, featuring a warm, sandy beige palette that feels more like a piece of crafted furniture than a standard sneaker.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Nippon Made (NM) Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 replica that captures the unique <strong>artisanal wrinkling</strong> and soft-tempered leather characteristic of the \"Nippon Made\" series. Unlike standard models, the NM version focuses on a richer, more supple leather feel.</li><li><strong>Monochromatic Wood Crepe Palette:</strong> A tonal \"Wood Crepe\" beige covers the entire upper, stripes, and overlays. This creates a high-fashion, \"quiet luxury\" aesthetic that pairs effortlessly with linen trousers, light-wash denim, or oversized neutral streetwear.</li><li><strong>Vintage Distressed Finish:</strong> The leather is treated to mimic the <strong>hand-dyeing and washing</strong> techniques used in the Tottori factory, resulting in a shoe that looks naturally aged and bespoke.</li><li><strong>Refined Dress-Last Silhouette:</strong> The NM variant utilizes a slimmer, more elegant shoe mold (last) that gives the foot a sharper, more formal profile compared to the sportier standard Mexico 66.</li><li><strong>High-Flex Gum Rubber Sole:</strong> Features a durable rubber outsole with the classic herringbone tread, color-matched to the Wood Crepe upper for a seamless, unified look.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Nippon\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger NM-Style Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Tonal Beige or Cream)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / NM Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 23,000 to Rs. 27,000</strong> (Official Nippon Made Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,900 to Rs. 4,900</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Wood Crepe / Wood Crepe / Sand</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Hand-Finished Supple Leather &amp; Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Dispatched from premium logistics hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Nippon Made (NM) series is known for a <strong>slimmer, more tapered fit</strong>. For the best experience with the soft leather, it is strongly recommended to <strong>order a full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> The Wood Crepe color is light and can show stains. Use a <strong>soft horsehair brush</strong> for daily cleaning. To protect the hand-finished leather, apply a <strong>water and stain repellent spray</strong> before the first wear. Avoid using harsh chemical cleaners, as they may alter the delicate \"Wood Crepe\" pigment.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
