, natural suede</strong>, and high-quality fibers to create a durable and textured monochromatic finish.</li><li><strong>Advanced Cushioning:</strong> Replicates the original's focus on comfort with an <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> and a responsive midsole for better impact absorption during urban commutes.</li><li><strong>Subtle Branding:</strong> Signature Tiger stripes are integrated into the side panels through tonal stitching, maintaining the minimalist \"Full White\" vibe.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Depending on seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 10)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>Inspired by 1183B969-101</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Fast delivery to major cities (Delhi, Mumbai, Surat, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Usually within <strong>24 to 48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Most 7A sellers offer COD. A small advance \"token\" fee (Rs. 200 to 500) may be required to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Sclaw Low has a <strong>snug, glove-like fit</strong> due to the sock-integrated tongue. For those with standard feet, stay true to size. If you have wide feet or prefer a roomier feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9). To clean the \"Full White\" finish, use a soft-bristled brush and mild detergent; avoid machine washing to preserve the structural integrity of the clawed sole.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
