p;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Beige / Light Yellow / Sage\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Soft Pastel Heritage Refresh</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 in \"Beige / Light Yellow / Sage\"</strong> is a breath of fresh air for the iconic 1966 silhouette. Moving away from bold primaries, this colorway utilizes a calming \"Birch\" beige base with <strong>Light Yellow and Sage Green</strong> tiger stripes. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition is perfect for those who want the classic track look in a softer, \"cottage-core\" or minimalist aesthetic that pairs beautifully with light linens and summer pastels.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>supple natural leather upper</strong>. The construction maintains the original's ultra-slim profile and signature lightweight feel.</li><li><strong>Calming Pastel Palette:</strong> The <strong>Beige (Birch)</strong> leather body is accented by a unique combination of <strong>Light Yellow and Sage Green</strong> stripes. This muted trio offers a sophisticated alternative to the standard tricolor, making it highly versatile for spring and summer rotations.</li><li><strong>Premium Suede Reinforcements:</strong> Features the iconic <strong>T-toe overlay</strong> and heel cross in tonal beige suede, providing structural durability and a high-end textural contrast.</li><li><strong>Flexible Low-Profile Sole:</strong> Equipped with a thin, cream-colored rubber outsole with the classic <strong>herringbone tread pattern</strong> for a \"barefoot\" urban walking experience and reliable grip.</li><li><strong>Heritage Comfort:</strong> Includes an <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> for moisture management and all-day comfort, along with the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Pastel\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Cream or Sage)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 11,500 to Rs. 14,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Beige / Light Yellow / Sage Green</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Leather &amp; Suede Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> <strong>3?5 working days</strong> for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>slim and narrow-fit design</strong>. If you have wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep the light beige and yellow looking crisp, avoid wearing them in muddy conditions. Clean the leather with a <strong>damp microfiber cloth</strong> and use a <strong>suede eraser</strong> for the T-toe. Applying a <strong>water-repellent spray</strong> before the first wear is highly recommended to prevent stains.</p></blockquote><p>One popular version of this aesthetic is the Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Birch/Sage, which emphasizes the earthy green tones. For a slightly different take on the pastel theme, the Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Birch/Yellow offers a brighter, sunnier look while maintaining the classic beige base.</p></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
