>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> that delivers high-rebound support and moisture management for extended wear.</li><li><strong>Slim Low-Profile Sole:</strong> Features a flat rubber outsole with a reliable traction pattern, perfect for daily casual use.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>New Arrival / Limited Edition:</strong> This specific colorway (Product Code: 1183A201.118) is part of the latest seasonal collections.</li><li><strong>Unisex Sizing:</strong> Available in a full range of sizes; it is recommended to measure your foot for the best \"glove-like\" fit.</li><li><strong>Fast Delivery:</strong> Benefit from convenient shipping options and flexible returns on this heritage-inspired model.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
