el-cross for added structural stability.</li><li><strong>Heritage Design Elements:</strong> Includes the classic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the cross-stitched heel reinforcement that have defined the model for decades.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-wicking, <strong>cushioned insole</strong> designed to provide modern impact protection and all-day comfort for city walking.</li><li><strong>Ground-Hugging Traction:</strong> Features the traditional thin rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern for excellent flexibility and a reliable urban grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Standard Premium Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,900 to Rs. 3,500</strong> (Current 2026 market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11 / Men's)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183A201-111 (Reference)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are usually verified via WhatsApp and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order and prevent RTO (Return to Origin).</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. For men with standard or narrow feet, stay true to your Euro size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10) to avoid tightness across the midfoot. To keep them looking fresh, use a white leather cleaner for the upper and a soft, dry brush for the suede toe overlays; avoid using harsh detergents which can yellow the white leather over time.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
