    [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Cream/Green/Orange | Men's 7A Premium First Copy</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Vibrant Heritage Runner</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Cream Green Orange\"</strong> (also known as the Piquant Orange edition) is a celebrated colorway that perfectly balances retro sportiness with an earthy, organic palette. This <strong>7A Premium First Copy</strong> replica captures the slim, racing-inspired profile that debuted during the 1966 Olympic pre-trials. The soft cream leather base is sharply contrasted by deep forest green and vibrant orange stripes, making it a versatile statement piece for both casual and semi-casual urban wear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Leather Upper:</strong> Crafted with high-grade synthetic or split leather that provides the signature soft, flexible feel and slim silhouette of the original.</li><li><strong>Iconic Tri-Color Stripes:</strong> Features the legendary Tiger stripes in a dual-tone configuration?typically dark green vertical stripes with orange horizontal accents.</li><li><strong>Suede Toe &amp; Heel Reinforcement:</strong> Includes the classic \"T-toe\" cap in a matching cream or light grey suede and the cross-stitched heel reinforcement for that authentic heritage look.</li><li><strong>Signature Heel Flap:</strong> Retains the branded \"Tiger\" flap at the heel, allowing for easy on-off access while maintaining the 1960s track aesthetic.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Cushioning:</strong> Fitted with a high-rebound cushioned insole designed for moisture management and all-day walking comfort.</li><li><strong>Slim Traction Outsole:</strong> Features a thin, flexible rubber outsole with the classic herringbone tread pattern for a grounded, vintage feel.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct Article Tagging)</li><li>Branded Tissue Paper &amp; Care Card</li><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Carry Bag</li><li>Set of Flat Cotton Laces (Cream or White)</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>&nbsp;Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11 / Men's Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Cream / Dark Green / Piquant Orange</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183A201-116 (Reference)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Stocked in premium hubs like Delhi, Surat, and Mumbai; orders are usually dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"token\" fee of <strong>Rs. 200?500</strong> to confirm the shipment.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an additional 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>very slim and narrow profile</strong>. While it is generally true to size for narrow feet, if you have broad feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9) for a comfortable fit. To clean, use a soft-bristled brush with mild sneaker soap for the leather parts and a specialized suede eraser for the toe cap.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
