;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 NM \"Slate Grey\" | 7A Premium Nippon Made</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Artisanal Heritage Peak</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 NM (Nippon Made) in \"Slate Grey\"</strong> represents the absolute pinnacle of the Mexico 66 series. The \"Nippon Made\" line is famous for its \"labor of love\" approach, featuring hand-dyed leathers and artisanal construction. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> meticulously recreates the \"NM\" aesthetic?characterized by a more rugged, vintage-processed leather look and a sophisticated Slate Grey palette that feels both industrial and high-fashion.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Nippon Made (NM) Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 replica that captures the unique <strong>distressed leather finish</strong> specific to the NM series. The leather is treated to feel softer and look more \"lived-in\" compared to the standard smooth leather models.</li><li><strong>Slate Grey &amp; Silver Palette:</strong> A moody, monochromatic masterpiece. The deep \"Slate\" charcoal base is paired with tonal or slightly metallic silver Tiger stripes, making it an ideal match for monochrome \"all-black\" or \"tech-wear\" outfits.</li><li><strong>Hand-Finished Aesthetic:</strong> Replicates the signature NM details, including slightly visible grain on the leather and a more prominent, <strong>textured suede T-toe</strong>.</li><li><strong>Vintage Slim Silhouette:</strong> Maintains the ultra-low-profile track shoe shape of 1966. The NM variant often features a slightly more tapered toe box for a sharper, more modern appearance.</li><li><strong>Superior Flex Outsole:</strong> Built with a premium, high-grip rubber outsole featuring the classic herringbone pattern, offering maximum flexibility and a lightweight \"second-skin\" feel.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Nippon\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger NM-Style Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Grey or Black)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / NM Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 22,000 to Rs. 26,000</strong> (Official Nippon Made Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,800 to Rs. 4,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Slate Grey / Charcoal / Silver</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Processed Leather &amp; Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from high-end footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3-5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Nippon Made (NM) series is known for a <strong>very narrow and snug fit</strong>. Because the leather is processed for a vintage look, it has a slightly different stretch profile. It is strongly recommended to <strong>order a full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9) for the best experience.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> The Slate Grey finish is excellent at hiding dirt, but to maintain the \"NM\" texture, avoid liquid cleaners. Use a soft horsehair brush to remove dust and a specialized leather conditioner to keep the processed leather supple. A water-repellent spray is essential to protect the deep grey tones.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
