n functions as a highly versatile anchor for olive utility cargos, off-white linen pants, or raw denim.</li><li><strong>Modern Platform Midsole:</strong> Engineered with a raised <strong>platform rubber wedge midsole</strong>, updating the vintage 1960s training layout to align with modern street-style volume while softening heavy city-walking impacts.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Footbed Tech:</strong> Includes a dense, high-elasticity <strong>OrthoLite-style internal footbed</strong> designed for long-lasting step-in comfort and effective moisture management.</li><li><strong>Archive Detailing:</strong> Features the traditional stitched <strong>T-toe suede overlay</strong> for toe-box protection and structural contrast, along with the signature fold-down heel flap.</li><li><strong>Full \"Platform Deluxe\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger PF Premium Box (With Brand-Accurate Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Graphic Product Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks (Cream or Green)</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Platform Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 15,500 to Rs. 16,500</strong> (Official Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Beige / Bronze Green / Grained Brown</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Grained Calf Leather &amp; Soft Suede Accents</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Quality checked and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from prominent premium replica logistics centers in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via expedited air couriers like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported. Most top-tier 7A distributors request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300–500</strong> upfront to secure shipment processing.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant 10% cash discount on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
