ouette:</strong> Maintains the 1970s racing DNA with a thin, low-profile midsole that provides a \"barefoot\" urban walking experience without the bulk of modern sneakers.</li><li><strong>Signature Knobby Outsole:</strong> Features the classic <strong>spiked rubber outsole</strong> design. The specialized tread pattern provides excellent multi-surface grip and a unique visual texture that wraps slightly around the toe and heel.</li><li><strong>Breathable Comfort:</strong> Includes a moisture-wicking <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> and a padded collar, ensuring the shoe remains comfortable for all-day city commuting.</li><li><strong>Full \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Socks (Cream or Brown)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 8,999 to Rs. 10,500</strong> (Official Store Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,499 to Rs. 3,999</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Mineral Brown / Cream / Birch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Nylon &amp; Soft Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped from regional centers in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery Timeline:</strong> Expect delivery in <strong>3–5 working days</strong> for metro cities via premium couriers like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available; most sellers require a small advance <strong>\"security\" deposit of Rs. 300–500</strong> to confirm the booking.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Serrano features a <strong>very slim and narrow silhouette</strong>. For those with wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9). For narrow feet, stay true to size.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To preserve the Mineral Brown suede, avoid using heavy liquid cleaners. Use a <strong>soft dry brush</strong> for the suede overlays and a <strong>damp microfiber cloth</strong> for the nylon panels.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
