nts:</strong> Includes the iconic <strong>T-toe overlay</strong> and heel-cross reinforcement in matching beige or brown suede, adding a layer of durability and premium texture.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a slim, flexible gum rubber outsole with the traditional <strong>herringbone tread pattern</strong>. This design offers a lightweight \"ground feel\" and reliable grip for city commuting.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Features the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> for moisture management and all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Heritage\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Brown or Beige)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 11,500 to Rs. 14,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Beige / Chocolate Brown / Gum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Leather &amp; Suede Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> <strong>3?5 working days</strong> for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>slim and narrow-fit design</strong>. If you have wider feet or prefer a slightly roomier feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To preserve the rich chocolate brown pigment, avoid cleaning with harsh soaps. Use a <strong>soft damp cloth</strong> for the beige leather and a <strong>suede brush</strong> for the T-toe. Applying a <strong>water-repellent spray</strong> before the first wear is essential to prevent the light beige panels from staining.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
