  [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Green Safari Khaki\" | Men's 7A Premium Quality</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Earthy Explorer Aesthetic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Green Safari Khaki\"</strong> (also known as the \"Hiking Green\" colorway) is a rugged, nature-inspired take on the slim 1966 silhouette. Perfect for those who prefer an earthy, utilitarian palette, this <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition swaps the traditional bright tricolors for a deep forest green upper and muted khaki stripes. It's the ideal choice for an \"Outdoor Heritage\" look that pairs seamlessly with cargo pants, olive chinos, or raw denim.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Construction:</strong> Features a high-grade synthetic leather or soft-grain leather upper (depending on the batch) that mirrors the original's durability and sleek, low-profile shape.</li><li><strong>Safari Khaki Tiger Stripes:</strong> The iconic lateral stripes are rendered in a muted \"Safari Khaki,\" providing a sophisticated contrast against the \"Hiking Green\" base.</li><li><strong>Suede Toe &amp; Heel Overlays:</strong> Includes the characteristic T-toe reinforcement in tonal green or khaki suede for added texture and authentic vintage appeal.</li><li><strong>Signature Heel-Cross Reinforcement:</strong> Features the classic \"X\" stitched heel part and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for maximum stability and a retro track-and-field finish.</li><li><strong>Flexible Low-Profile Outsole:</strong> Equipped with a thin, black or dark green rubber sole with a herringbone tread pattern, offering a lightweight \"ground feel\" and reliable grip.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU: 1183A872-027 / 1183A148-300)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Olive or Khaki)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Copy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Hiking Green / Safari Khaki / Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183A148.300</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major sneaker hubs like <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"booking fee\" of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, slim-fit design</strong>. If you have wider feet or prefer a more relaxed feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 9.5 or 10).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> The \"Hiking Green\" leather is quite resilient to visible dirt. Use a soft-bristled brush for the suede toe cap and a damp cloth for the leather panels. Avoid using harsh chemicals as they can dull the rich forest green pigment.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
