el-cross for structural reinforcement and retro texture.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Design:</strong> Modeled on the original 1966 racing last, providing a sleek, grounded silhouette that pairs perfectly with chinos, denim, or smart-casual trousers.</li><li><strong>Superior Underfoot Feel:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> designed to provide all-day comfort and shock absorption for city walking.</li><li><strong>Herringbone Traction Outsole:</strong> Features a thin, flexible rubber outsole with the traditional herringbone tread for reliable grip and durability.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Luxury Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Standard 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Approx. 350g–450g per shoe (Extremely lightweight)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate drawer-style box</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metro cities; 5–7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?200–?500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>notoriously slim and narrow cut</strong>.6 If you have standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) for a comfortable fit. To maintain the metallic gold stripes, wipe them gently with a soft microfiber cloth; avoid harsh cleaners or stiff brushes, which can cause the gold finish to peel or dull over time.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
