tsole:</strong> Equipped with the signature tan gum rubber outsole, providing superior indoor grip and that iconic 90s \"court shoe\" look.</li><li><strong>Retro Branding:</strong> Includes the authentic Asics tiger stripes in bold Black against a crisp White base, along with period-accurate tongue and heel branding.</li><li><strong>Refined Interior:</strong> Comes with an updated heel counter and moisture-managing sockliner to ensure a premium, comfortable feel for all-day wear.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Retro Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,800 to Rs. 4,200 (Typical 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Black / Gum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1203A452.001 (Reference)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Most 7A vendors process and ship within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> from hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metros; 5–7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. A small advance \"token\" fee (?200–?500) is standard to confirm shipping.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Skyhand OG is built on a <strong>slimmer court last</strong>. While it generally fits true to size, the toe box can feel \"slightly tight\" due to the suede overlays. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 9.5 or 10) for a more comfortable casual fit. To clean, use a suede brush for the grey overlays and a damp cloth for the synthetic leather; avoid water saturation to preserve the foam cushioning.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"as-ics Skyhand","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
