repaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 SD is known for having a <strong>slightly narrower and longer last</strong> than the standard 66. While it fits true to size for most, if you have wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10) to accommodate the more structured build. To maintain the \"White/Blue/Yellow\" finish, use a leather cleaner for the white panels and a soft damp cloth for the stripes; avoid soaking the shoe to preserve the specialized SD cushioning.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
