itage Technical Details:</strong> Retains the signature T-toe reinforcement, cross-stitched heel parts, and the iconic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>Superior Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> for responsive cushioning and all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Thin Track Outsole:</strong> A low-profile rubber sole with a herringbone tread pattern that provides a flexible, grounded feel.</li></ul><h3><strong>What's in the \"Full Kit\"?</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Full Kit</strong> designation ensures a complete premium package, typically including:</p><ul><li><strong>Brand-Accurate Box:</strong> Premium Onitsuka Tiger branded packaging.</li><li><strong>Branded Dust Bag:</strong> For protective storage and travel.</li><li><strong>Authenticity Accessories:</strong> Replicated brand tags, care cards, and sometimes a branded carry bag.</li><li><strong>Additional Laces:</strong> Often includes an extra set of laces (typically in a contrasting color) for a customized look.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Full Kit Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 4,500 (Full Kit premium in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Men's Sizing / Unisex Profile</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Fast delivery to major hubs (Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore, Surat) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Usually within <strong>24 hours</strong> of confirmation.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 2?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?200??500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>slim, narrow profile</strong>. If you have standard feet, stay true to size. For those with <strong>wide feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10) to avoid tightness across the ball of the foot. To clean, use a damp cloth for the black leather and a specialized sneaker cleaner for the white stripes to maintain the sharp contrast.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
