heel. This design provides \"smooth support\" and better grip while pivoting your foot on car pedals.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Mix:</strong> Constructed with a clean, <strong>smooth matte leather</strong> base, often accented with Alcantara (synthetic suede) on the toe and heel areas for a luxury car interior feel.</li><li><strong>High-Cushion Insole:</strong> Unlike the very flat feel of the original 66, the Driving model includes an <strong>upgraded comfort footbed</strong> designed to support the feet during extended wear.</li><li><strong>Embroidered Stripes:</strong> Features the signature Onitsuka Tiger stripes executed in tonal black embroidery, giving the shoe a sophisticated, textured look.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Driving Series)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,800 (Typical 7A pricing in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sole Type</strong></td><td>Slim, driving-specific rubber outsole</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipped via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong> from major hubs (Surat, Delhi, Mumbai).</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Usually ships within <strong>24 hours</strong> of order confirmation.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. A small advance \"token\" fee (?200??500) may be required to confirm the order and prevent returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Driving has an <strong>ultra-slim, narrow profile</strong> meant to fit like a second skin. It is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) to ensure comfort, especially if you have wider feet. To maintain the \"Triple Black\" look, wipe the leather with a damp cloth and use a black leather conditioner to keep the color deep and prevent the leather from cracking.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
