_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | Cacao Brown (Men's 7A Premium First Copy)</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Rich Earth-Tone Essential</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"Cacao Brown\" is a sophisticated departure from the standard bright colors, offering a warm, deep chocolate aesthetic. This <strong>7A Master Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica for men captures the premium \"Cacao/Cream\" look, featuring a dark espresso-brown base accented by soft cream Tiger stripes. It?s an excellent choice for those who want a heritage runner that feels high-fashion and pairs effortlessly with chinos, denim, or earthy-toned autumn wear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A top-tier 1:1 replica that accurately reproduces the ultra-slim, streamlined racing profile and the signature \"barefoot\" lightweight feel.</li><li><strong>Rich Cacao Palette:</strong> Features a <strong>Deep Cacao Brown</strong> upper with contrasting <strong>Cream or Birch</strong> Tiger stripes for a sharp, organic finish.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Mix:</strong> Crafted from soft, textured leather with <strong>tonal dark brown suede</strong> overlays on the T-toe and heel-cross for structural durability and a high-end feel.</li><li><strong>Heritage Design Details:</strong> Includes the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in Cacao Brown for an authentic 1966 look.</li><li><strong>Urban Comfort Insole:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned footbed</strong> to ensure modern comfort for daily walking.</li><li><strong>Thin Traction Outsole:</strong> Features a flexible rubber outsole with the traditional herringbone tread pattern for excellent ground feel and urban grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Earth Series)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,600</strong> (Current 2026 market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11 / Men's)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183C102-200 (Reference)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. For men with standard or narrow feet, stay true to your Euro size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10) for better midfoot comfort. To maintain the \"Cacao\" look, use a soft, dry brush for the suede toe and a damp cloth for the leather; avoid using wet wipes on the dark brown leather as it can sometimes cause minor scuffing to show more easily.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
