el Pull-Tab:</strong> Features the iconic black webbing with the distinctive red dotted center-stitching, a hallmark of the V2?s original silhouette.</li><li><strong>Smoky Translucent Midsole:</strong> The ribbed TPU cage is finished in a semi-translucent charcoal black, protecting the white Boost core while offering superior grip.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Yeezy 350 Branded Box (Correct CP9652 SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>StockX or Goat-style Authentication Tag &amp; Certificate</li><li>Branded Crew Socks (Triple Black)</li><li>Adidas/Yeezy Dust Bag &amp; Premium Carry Bag</li><li>Standard Round Black Laces</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>Semi-UA / 7A+ (Master Copy Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 46 (UK 4 to 12 / Unisex)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Core Black / Solar Red (Bred)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>CP9652</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Surat Hub Dispatch:</strong> Most premium stock is dispatched directly from <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. For high-tier Semi-UA pairs, most sellers require a <strong>Rs. 500</strong> advance \"security\" fee to verify the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10?15% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The \"Bred\" 350 V2 has a <strong>very snug, reinforced toe box</strong>. It is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> from your standard UK size (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10). To keep them fresh, use a soft sneaker brush for the knit and a damp microfibre cloth for the translucent midsole.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Adida_s Yeezy","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
