ole with a herringbone tread, providing the classic 1960s \"grounded\" walking experience.</li><li><strong>Heritage Heel-Cross Flap:</strong> Includes the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the reinforced \"X\" stitching on the heel for stability and authentic retro detailing.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; \"Blue Ice\" Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Invisible Socks (White or Light Blue)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>&nbsp;Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Blue Ice / Silver (Heel Flap)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183C102.100 (Blue Ice Variant)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major sneaker hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>narrow, slim-fit design</strong>. For men with wider feet or those who prefer a more relaxed fit, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, go for a UK 9.5).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep the \"Blue Ice\" looking crisp, use a soft-bristled brush for the suede toe cap and a damp cloth for the white leather. Avoid wearing them in heavy rain to prevent the light blue stripes from picking up water stains or mud.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
