ite its vintage look, the interior is pure modern tech. It replicates the <strong>dual-density fuzeGEL? midsole</strong> and <strong>AMPLIFOAM?</strong> heel wedge, combined with an <strong>OrthoLite? X-40</strong> style insole for high-rebound comfort.</li><li><strong>Refined Accents:</strong> Includes the SD-signature metal eyelets and ultra-slim waxed laces, giving the shoe a more sophisticated, \"dressed-up\" profile than the standard Mexico 66.</li><li><strong>Vintage Gum Outsole:</strong> Features a specialized rubber compound in a classic gum-tone, designed for superior urban grip while completing the retro look.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"SD Vin\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger SD Series Branded Box (Correct SKU 1183C015-205)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Cream or Brown)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / SD Vin Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 18,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 5,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Clay Canyon / Cream / Brown</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Special Feature</strong></td><td>Distressed/Vintage Leather Finish</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The SD series is built on a <strong>narrower, longer last</strong>. Due to the vintage-treated leather, the upper may feel slightly firmer initially but will mold to your foot over time. It is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Because of the specialized vintage finish, <strong>avoid using heavy liquid cleaners</strong> or soaps, as they may strip the aged texture. Use a dry, soft-bristled brush to remove dust. A neutral leather conditioner can be used sparingly to keep the leather supple without changing the Clay Canyon color.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
