ays for a durable and multi-textured finish.</li><li><strong>Ortholite-Style Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned <strong>moisture-wicking insole</strong> and a supported arch area to reduce foot strain during long urban walks.</li><li><strong>Neutral Versatility:</strong> The Birch/Peacoat palette provides a sophisticated, \"understated luxury\" look that pairs easily with denim, joggers, or even chinos.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (High-End Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,500 (Depending on seller batch)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (UK 3 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ideal For</strong></td><td>Unisex (Men &amp; Women)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Typically includes a brand-accurate Onitsuka Tiger drawer box</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Pan-India Coverage:</strong> Fast shipping is available to all major cities (Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore, Surat) via premium couriers like <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24?48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small \"commitment fee\" (Rs. 200? Rs. 500) to confirm the order, with the rest payable at delivery.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 5?10% discount for payments via UPI/Bank Transfer.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Tracking:</strong> A live tracking ID is provided via WhatsApp or SMS once the parcel is scanned by the courier.</li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The EDR 78 has a <strong>snug, athletic fit</strong> and can feel a tad narrower in the toe section compared to the Mexico 66. For maximum comfort, it is highly</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
