-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 x PandaPrank® | Brown/Purple</h2><h3><strong>A Fusion of Art and Heritage</strong></h3><p>Experience a bold, creative reimagining of a footwear legend. The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 x PandaPrank®</strong> is a high-profile custom collaboration that fuses the iconic 1960s silhouette with the avant-garde artistry of the <strong>PandaPrank®</strong> creative studio. This limited-edition \"Brown/Purple\" series offers an earthy yet vibrant aesthetic, combining rich, chocolatey tones with electric purple accents for a truly unique statement piece.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Artisanal Customization:</strong> Each pair is meticulously handcrafted by skilled artisans, utilizing specialized fabric-cutting and color-application techniques that distinguish it from standard retail models.</li><li><strong>Bold Earthy Palette:</strong> Features a premium <strong>Brown</strong> leather or suede base, sharply contrasted by <strong>Purple</strong> Tiger stripes and tonal detailing, creating a sophisticated yet playful look.</li><li><strong>Sustainable Craftsmanship:</strong> Includes a signature shoe nameplate made from <strong>recycled plastic bottle caps</strong> sourced from the Himalayas, reflecting PandaPrank's commitment to ecological storytelling.</li><li><strong>Heritage Foundation:</strong> Built on the authentic Mexico 66 chassis, preserving the slim profile, heel-cross reinforcement, and the iconic Tiger stripes.</li><li><strong>Unique Presentation:</strong> Typically ships in a limited-edition original shoe box and may include exclusive accessories like extra laces or a certificate of authenticity.</li><li><strong>Comfort &amp; Grip:</strong> Maintains the classic Mexico 66 performance features, including a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite™ inner sole</strong> and a thin, flexible rubber outsole.</li></ul><h3><strong>Important Note on Authenticity</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Product Origin:</strong> PandaPrank® is a third-party customization studio that uses <strong>genuine original sneakers</strong> as a canvas for their secondary artistic creations. Because these are handcrafted \"customs,\" they are released in small batches and are not part of the standard factory lineup.</p></blockquote><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Limited Release:</strong> This specific Brown/Purple custom colorway is part of a restricted production run, making it a high-value item for collectors.</li><li><strong>Unisex Sizing:</strong> Available in a range of sizes designed for a comfortable, glove-like fit.</li><li><strong>Global Delivery:</strong> Many authorized luxury and custom retailers offer shipping with tracked delivery for these premium pieces.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
