d all-day support.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Grip:</strong> Features a slim, flexible rubber outsole with a patterned tread for reliable traction on various surfaces.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Special Edition Pricing:</strong> Limited-time promotional rates are currently available on this Cream/Olive Green edition.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a range of unisex sizes, typically fitting true to size for both men and women.</li><li><strong>Easy Delivery:</strong> Benefit from convenient shipping and flexible return policies when ordering this special heritage model.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onituska Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
