Row: [{"productId":110382,"productName":"Onitsuk_a Tiger Mexico 66 Year of the Snake Mens First Copy Special Edition D-1917","productDateCreation":"2026-09-26 20:38:40","productLastUpdated":1795157213951,"productPrice":null,"productPriceWithoutDiscount":null,"productOriginalPrice":2299,"productFetchedFrom":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com","productUrl":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com/products/SKU1790433621573804","featuredimg":"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780327438_LnXFBD.webp","imageUrl":"[\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780327438_LnXFBD.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780327434_d4SDLV.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780327435_gEk8d1.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780327436_tam8Ep.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780327437_mWzagZ.webp\"]","videoUrl":"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/videos/1779022126_Qs7R3L.mp4","productShortDescription":"<div class=\"\n      [&amp;_ul]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ul]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ul]:text-left\n      [&amp;_ol]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ol]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ol]:text-left\n      [&amp;_a]:text-blue-600\n      [&amp;_a]:underline\n      hover:[&amp;_a]:text-blue-800\n      [&amp;_p]:text-left [&amp;_p]:opacity-90\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-left [&amp;_h1]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-left [&amp;_h2]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-left [&amp;_h3]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-left [&amp;_h4]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-left [&amp;_h5]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-left [&amp;_h6]:mb-2\n\n      /* Responsive heading and paragraph font sizes, margin below */\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-2xl md:[&amp;_h1]:text-3xl [&amp;_h1]:font-bold [&amp;_h1]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-xl md:[&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-lg md:[&amp;_h3]:text-xl [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h3]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-base md:[&amp;_h4]:text-lg [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | \"Year of the Snake\" (Special Edition)</strong></h2><h3><strong>A Celebration of Heritage &amp; Prosperity</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Year of the Snake\"</strong> is a special edition released to commemorate the 2025 Lunar New Year. This <strong>7A Premium Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica captures the intricate, symbolic design of the \"zodiac\" release, which is inspired by family prosperity and good fortune. It blends the iconic 1966 track silhouette with unique textures and patterns that mimic the graceful intertwining of snakes, making it a high-value collector's piece for the modern sneaker enthusiast.</p><h3><strong>Key Special Edition Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Snake-Textured Aesthetic:</strong> Features a premium <strong>snake-textured leather upper</strong> or embossed graphics on the Tiger stripes that celebrate the Chinese New Year theme.</li><li><strong>Minimalistic Palette:</strong> Built on a sophisticated <strong>Cream-colored</strong> smooth cow leather base with high-contrast <strong>Two-Tone Red</strong> accents, symbolizing luck and vitality.</li><li><strong>Intricate Detailing:</strong> Incorporates traditional Chinese knotting-inspired patterns and delicate red-and-cream stitching for a sense of exclusivity.</li><li><strong>Luxury Materials:</strong> The toe area features <strong>casual impression cow suede</strong>, adding a soft, premium texture to the reinforced T-toe design.</li><li><strong>Custom Styling Options:</strong> Typically includes <strong>bold wide shoelaces</strong> for a unique parallel-laced appearance, often bundled with multicolored spare laces.</li><li><strong>Comfort Engineering:</strong> Equipped with an <strong>OrthoLite sockliner</strong> for superior moisture management and all-day cushioning.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Special Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,999 (Current Indian 7A Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Motif</strong></td><td>2025 Year of the Snake (Zodiac Series)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Smooth Leather / Suede / Synthetic Overlays</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes special edition Onitsuka Tiger box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipped via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong> from major distribution hubs.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically confirmed and shipped within <strong>24?48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for smaller regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"booking fee\" (Rs. 200?Rs. 500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>slim, low-profile fit</strong>. For this special edition, it is recommended to <strong>order your standard UK size</strong>. However, if you have wider feet, consider <strong>sizing up by one</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10) as the premium textured leather can be slightly firmer initially. To preserve the \"Snake\" textures and white/red contrast, clean only with a damp soft cloth and a specialized leather conditioner; avoid harsh chemicals or machine washing.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
