;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><p>helo</p><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD \"Birch / Peacoat\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Super Deluxe Heritage Evolution</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD in \"Birch / Peacoat\"</strong> is the \"Super Deluxe\" (SD) upgrade of the original 1966 icon. While maintaining the classic cream-base and navy-stripe aesthetic, the SD model is re-engineered for superior modern comfort. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition replicates the refined silhouette and advanced cushioning of the SD line, making it the perfect choice for those who love the vintage look but demand a softer, more supportive feel for all-day walking.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality SD Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring <strong>enhanced leather quality</strong> and a slimmer, more refined toe box. It captures the \"Super Deluxe\" focus on luxury materials and better structural integrity.</li><li><strong>Signature Birch &amp; Peacoat Palette:</strong> The <strong>Birch (Cream)</strong> leather upper is paired with deep <strong>Peacoat Navy</strong> tiger stripes and subtle red accents. This is widely considered the most iconic and versatile colorway in the brand's history.</li><li><strong>Advanced fuzeGEL? Technology:</strong> Replicates the SD-exclusive <strong>gel-infused midsole</strong> in the heel, providing significantly better shock absorption than the standard Mexico 66 models.</li><li><strong>Moisture-Wicking OrthoLite Insole:</strong> Equipped with a high-rebound, breathable insole that ensures your feet stay cool and cushioned throughout the day.</li><li><strong>Slim-Profile Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features a durable, low-profile rubber sole with the traditional herringbone tread for reliable urban traction and a sleek look.</li><li><strong>Full \"Super Deluxe\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger SD-Style Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Navy or White)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / SD Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 14,500 to Rs. 19,500</strong> (Official SD Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,600 to Rs. 4,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Birch / Peacoat / Red</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium High-Grain Leather &amp; Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major logistics hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Typically requires a small <strong>Rs. 300?500 advance</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and extra discounts for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The SD model has a slightly more tailored fit. It is recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 8.5) to accommodate the thicker OrthoLite insole while maintaining the slim silhouette.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the premium leather, use a <strong>leather conditioner</strong> every few months. For the birch panels, a damp microfiber cloth works perfectly. Apply a <strong>water-repellent spray</strong> immediately to protect the birch tone from dust and stains.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+$UK@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
