oss stripes</strong> and detailing. It functions as a premium neutral that pairs effortlessly with raw selvage denim, casual off-white linen pants, or olive utility cargos.</li><li><strong>Modern Platform Midsole:</strong> Engineered with a slightly raised, <strong>thick platform rubber wedge midsole</strong> that yields excellent everyday impact absorption while updating the silhouette for current street-style trends.</li><li><strong>Upgraded Insole Comfort:</strong> Includes a dense, high-elasticity <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned footbed</strong> for reliable moisture management and step-in softness.</li><li><strong>Iconic Brand Details:</strong> Features the traditional stitched <strong>T-toe suede overlay</strong> for added toe-box structure and the vintage <strong>fold-down heel flap</strong> accented with classic branding.</li><li><strong>Full \"Platform Deluxe\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger PF Premium Box (With Brand-Accurate Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks (White or Cream)</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Platform Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 15,500 to Rs. 16,500</strong> (Official Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Birch / Indigo Navy / Peacoat / Off White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Grained Calf Leather &amp; Soft Suede Overlays</td></tr></tbody></tabl