replica featuring a <strong>supple core leather upper</strong> layered with durable overlays. It beautifully preserves the authentic ultra-slim, low-profile racing stance.</li><li><strong>Moody Industrial Palette:</strong> The deep <strong>Gunmetal metallic base</strong> wraps from the toe cap through the side walls, anchored cleanly by high-gloss <strong>Black leather racing stripes</strong>. It acts as a versatile dark neutral that coordinates perfectly with washed black denim, grey cargo trousers, or minimal streetwear fits.</li><li><strong>Traditional Low-Profile Sole:</strong> Sits on a thin, highly flexible <strong>black rubber midsole</strong> and outsole. It replicates the vintage track spike feel that keeps the foot closer to the ground for a lightweight urban commute.</li><li><strong>Classic Archive Accents:</strong> Built with the iconic stitched <strong>T-toe overlay</strong> for structural integrity, slim tonal athletic laces, and the signature fold-down <strong>branded heel flap</strong>.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Insole Comfort:</strong> Outfitted with a dense <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned footbed</strong> designed for essential daily impact protection, shape retention, and effective moisture control.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks (Black or Grey)</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Heritage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500 to Rs. 16,500</strong> (Official Sourced &amp; Retail Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Gunmetal Grey / Black / Noir</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Grained Metallic Leather &amp; Durable Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><br>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Quality evaluated and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium replica logistics hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via expedited air couriers like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant 10% cash discount on checkouts settled via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
