d field roots.</li><li><strong>Modern Comfort Engineering:</strong> Equipped with Onitsuka Tiger's proprietary soft insoles that provide firm heel support and all-day comfort for urban use.</li><li><strong>Supple Lightweight Sole:</strong> Sits on a flexible rubber outsole designed for a lightweight feel and reliable grip on city surfaces.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose the Delegation?</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Mexico 66</strong></th><th><strong>Mexico Delegation</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Usually Smooth Leather</td><td>Premium Soft Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Branding</strong></td><td>Standard Tiger Stripes</td><td>Stripes + \"MEXICO\" Side Mark</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Insole</strong></td><td>Standard OrthoLite?</td><td>Athletics Track Graphic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Historical Role</strong></td><td>1966 Pre-Trial Design</td><td>1968 Olympic Parade Shoe</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Shipping</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Unisex Men's Sizing:</strong> Listed in US Men's/Unisex sizes. Women should refer to the size guide and typically select <strong>1.5 sizes down</strong> from their standard US Women's size (e.g., a Men's 7 is a Women's 8.5).</li><li><strong>Fast Delivery:</strong> Available with standard shipping options from official Onitsuka Tiger stores and select luxury retail partners.</li><li><strong>Authenticity:</strong> This model is commonly identified by style codes such as <strong>1183C344</strong> or <strong>D6E7L</strong> for the grey heritage editions.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
