-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><i><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Vintage | White/Pale Green (Men's 7A First Copy)</strong></i></h2><h3><strong>The Timeless Retro Revival</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Vintage</strong> in \"White/Pale Green\" is a masterful recreation of the classic training shoe that debuted in the 1960s. This <strong>7A Master Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica for men features a clean, off-white leather base accented by \"Pale Green\" (or Spinach/Cactus Green) Tiger stripes. The \"Vintage\" (VIN) treatment gives the shoe an authentic, slightly aged aesthetic, making it the perfect choice for those who want a heritage look that feels \"lived-in\" rather than starkly brand new.1</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica designed to mimic the slim, low-profile silhouette and the specific construction of the authentic VIN series.</li><li><strong>Vintage Aesthetic:</strong> Features a slightly off-white (Birch/Cream) leather upper with a subtle matte finish, paired with <strong>Pale Green</strong> side stripes for a soft, earthy contrast.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Construction:</strong> Crafted from high-grade leather with <strong>sand-colored suede</strong> overlays on the T-toe and heel-cross for structural stability and a vintage texture.</li><li><strong>Signature Design Details:</strong> Retains the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap, which adds to the classic '60s racing look.</li><li><strong>Lightweight Urban Comfort:</strong> Features an ultra-slim sole and a cushioned, moisture-wicking insole designed for all-day urban walking and casual wear.</li><li><strong>Flexible Traction Sole:</strong> Equipped with the traditional thin rubber outsole and herringbone tread pattern for a grounded feel and reliable urban grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Vintage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Standard 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11 / Men's)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Materials</strong></td><td>Core Leather / Suede / Rubber Outsole</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Most orders are processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs (Surat, Delhi, Mumbai).</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metro cities; 5–7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?200–?500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Vintage has a <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. For men with standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) for better comfort across the midfoot. To maintain the \"Vintage\" look, wipe the leather with a soft, dry cloth; for the suede parts, use a specific suede brush to keep the texture clean without flattening the nap.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
