strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> for responsive impact absorption and all-day wearability.</li><li><strong>Slim Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features the traditional thin, flexible rubber tread with a herringbone pattern for reliable urban grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Luxury Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,499 to Rs. 4,800 (Typical 7A pricing in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183A201-302</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes brand-accurate Onitsuka Tiger box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Fast delivery to major hubs (Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore, Surat) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Usually within <strong>24 hours</strong> of order confirmation.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?200??500) to confirm shipping.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>slim, narrow profile</strong>. If you have standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. For those with <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10) to ensure comfort across the ball of the foot. To clean, use a soft suede brush for the green overlays and a damp cloth for the cream panels; avoid liquid cleaners to maintain the deep \"Pine\" pigment.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
