nish.</li><li><strong>Ultra-Slim Silhouette:</strong> Maintains the authentic NM \"last,\" which is even sleeker and more low-profile than the standard Mexico 66, emphasizing a sophisticated, foot-hugging shape.</li><li><strong>Hand-Finished Detailing:</strong> Features meticulous stitching and raw-edge finishes on the leather panels, mimicking the artisanal handwork of Japanese craftsmen.</li><li><strong>High-Rebound Insole:</strong> Equipped with an <strong>OrthoLite X-40 sockliner</strong> and a specialized cushioning material in the heel to provide surprising comfort despite the iconic thin sole.</li><li><strong>Subtle Branding:</strong> Often features the \"Nippon Made\" designation on the tongue or insole, sometimes including Katakana script for a deep cultural touch.</li></ul><h3><strong>What's in the \"Premium Full Kit\"?</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Full Kit</strong> designation ensures an elevated unboxing experience that matches the \"Nippon Made\" prestige:</p><ul><li><strong>Special NM Series Box:</strong> A high-quality, brand-accurate box often featuring minimalist or Japan-specific branding.</li><li><strong>Premium Dust Bag:</strong> A soft fabric protector for your sneakers.</li><li><strong>NM Certificate &amp; Tags:</strong> Replicated authentication cards and \"Nippon Made\" series care guides.</li><li><strong>Premium Laces:</strong> Includes thin, waxed cotton laces that complement the artisanal leather.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Nippon Made NM Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,599 to Rs. 4,500 (Premium Kit in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Materials</strong></td><td>Soft Goat Leather / Cow Suede Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Fast delivery to major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Timeline:</strong> Dispatch within <strong>24 hours</strong>; delivery in 3?5 working days for metros.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Due to the high value of NM copies, a \"booking fee\" (?500??1,000) is standard to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% \"early bird\" discount for UPI payments.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The NM model is the <strong>narrowest</strong> in the Onitsuka Tiger lineup. It is designed to fit like a glove. If you have standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wide feet</strong>, you must <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10). To clean, use a high-quality leather conditioner only; avoid water washes, as the NM leather is more delicate and intended to age naturally.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
