age Technical Details:</strong> Includes the signature cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the classic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for authentic 1960s stability and style.</li><li><strong>Comfortable Interior:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> for superior cushioning and all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Thin Track Outsole:</strong> Features a flexible, low-profile rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern for reliable urban grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / First Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,499 (Typical 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Type</strong></td><td>Lace-Up Sneakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Most specialized 7A sellers process and ship orders within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros like Mumbai, Delhi, and Bangalore; 5?7 days for other regions.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. A small advance \"security\" fee (Rs. 200?Rs. 500) may be required to confirm the shipment.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 5?10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>notoriously narrow and slim fit</strong>. For standard feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10) to ensure comfort across the ball of the foot. To clean, use a damp cloth for the white leather panels and a soft suede brush for the grey overlays to keep the colors looking sharp.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
