 [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Tokuten - Black/White/Gum | 7A Premium Quality</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Indoor Court Classic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Tokuten</strong> is an archival gem inspired by 1980s indoor soccer and court shoes. Often compared to the Adidas Samba due to its structured silhouette and gum rubber sole, the Tokuten offers a more refined, minimalist Japanese aesthetic. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition captures the robust build and \"terrace fashion\" vibe that has made it a breakout favorite in the 2024-2026 streetwear scene.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Premium Leather Upper:</strong> Crafted with high-grade, smooth black leather that provides better structure and durability compared to the ultra-thin Mexico 66.</li><li><strong>Classic Gum Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features the signature honey-colored gum sole with a pivot-point tread pattern, offering excellent grip and that essential vintage \"terrace\" look.</li><li><strong>Contrasting White Tiger Stripes:</strong> The lateral stripes are rendered in crisp white leather, providing a sharp, high-contrast monochrome finish.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Cushioning:</strong> Unlike the flat-profile Mexico 66, the Tokuten features a slightly thicker midsole and a high-cushion sponge insole for superior all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Gold Foil Branding:</strong> Includes the iconic \"Onitsuka Tiger\" branding in gold foil on the tongue and side, adding a touch of 80s luxury to the athletic design.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Tokuten Branded Box (Correct SKU 1183C429-001)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Wrapping &amp; Tags</li><li>Branded Crew Socks (White or Black)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / First Copy (Master Quality)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500</strong> (Official India Store Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Black / White / Gum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183C429.001</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Tokuten vs. Mexico 66</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Mexico 66</strong></th><th><strong>Tokuten</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Vibe</strong></td><td>Slim / Retro Track</td><td><strong>Structured / Court Shoe</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sole Type</strong></td><td>Thin / Flat Rubber</td><td><strong>Thick / Gum Rubber</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Toe Box</strong></td><td>Narrow / Pointed</td><td><strong>Wider / Rounded</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Minimalist</td><td><strong>Plush / Padded Insole</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from premium footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A+ sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 400?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an additional 10?15% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Tokuten has a <strong>wider toe box</strong> than most Onitsuka models. You can comfortably stay <strong>True to Size (TTS)</strong>. If you are between sizes, go for your standard UK size rather than sizing up.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> The black leather is low-maintenance. Use a damp cloth for the upper and a specialized gum-sole cleaner (or a simple eraser) to keep the rubber edges looking fresh and free of scuffs.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
