 the standard flat Mexico 66, making it ideal for long hours of walking.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Branding:</strong> Detailed with the iconic Tiger stripes in grey and a classic logo patch on the tongue for an authentic retro vibe.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (High-End Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,800 (In India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Brand-accurate drawer box with all tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Nationwide Express Shipping:</strong> Delivered to all major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Pune, etc.) via reputed couriers like <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24?48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"booking amount\" (Rs. 200?Rs. 500) to confirm the order, with the rest payable at delivery.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Discount:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 5?10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Tracking:</strong> A live tracking ID is provided via WhatsApp or SMS once the package is dispatched.</li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Fit Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Unlike the narrow Mexico 66, the Tokuten has a <strong>slightly wider toe box</strong>. Most users find it fits <strong>true to size</strong>. However, the leather can feel stiff initially, so expect a 2?3 day \"break-in\" period for the material to soften and conform to your foot.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
