font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico Delegation - Black/White</strong></h2><h3><strong>The 1968 Olympic Legacy</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Mexico Delegation</strong> is a premium faithful recreation of the original delegation shoe worn by the Japanese team during the <strong>1968 Mexico City Olympic Games Parade</strong>. While the Mexico 66 is the most famous silhouette, the Delegation is the connoisseur?s choice. This <strong>Black/White</strong> edition features a slightly thicker sole and a more substantial build than the 66, offering a robust, vintage athletic look that bridges the gap between a track shoe and a modern lifestyle sneaker.<br>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Heritage Suede &amp; Leather Upper:</strong> Crafted with premium charcoal-black suede and contrasting white leather Tiger stripes, providing a rich, textured appearance that ages beautifully.</li><li><strong>\"MEXICO\" Side Branding:</strong> Features the rare, retro-style \"MEXICO\" print on the lateral side, a detail unique to the Delegation model to commemorate the '68 games.<br>&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Thicker Midsole Structure:</strong> Unlike the ultra-flat Mexico 66, the Delegation offers a more supportive, slightly elevated cream-colored midsole for improved comfort.</li><li><strong>Signature Heel Flap:</strong> Includes the \"Tiger\" branded pull-tab on the heel, staying true to the original parade-shoe specifications.</li><li><strong>Textured Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features a classic gum-style or off-white rubber sole with a unique traction pattern designed for the stadium floor.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Heritage Box (Correct SKU &amp; Olympic-inspired labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Wrapping &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew Socks (White or Black)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Model Type</strong></td><td>Mexico Delegation (Heritage Series)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Copy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 13,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>D6E7L.9001</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Delegation vs. Mexico 66</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Mexico 66</strong></th><th><strong>Mexico Delegation</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Sole Depth</strong></td><td>Ultra-Thin / Flat</td><td><strong>Medium / Cushioned</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Side Branding</strong></td><td>None (Stripes Only)</td><td><strong>\"MEXICO\" Logo Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lacing</strong></td><td>Standard Flat</td><td><strong>Wider, Retro Lacing</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Vibe</strong></td><td>Slim / Casual</td><td><strong>Structured / Heritage Athletic</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Usually shipped from premium hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico Delegation has a <strong>slightly wider fit</strong> than the standard Mexico 66, making it more comfortable for men with broader feet. You can generally stay <strong>True to Size (TTS)</strong>.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Since the upper is primarily black suede, it can attract dust. Use a specialized suede eraser or a dry soft-bristled brush to maintain the nap of the fabric. Avoid water as it may cause the black dye to bleed into the white leather stripes.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
