ity TPU pellets, ensuring the signature \"squishy\" bounce and premium 24-hour energy return.</li><li><strong>Tonal Semi-Translucent Cage:</strong> The ribbed TPU midsole cage is tinted in a matching pale-pink/beige, housing the white Boost core for a seamless, monochromatic look.</li><li><p><strong>No-Tab Streamlined Heel:</strong> True to the original regional release, this model features a \"no pull-tab\" design, offering a smoother and more aerodynamic silhouette.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Yeezy 350 Branded Box (Correct FV5666 Reflective SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>StockX or Goat-style Authentication Tag &amp; Certificate</li><li>Branded Crew Socks (Nude/Beige Tonal Match)</li><li>Adidas/Yeezy Dust Bag &amp; Premium Carry Bag</li><li><p>Set of 3M Reflective Round Rope Laces</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>Semi-UA / 7A+ (Master Quality)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 4,900</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 47 (UK 7 to 13 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Synth / Synth / Synth (Reflective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>FV5666</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major premium hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Flash Test Video:</strong> High-tier sellers usually provide a WhatsApp video \"Flash Test\" to confirm the 3M reflectivity before shipping.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A+ sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 500</strong> to verify the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10?15% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The reflective Primeknit is slightly stiffer than the standard version. It is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> from your standard UK size (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10) to ensure a comfortable fit. To keep the delicate \"Synth\" color fresh, clean only with specialized sneaker foam and a soft brush; avoid harsh chemicals that could damage the reflective 3M fibers.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Adidas! Yeezy","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
