slucent white ribbed cage, providing that famous \"walking on clouds\" bounce.</li><li><strong>Functional Heel Pull-Tab:</strong> Includes the reinforced rear pull-tab with the correct black-and-white dotted stitching, maintaining the classic 2017 silhouette.</li><li><strong>Translucent White Outsole:</strong> A milky white TPU cage houses the white Boost core, finished with a rugged herringbone tread for superior urban grip and durability.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Yeezy 350 Branded Box (Correct CP9654 SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>StockX or Goat-style Authentication Tag &amp; Certificate</li><li>Branded Crew Socks (White or Zebra-themed)</li><li>Adidas/Yeezy Dust Bag &amp; Premium Carry Bag</li><li>Set of Round Tonal White Laces</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>Semi-UA / 7A+ (Highest Replica Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,100 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 47 (UK 7 to 13 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Core Black / Red (Zebra)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>CP9654</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Usually shipped from premium hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A+ sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an additional 10?15% discount via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Zebra Primeknit is slightly firmer than monochromatic versions. It is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> from your standard UK size (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9) as they run quite snug. To maintain the white knit, use a specialized sneaker foam and a soft brush; avoid wearing them in muddy conditions to prevent staining the white translucent sole.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
