nct star patterns at the toe and heel for authentic traction.</li><li><strong>Perforated Toe Box:</strong> Cleanly punched circular holes for breathability and that iconic \"Triple White\" look.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dense Midsole Stitching:</strong> Features thick, uniform 360-degree stitching connecting the upper to the rubber cupsole for maximum durability.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Nike AF1 '07 Branded Box (Correct SKU: CW2288-111)</li><li>Nike Branded Tissue Paper &amp; Authenticity Cards</li><li>Nike Logo White Crew Socks</li><li>Premium Sneaker Keychain (Selected Batches)</li><li>Branded Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / UA (Unauthorized Authentic) Grade</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>&nbsp;Rs. 9,695</strong> (Official Nike India Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,400 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (UK 3 to 11 / Unisex)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / White / White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>CW2288-111</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium sellers require a small \"token\" advance of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe/GPay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Air Force 1s are known to <strong>run large</strong>. Most users recommend <strong>sizing down by half a size</strong> (e.g., if you usually wear UK 9, order UK 8.5) for a snug, secure fit.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep them \"Triple White,\" use a dedicated sneaker cleaning foam and a soft-bristled brush. Use <strong>crease protectors</strong> (shoe shields) inside the toe box while wearing them to prevent the leather from folding over time.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Nik_e Air","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
