n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><i><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Vintage | Birch/Green (Men's 7A First Copy)</strong></i></h2><h3><strong>The Organic Heritage Classic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"Birch/Green\" is one of the most sought-after vintage colorways, offering a softer, more natural alternative to stark white sneakers. This <strong>7A Master Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica for men features the classic \"Birch\" (cream/off-white) leather base paired with forest green Tiger stripes. The <strong>Vintage (VIN) finish</strong> on this model provides a matte, slightly aged look that perfectly complements the retro-running silhouette, making it a staple for high-end casual wardrobes.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica designed to mirror the original?s slim, low-profile racing last and the signature \"barefoot\" lightweight feel.</li><li><strong>Vintage Birch &amp; Green Palette:</strong> Features a <strong>Birch (Cream)</strong> leather upper with high-contrast <strong>Forest Green</strong> (or \"Hedge Green\") stripes and a matching green heel flap for a sophisticated, earthy look.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Mix:</strong> Crafted from soft, fine-grain leather with <strong>light tan suede</strong> overlays on the T-toe and heel-cross for structural durability and a retro texture.</li><li><strong>Signature Design Elements:</strong> Includes the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap, providing stability and authentic 1966 heritage branding.</li><li><strong>Modern Urban Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing, <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> for all-day comfort and shock absorption.</li><li><strong>Herringbone Outsole:</strong> Features a flexible, thin rubber outsole with the traditional herringbone tread for reliable grip on city surfaces.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Vintage Series Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,600</strong> (Standard 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11 / Men's)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Materials</strong></td><td>Natural Leather / Suede / Rubber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from Indian hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. For men with standard or narrow feet, stay true to your Euro size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10) for better midfoot comfort. To maintain the birch color, wipe with a soft, dry cloth; avoid using wet wipes on the green stripes to prevent color bleeding or fading of the vintage finish.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
