     [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD \"Yellow/Black\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Definitive \"Kill Bill\" Luxury Upgrade</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD in \"Yellow/Black\"</strong> is the high-spec evolution of the brand's most famous colorway. While the standard version is legendary for its appearance in martial arts cinema, the <strong>SD (Super Deluxe)</strong> version elevates the icon with premium materials and modern comfort technology. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition captures the striking contrast of the vibrant yellow and deep black stripes while replicating the superior build of the SD series.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A SD-Series Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>supple, high-grade leather upper</strong> that is softer and more durable than the standard canvas or basic leather versions.</li><li><strong>Modern Comfort Tech:</strong> Replicates the SD-specific upgrades, including a thinner, more cushioned midsole and a high-rebound <strong>OrthoLite?</strong> style insole, making these far more comfortable for long-distance walking than the original 1966 model.</li><li><strong>Refined Details:</strong> Features polished metal eyelets and slimmer, more precise Tiger stripes. The heel features the signature \"X\" reinforcement and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in black.</li><li><strong>High-Traction Outsole:</strong> Equipped with a specialized rubber compound and a modified herringbone tread pattern designed for better grip on urban surfaces.</li><li><strong>Cinematic Palette:</strong> The bold \"Tai-Chi\" Yellow base with jet-black stripes?a timeless look that pairs perfectly with black denim, joggers, or tech-wear.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"SD Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger SD Series Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Yellow or Black)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / SD Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 16,500 to Rs. 18,500</strong> (Official SD Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 5,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Yellow / Black / Cream Midsole</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183A391-752</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from premium sneaker hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The SD series is built on a <strong>narrower, more modern last</strong>. It provides a very secure, streamlined fit. It is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10) for the best daily comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep the yellow leather vibrant, use a damp microfibre cloth for regular cleaning. Avoid using harsh chemical cleaners. For the black stripes, a simple leather conditioner will keep them from cracking over time.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
