<strong>Ortholite? Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned footbed for superior shock absorption and moisture management.</li><li><strong>Vintage Color Palette:</strong> The \"Birch\" (beige) base is contrasted by deep \"Indigo Navy\" tiger stripes, creating a timeless athletic vibe.</li><li><strong>Full Premium Set Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box</li><li>Brand Care Cards &amp; Tags</li><li>Branded Dust Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Official MRP</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 15,500</strong> (Official Indian Retail Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,999 to Rs. 4,499</strong>&nbsp;(Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183C529.200</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Materials</strong></td><td>Cow Leather / Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Hub Dispatch:</strong> Shipped directly from premium hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Fast Logistics:</strong> Delivered within <strong>3 to 5 business days</strong> across India using <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Flexible Payments:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available (Small booking amount of <strong>Rs. 500</strong> usually required).</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Extra <strong>10% discount</strong> and <strong>Free Shipping</strong> on UPI payments.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Sizing Advice:</strong> The Tsunahiki has a slightly <strong>narrower fit</strong> compared to the standard Mexico 66. It is recommended to <strong>go half a size up</strong> for a more comfortable fit (e.g., if you are a UK 8, choose a UK 8.5).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean the smooth leather upper with a <strong>soft damp cloth</strong> and mild detergent. Avoid machine washing to protect the unique wrap-around rubber sole bond.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
