6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2>Onitsuka Tiger Sclaw Low | Navy Blue / White Stitch</h2><h3><strong>Effortless Style Meets Heritage Design</strong></h3><p>Experience the perfect blend of classic aesthetics and modern convenience. The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Sclaw Low</strong> in \"Navy Blue\" offers a refined, artisanal take on a futuristic silhouette. Characterized by its unique \"shoe-in-sock\" construction, this edition features elegant white contrast stitching that highlights the brand's iconic stripes, creating a sophisticated look inspired by the depth of classic autumn and winter styles.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Artisanal Stitching Detail:</strong> Unlike printed overlays, the signature Tiger stripes on this model are expressed through meticulous <strong>White Contrast Stitching</strong>, providing a handcrafted, premium feel against the deep Navy base.</li><li><strong>Integrated Sock-Like Fit:</strong> Built with a high-quality knit fabric that wraps around the foot like a second skin, seamlessly blending the comfort of a sock with the structure of a trainer.</li><li><strong>Heritage-Inspired \"Sclaw\" Sole:</strong> The distinctive outsole features a \"tiger scratch\" design, drawing inspiration from Onitsuka Tiger's 1970s wrestling and driving shoes for a fierce visual edge and reliable grip.</li><li><strong>Premium Suede Overlays:</strong> Crafted with panels of soft, high-quality <strong>Cow Suede</strong> and matte-textured materials for a luxury finish and added durability.</li><li><strong>Superior Tech Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with <strong>fuzeGEL™ technology</strong> in the heel for advanced shock absorption and an <strong>OrthoLite™ X-40 sockliner</strong> for high-rebound, all-day comfort.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Special Edition Pricing:</strong> Limited-time promotional rates are currently available on this Navy Blue / White Stitch Sclaw model.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a range of unisex sizes to ensure a tailored fit for both men and women.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Enjoy complimentary delivery straight to your door on this premium selection.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
