inal 1960s DNA with the classic T-toe reinforcement and the signature \"Tiger\" branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a slim, flexible rubber outsole that provides superior traction and all-day support.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Discount Sale:</strong> Limited-time promotional pricing is currently available on this White/Black/Silver edition.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a complete range of sizes to ensure the perfect fit for everyone.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Enjoy complimentary delivery straight to your door on this special order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
