  [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Beige/Grass Green\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Earthy Summer Classic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On in \"Beige/Grass Green\"</strong> is a vibrant yet grounded take on the laceless icon. This colorway features a light, creamy \"Beige\" or \"Birch\" canvas base accented by \"Grass Green\" stripes?a shade that is slightly brighter and more saturated than forest green, offering a fresh, botanical look. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition replicates the lightweight, breathable construction that makes the Slip-On a favorite for travel and warm-weather urban exploration.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>high-density breathable canvas upper</strong> with synthetic leather Tiger stripes and the signature T-toe suede reinforcement in a tonal beige.</li><li><strong>Beige &amp; Grass Green Palette:</strong> A sophisticated \"earth-tone\" combination. The warm neutral body provides a versatile base, while the bright grass-green stripes offer a pop of organic color that pairs perfectly with denim or white linen.</li><li><strong>Lace-Free Convenience:</strong> Features a hidden <strong>internal elastic band</strong> across the instep for a secure, \"slip-and-go\" fit. The metallic eyelets are retained for visual authenticity, giving the appearance of a standard trainer without the hassle of laces.</li><li><strong>Lightweight Low-Profile:</strong> Built on a thin, flexible cream rubber sole with a herringbone tread pattern, maintaining the signature \"light-on-your-feet\" feel of the 1966 original.</li><li><strong>Heritage Accents:</strong> Includes the iconic \"X\" reinforced stitching on the heel and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in Grass Green.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Slip-On\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU 1183B815-108)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Green)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 12,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Beige / Grass Green / Cream</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Upper Material</strong></td><td>Premium Canvas &amp; Synthetic Leather</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Slip-On models feature a <strong>snugger fit</strong> than lace-up versions due to the elastic band's tension. If you have a high instep or prefer a more relaxed feel, it is recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Since this is a canvas-based shoe, it is best cleaned with a soft-bristled brush and mild sneaker soap. Avoid machine washing, as it can damage the internal elastic and the adhesive on the sole. Store away from direct sunlight to preserve the vibrant Grass Green color.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+$Uk@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
