mp;_h3]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-base md:[&amp;_h4]:text-lg [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Cream / Spinach Green\" | 7A Premium Unisex Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Botanical Laceless Heritage Slip-On</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Cream / Spinach Green\"</strong> (Style Code: <strong>1183A360-113</strong>) brings a crisp, botanical color palette to the brand's effortless laceless silhouette. Built with a breathable <strong>warm cream canvas upper</strong>, this edition features rich <strong>Spinach Green (deep forest green) leather tiger stripes</strong> across the quarter panels and a tonal light grey suede T-toe cap overlay.</p><p>Constructed with an internal elastic instep band for a secure, lace-free fit, this <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> faithfully replicates the classic low-profile footprint, cross-reinforced heel counter, and fold-down heel flap. It serves as a fresh, versatile daily driver for summer rotations, casual denim, and relaxed streetwear styling.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica engineered with exact panel alignments, durable canvas uppers, and clean double-stitching throughout.</li><li><strong>Warm Cream Canvas &amp; Suede T-Toe:</strong> Features a breathable cream canvas base paired with a light grey/beige suede overlay on the toe box for authentic vintage durability.</li><li><strong>Spinach Green Tiger Stripes:</strong> Deep botanical green leather racing stripes along the midfoot deliver sharp, natural visual contrast against the neutral base.</li><li><strong>Laceless Slip-On Construction:</strong> Outfitted with a hidden internal elastic instep band for quick slip-on convenience while maintaining a snug, foot-hugging fit.</li><li><strong>Cross-Reinforced Heel &amp; Flap:</strong> Complete with the signature X-shaped heel cross reinforcement and fold-down heel tab displaying printed Onitsuka Tiger branding.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile EVA Cushioning:</strong> Slim, responsive EVA foam midsole paired with a grooved rubber outsole for flexible, natural foot movement.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Heritage Slip-On Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 11,500 to Rs. 16,289 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Import Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Warm Cream Canvas / Spinach Green / Light Grey Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Breathable Canvas, Suede Overlays &amp; Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Fits true to size. Because this laceless slip-on uses an internal elastic band across the instep, it fits comfortably snug. If you have broad feet or a high instep, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for maximum toe box comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean the cream canvas upper using a soft cloth or brush dampened with mild soap and water. Use a dry soft brush on the front suede T-toe cap. Air dry away from direct sunlight.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":1}]
