 md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On | Yellow/Black (Mens ' 7A First Copy)</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Vibrant Heritage Icon</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On</strong> in \"Yellow/Black\" is the boldest expression of the brand's 1960s track heritage.1 This <strong>7A Premium First Copy</strong> replica for girls captures the famous \"Tai-Chi\" aesthetic?made legendary by martial arts cinema?and pairs it with a modern, laceless construction. Featuring a striking yellow upper with high-contrast black Tiger stripes, this pair is designed for those who want to make a statement while enjoying effortless, everyday comfort.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A top-tier 1:1 replica meticulously designed to mirror the original's slim racing silhouette, signature heel flap, and lightweight construction.</li><li><strong>Laceless Slip-On Convenience:</strong> Features a sewn-over tongue with a hidden <strong>internal elastic band</strong> for a secure, snug fit that eliminates the need for laces while maintaining a classic sneaker look.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Mix:</strong> Typically crafted from a high-quality <strong>synthetic leather or canvas</strong> upper with the signature <strong>greyish-beige suede</strong> T-toe overlay for authentic vintage texture.</li><li><strong>Bold Tai-Chi Palette:</strong> The vibrant yellow base is accented by deep black Tiger stripes, offering a sharp, energetic look that stands out in any crowd.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Comfort:</strong> Includes a cushioned, moisture-wicking insole designed to provide soft, springy support for all-day urban walking.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Features the classic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement for added stability and retro charm.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Heritage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 1,899 to Rs. 3,499</strong> (Varies by seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's W5 to W10)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Type</strong></td><td>Laceless Slip-On (Elastic Instep)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI or Bank Transfer.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>narrow and slim cut</strong>. For girls with standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order UK 6) for a more comfortable fit across the midfoot. To clean, wipe with a damp cloth for the yellow panels and use a soft brush for the suede toe cap; avoid soaking to maintain the leather's color and shape.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
