foot-hugging fit.</li><li><strong>Birch Leather Tiger Stripes:</strong> Crisp birch off-white leather racing stripes along the midfoot deliver high-contrast visual balance.</li><li><strong>Cross-Reinforced Heel &amp; Flap:</strong> Complete with the signature X-shaped heel cross reinforcement and fold-down heel tab displaying printed Onitsuka Tiger branding.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Cushioning:</strong> Slim EVA foam midsole paired with a grooved rubber outsole for flexible, natural foot movement.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Heritage Slip-On Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 11,500 to Rs. 20,700 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Import Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Men's Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Mantle Green Canvas / Birch Off-White / Light Grey Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Breathable Canvas, Leather Stripes &amp; Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Fits true to size. Since this laceless slip-on relies on an internal elastic band, it fits comfortably snug. If you have broad feet or a high instep, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, choose UK 9) for maximum comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean the green canvas upper using a soft cloth or brush dampened with mild soap and water. Use a dry soft brush on the suede T-toe cap. Air dry away from direct heat or sunlight.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
