ile maintaining the classic eyelet aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Ground Feel:</strong> Built on a thin, flexible rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern, providing the signature \"barefoot\" comfort the Mexico 66 is known for.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Features the iconic \"X\" reinforced stitching on the heel and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in contrasting yellow.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Slip-On\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Yellow)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 12,000</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Beige / Grey / Yellow / Off-White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Canvas &amp; Synthetic Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><br>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Slip-On model has a <strong>snugger fit</strong> due to the internal elastic band. While the canvas will soften over time, those with a high instep (top of the foot) or wider feet should <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To clean the beige canvas, use a soft-bristled brush and mild soapy solution. Avoid soaking the shoe completely. For the grey stripes and yellow heel flap, a quick wipe with a damp cloth keeps them sharp.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
