Row: [{"productId":110399,"productName":"0N!+$UK4a Tigerr Mexico 66 Slip On Leather Cream Olive Yellow Sneakers Mens D-2103","productDateCreation":"2026-09-26 20:40:07","productLastUpdated":1795157246435,"productPrice":null,"productPriceWithoutDiscount":null,"productOriginalPrice":2199,"productFetchedFrom":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com","productUrl":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com/products/SKU1790421741933607","featuredimg":"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780937190_KcIrAR.webp","imageUrl":"[\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780937190_KcIrAR.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780937188_GwF8lq.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780937189_iZAt6L.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780937189_pArnfE.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1780937191_mD2BW3.webp\"]","videoUrl":"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/videos/1780937191_ZcHfHi.mp4","productShortDescription":"<div class=\"\n      [&amp;_ul]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ul]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ul]:text-left\n      [&amp;_ol]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ol]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ol]:text-left\n      [&amp;_a]:text-blue-600\n      [&amp;_a]:underline\n      hover:[&amp;_a]:text-blue-800\n      [&amp;_p]:text-left [&amp;_p]:opacity-90\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-left [&amp;_h1]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-left [&amp;_h2]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-left [&amp;_h3]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-left [&amp;_h4]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-left [&amp;_h5]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-left [&amp;_h6]:mb-2\n\n      /* Responsive heading and paragraph font sizes, margin below */\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-2xl md:[&amp;_h1]:text-3xl [&amp;_h1]:font-bold [&amp;_h1]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-xl md:[&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-lg md:[&amp;_h3]:text-xl [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h3]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-base md:[&amp;_h4]:text-lg [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Cream / Olive / Yellow\" | 7A Premium Mens Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Effortless Laceless Earth-Toned Icon</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On in Cream, Olive Green, and Mustard Yellow</strong> brings a beautifully rugged, organic colorway to the brand's most recognizable silhouette. Modifying the classic 1966 track icon for everyday convenience, this model swaps out standard lacing for a smart <strong>internal elastic gore system</strong> hidden right beneath the eyelets.</p><p>This premium <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> masterfully replicates the signature low-profile racing footprint, the vintage cream full-grain leather base, and the striking contrast of muted olive green stripes highlighted by pops of mustard yellow. It serves as an exceptional earth-toned lifestyle essential for modern mens streetwear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Laceless Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 premium replica featuring a lightweight, flexible design. Crafted with a premium <strong>supple cream leather and suede upper</strong>, it beautifully preserves the low-slung, casual athletic profile entirely free of rough factory seams.</li><li><strong>Earth-Toned \"Rover\" Palette:</strong> Built with a warm <strong>cream leather foundation</strong>, layered with high-contrast <strong>olive green leather tiger stripes</strong> and detailed with vibrant <strong>mustard yellow accents</strong> on the heel pull tab. This rugged, natural layout coordinates effortlessly with olive cargos, beige chinos, or faded vintage denim.</li><li><strong>Smart Elastic Slip-On Utility:</strong> The stitched-down tongue features an <strong>engineered internal elastic band</strong> that stretches snugly over the instep, delivering a secure, locked-in fit without ever needing to tie laces.</li><li><strong>Classic Archive Architecture:</strong> Retains the traditional cross-stitched <strong>T-toe suede overlay</strong> for toe-box durability, along with the signature fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> at the collar.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Vulcanized Outsole:</strong> Sits on a thin, highly flexible dark cream rubber frame using a textured herringbone layout for dependable urban traction and an authentic retro stride.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Foam Bed:</strong> Outfitted inside with an upgraded, dense <strong>cushioned footbed</strong> designed for smooth daily impact protection and long-lasting shape retention.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Silk Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Slip-On Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 11,000 to Rs. 13,500</strong> (Official Store Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Warm Cream / Olive Green / Mustard Yellow / Rover</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Leather Upper, Suede Overlays &amp; Durable Textured Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 Slip-On line is built on a <strong>narrow and slim-fitting frame</strong>. Because it uses internal elastic instead of adjustable laces, if you have a high instep or wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>go one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to prevent tight pinching across the top of your foot.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the cream leather and olive overlays, avoid using rigid wire brushes or machine washing. Gently clean off surface dust using a <strong>soft, slightly damp microfiber cloth or soft suede brush</strong> mixed with a drop of mild sneaker shampoo. Always store them in a cool area out of intense, direct summer sunlight to protect the leather structure.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+$UK4a Tigerr","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
