Row: [{"productId":110404,"productName":"0N!+$uK4 Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On Black Putty 7A Premium Sneakers D-2030","productDateCreation":"2026-09-26 20:40:07","productLastUpdated":1795157246723,"productPrice":null,"productPriceWithoutDiscount":null,"productOriginalPrice":2299,"productFetchedFrom":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com","productUrl":"https://benzershoes.jdwebconnect.com/products/SKU179041235430934","featuredimg":"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1784646128_qI9J7r.webp","imageUrl":"[\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1784646128_qI9J7r.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1784646126_LXeYYZ.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1784646127_GPTTcN.webp\",\"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/images/1784646129_xZlfAe.webp\"]","videoUrl":"https://assets.jdwebshop.com/products/videos/1790412352_SsNUWO.mp4","productShortDescription":"<div class=\"\n      [&amp;_ul]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ul]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ul]:text-left\n      [&amp;_ol]:list-disc\n      [&amp;_ol]:pl-6\n      [&amp;_ol]:text-left\n      [&amp;_a]:text-blue-600\n      [&amp;_a]:underline\n      hover:[&amp;_a]:text-blue-800\n      [&amp;_p]:text-left [&amp;_p]:opacity-90\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-left [&amp;_h1]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-left [&amp;_h2]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-left [&amp;_h3]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-left [&amp;_h4]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-left [&amp;_h5]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-left [&amp;_h6]:mb-2\n\n      /* Responsive heading and paragraph font sizes, margin below */\n      [&amp;_h1]:text-2xl md:[&amp;_h1]:text-3xl [&amp;_h1]:font-bold [&amp;_h1]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h2]:text-xl md:[&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h3]:text-lg md:[&amp;_h3]:text-xl [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h3]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h4]:text-base md:[&amp;_h4]:text-lg [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><p>helo</p><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Black/Putty\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Stealth Heritage Essential</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On in \"Black/Putty\"</strong> is a masterclass in understated, monochromatic styling. This colorway moves away from the traditional high-contrast tricolor look, opting for a deep black body accented by \"Putty\"?a sophisticated, muted grey-beige shade?on the Tiger stripes. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition offers the iconic 1960s track silhouette in a modern, laceless format that works perfectly as a versatile, everyday \"stealth\" sneaker.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a high-density <strong>breathable canvas</strong> upper (or synthetic leather depending on the specific batch) with reinforced suede overlays on the toe and heel.</li><li><strong>Laceless Slip-On Utility:</strong> Features a high-tension <strong>internal elastic band</strong> across the instep. This provides a secure, snug fit that eliminates the need for laces while maintaining the classic eyelet aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Sophisticated \"Black/Putty\" Palette:</strong> The jet-black base is complemented by the subtle, earthy tones of the Putty stripes, making this pair easy to style with dark denim, tech-wear, or casual office attire.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the signature \"X\" reinforced stitching on the heel and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for authentic stability.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Ground Feel:</strong> Equipped with a thin, flexible rubber outsole featuring the classic herringbone tread for a lightweight, grounded walking experience.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Black or Grey)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 12,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Black / Putty / Off-White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183A360-001</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Slip-On models feature a <strong>snugger fit</strong> than lace-up versions due to the elastic band's tension. If you have a high instep or wide feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the deep black color, avoid using harsh detergents which can cause the canvas to fade. Use a soft-bristled brush for dry dust and a damp microfibre cloth for the Putty-colored stripes.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+$uK4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
