h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><p>helo</p><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Desert/White\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Earthy Minimalist Slip-On</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On in \"Desert/White\"</strong> is a masterclass in understated style. This colorway features a warm, sandy \"Desert\" tan canvas base paired with crisp white Tiger stripes. It?s the perfect alternative for those who find \"Birch\" too light and \"Brown\" too dark. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition replicates the effortless laceless design and lightweight feel that makes the Slip-On series a favorite for travel and daily urban wear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>durable high-density canvas upper</strong>. The material is chosen for its breathability and resistance to daily wear, maintaining the classic shape over time.</li><li><strong>Desert &amp; White Palette:</strong> A versatile earthy neutral. The sandy tan body is accented by clean white stripes, making it a perfect match for light-wash denim, olive cargos, or beige chinos.</li><li><strong>Laceless Comfort:</strong> Features a hidden internal elastic band that ensures a snug, secure fit without the need for laces. The classic metal eyelets remain for that authentic Mexico 66 look.</li><li><strong>Lightweight Performance:</strong> Built on a slim, flexible rubber sole with a herringbone tread pattern. It offers a \"barefoot\" feel while providing enough grip for city sidewalks.</li><li><strong>Iconic Accents:</strong> Retains the signature T-toe suede overlay in a matching desert tone, the cross-stitched heel reinforcement, and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in white.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Slip-On\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Tan)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 11,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Desert Tan / White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Canvas &amp; Synthetic Leather</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Slip-On model fits <strong>true to size</strong> for most. However, because of the internal elastic band, those with a high instep (top of the foot) may find it slightly snug initially. If you prefer a relaxed fit, <strong>order a half size up</strong>.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To clean the desert canvas, use a soft brush and a mild soapy solution. Avoid soaking the shoe completely. For the white stripes, a quick wipe with a damp cloth keeps them bright. Store away from direct sunlight to prevent the desert tan from fading.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+$uk4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
