b-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Beige/Green\" | Men?s 7A Premium</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Earthy Lifestyle Essential</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On in \"Beige/Green\"</strong> is a perfect choice for those who appreciate a natural, organic color palette. This model swaps the traditional leather for a breathable canvas base in a warm beige, accented by deep forest green Tiger stripes. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition offers the iconic 1960s track silhouette in a convenient, laceless format, making it an ideal choice for the Indian climate and effortless daily wear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>high-density breathable canvas</strong> upper with tonal suede overlays on the T-toe and heel for structural durability.</li><li><strong>Laceless Slip-On Design:</strong> Equipped with a high-tension <strong>internal elastic band</strong> under the tongue. This ensures a secure, snug fit that eliminates the need for laces while keeping the classic \"eyelet\" aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Beige &amp; Forest Green Palette:</strong> The neutral beige body provides a clean canvas, while the deep green stripes add a sophisticated pop of color. It pairs exceptionally well with olive cargos, khaki chinos, or dark denim.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the signature \"X\" reinforced stitching on the heel and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in forest green.</li><li><strong>Lightweight Low-Profile:</strong> Features a thin, flexible rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern for a grounded, comfortable walking experience.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Beige)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 11,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,800 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Beige / Forest Green / Off-White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Upper Material</strong></td><td>Premium Canvas &amp; Suede Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Slip-On models feature a <strong>snugger fit</strong> than lace-up versions due to the elastic band's tension. If you have a high instep or wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the beige canvas, avoid heavy mud or rain. Use a soft-bristled brush for dry dust and a damp microfibre cloth for the green stripes. For deep cleaning, a mild sneaker shampoo and a soft brush work best on the canvas areas.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
