ded heel flap.</li><li><strong>Comfort-First Design:</strong> A low-profile rubber outsole provides flexible traction and all-day comfort for urban exploration.</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Discount Sale:</strong> Limited-time promotional pricing is currently available on this unique Cream/Spinach Green edition.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a complete range of sizes to ensure the perfect fit for every wearer.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Enjoy complimentary delivery straight to your door on this special order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
