[&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"White / Green\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Effortless Laceless Retro Classic</strong></h3><p>The Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On in White and Green delivers a clean, organic, and sporty aesthetic to the brand’s most recognizable heritage track silhouette. Modifying the classic 1966 track icon for ultimate daily convenience, this slip-on edition drops traditional laces in favor of a smart <strong>internal elastic gore system</strong> hidden securely beneath the eyelets.</p><p>This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> masterfully replicates the slim low-slung footprint, featuring a crisp white leather base contrasted by vibrant kelly green leather tiger stripes. It is the ultimate casual slip-and-go option that perfectly bridges retro athletic heritage with modern, low-maintenance lifestyle wear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Laceless Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 premium replica designed to preserve the exact weight distribution, flexibility, and elegant low-profile racing stance of the original archive layout.</li><li><strong>Premium Leather &amp; Suede Construction:</strong> Crafted with a supple, grain-textured <strong>white leather upper</strong> reinforced by a soft, light-grey <strong>T-toe suede overlay</strong> for added structural durability at the toe box.</li><li><strong>Vibrant Retro Color Palette:</strong> Features a crisp, clean white body sharply accented by bold <strong>Kelly Green leather tiger stripes</strong> on the side walls and a matching green fold-down heel tab, offering a timeless, preppy sportswear look.</li><li><strong>Smart Elastic Slip-On Fit:</strong> An <strong>engineered elastic band</strong> integrated inside the tongue stretches comfortably over your foot, delivering a secure, locked-in fit that retains its shape without ever needing laces.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Grippy Outsole:</strong> Sits on a thin, highly flexible cream-white rubber sole with a textured herringbone tread for dependable daily city traction and a true close-to-the-ground track feel.</li><li><strong>Contoured Cushion Bed:</strong> Outfitted with an upgraded, dense <strong>cushioned footbed</strong> designed for smooth impact absorption, shape retention, and arch comfort during long city walks.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Slip-On Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 9,500 to Rs. 11,500 (Official Store Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200 (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Crisp White / Kelly Green / Light Grey Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Leather Upper, Suede Overlays &amp; Textured Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of Rs. 300 to Rs. 500 upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 Slip-On line is built on a <strong>narrow and slim-fitting frame</strong>. Because it uses internal elastic instead of adjustable laces, if you have a high instep or wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>go one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, select a UK 9) to prevent tight pinching across the top of your foot.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the white leather panels and green overlays, avoid using rigid wire brushes or aggressive chemical washes. Clean surface dust and dirt gently using a <strong>soft microfiber cloth or a dedicated soft sneaker brush</strong> mixed with a drop of mild sneaker shampoo. Store them in a cool, dry area away from direct summer sunlight to protect the leather structure.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
