letic look that pairs easily with light-wash jeans or navy chinos.</li><li><strong>Enveloping Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features the distinctive <strong>wrap-up gum rubber sole</strong> that extends onto the upper. This design provides lateral stability and a rugged, vintage footprint while protecting the leather edges from scuffs.</li><li><strong>Slip-On Ease with Lace Aesthetic:</strong> Engineered with an <strong>internal elastic gore system</strong> for a secure, laceless fit. While it is a true slip-on, it includes decorative shoelaces to maintain the classic 1980s sneaker appearance.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Comfort Insole:</strong> Includes an <strong>OrthoLite-style footbed</strong> for moisture management and all-day cushioning, making it a reliable choice for extended city walking.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Heritage\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct <strong>1183C529</strong> SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Blue)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 15,500</strong> (Official Indian Retail Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,499 to Rs. 4,499</strong>&nbsp;(Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Directoire Blue / Gum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Smooth Leather &amp; Vulcanized Rubber</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major logistics hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 7 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Typically requires a small <strong>Rs. 300 to 500 advance</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and extra discounts for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Tsunahiki Slip-On is known for a <strong>very narrow and snug fit</strong> through the midfoot. For those with wider feet or high arches, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 8.5).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the crisp white finish, use a <strong>soft damp cloth</strong> for the leather upper. Avoid machine washing to protect the bond of the wrap-around gum sole. A <strong>water-repellent spray</strong> is recommended before the first wear to prevent color transfer from denim.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
