:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><i><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On | Blue/Yellow (Men's 7A Quality)</strong></i></h2><h3><strong>Dynamic Retro Sport Aesthetic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On</strong> in \"Blue/Yellow\" (often referred to as Mako Blue/Huddle Yellow) is a high-energy colorway that pays tribute to the brand's classic track heritage. This <strong>7A Premium Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica captures the essence of the original 1966 trainer but removes the laces for a contemporary, streamlined look. It is a standout choice for men who want a bold, contrast-heavy sneaker that offers the ultimate \"slip-on-and-go\" convenience without sacrificing the iconic Tiger silhouette.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A premium replica meticulously crafted to mirror the original's ultra-slim profile and signature lightweight feel.</li><li><strong>Laceless Slip-On Design:</strong> Features a specialized <strong>internal elasticated tongue</strong> that provides a secure, snug fit while maintaining the appearance of a traditional laced trainer.</li><li><strong>Vibrant Blue/Yellow Palette:</strong> Built on a deep <strong>Mako Blue</strong> upper with high-contrast <strong>Huddle Yellow</strong> Tiger stripes and matching heel branding.</li><li><strong>Mixed Material Construction:</strong> Typically crafted from a combination of <strong>durable canvas or synthetic leather</strong> with tonal suede-style overlays on the T-toe for extra durability.</li><li><strong>Ortholite-Style Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned insole designed to provide superior moisture management and all-day shock absorption for urban walking.</li><li><strong>Heritage Accents:</strong> Retains the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the much-loved \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for an authentic retro finish.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,400 (Typical 7A pricing in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Canvas or Synthetic Leather / Suede Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipped via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong> from major hubs.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically confirmed and dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3–5 working days for metros; 5–7 days for smaller regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?200–?500) to process the shipment.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>tapered, snug fit</strong> due to the internal elastic band. For most men, it fits true to size. However, if you have wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) to ensure the elastic doesn't feel too restrictive. To maintain the \"Blue/Yellow\" look, wipe the blue panels with a damp cloth and use a soft brush for the suede toe cap; avoid liquid cleaners on the yellow stripes to prevent color bleeding.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
