 [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On | White/Burgundy (Men's 7A Quality)</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Refined Retro Classic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On</strong> in \"White/Burgundy\" is a sophisticated, high-contrast edition of the iconic 1966 trainer. This <strong>7A Premium Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica meticulously recreates the \"burgundy stripe\" aesthetic, offering a rich, deep red contrast against a crisp white base. It is a top-tier choice for men who prefer a more mature, refined colorway that transitions effortlessly from formal-casual office settings to upscale weekend streetwear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> An elite replica designed to match the original's ultra-slim profile, thin sole, and signature lightweight construction.</li><li><strong>Lace-Free Convenience:</strong> Features a specialized <strong>internal elasticated tongue</strong> that provides a secure, snug fit while maintaining the appearance of a traditional laced trainer.</li><li><strong>Signature Burgundy Palette:</strong> Built on a clean <strong>White</strong> leather upper with high-contrast <strong>Burgundy (Deep Red)</strong> Tiger stripes and matching heel branding.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Construction:</strong> Typically crafted from high-grade <strong>synthetic leather</strong> or <strong>canvas</strong> with tonal suede-style overlays on the T-toe for added durability and texture.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Comfort:</strong> Equipped with an <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> designed to provide superior moisture management and all-day shock absorption.</li><li><strong>Heritage Detailing:</strong> Retains the classic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the iconic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for an authentic retro finish.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Current Indian 7A Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Leather or Canvas / Suede Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes brand-accurate Onitsuka Tiger drawer-style box</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipping to all major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24–48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3–5 working days for metros; 5–7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"booking fee\" (?200–?500) to confirm the order, with the balance due at delivery.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 5–10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>slim, tapered fit</strong> due to the internal elastic band. For most men, it fits true to size. However, if you have wider feet or a high instep, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) to ensure the elastic doesn't feel too restrictive. To maintain the \"White/Burgundy\" look, wipe the white panels with a damp cloth and use a soft brush for the suede toe cap; avoid liquid cleaners on the burgundy stripes to prevent potential color bleeding</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
