eless colorway in the collection.</li><li><strong>Mixed Material Construction:</strong> Typically crafted from a combination of <strong>smooth synthetic leather</strong> and breathable canvas, reinforced with tonal suede overlays on the T-toe and heel for durability.</li><li><strong>All-Day Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> designed to provide superior moisture management and impact absorption.</li><li><strong>Authentic Branding:</strong> Retains the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for a complete vintage finish.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,400 (Current Indian 7A Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Type</strong></td><td>Laceless Slip-On</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipped via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong> from major distribution hubs.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically confirmed and dispatched within <strong>24?48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for smaller regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (Rs. 200? Rs. 500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an additional 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>slim, tapered fit</strong> due to the internal elastic band. For most men, it fits true to size. However, if you have wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order UK 10) to ensure the elastic doesn't feel too tight across the instep. To maintain the \"White/Black\" look, wipe the white panels with a damp cloth; use a soft brush for the black stripes and avoid liquid cleaners on the suede sections to prevent color bleeding.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
