and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap, all executed in tonal black for a subtle branding effect.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Ground Feel:</strong> Equipped with a thin, flexible black rubber outsole featuring the classic herringbone tread for reliable urban grip and a lightweight feel.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Triple Black\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Black)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 11,500 to Rs. 13,500</strong> (Official Leather Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Triple Black (Black / Black / Black)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Upper Material</strong></td><td>Premium Full-Grain Leather &amp; Suede Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Triple Black Leather model features a <strong>snugger, more structured fit</strong> than the canvas versions. Because leather has less natural \"give\" initially, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10) for maximum comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the deep black finish, use a dedicated black leather cream or a damp microfibre cloth for regular cleaning. Avoid using harsh detergents. A light buffing with a soft cloth will keep the leather looking premium and prevent it from appearing dull over time.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
