lt on the traditional thin, flexible rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern. It offers a lightweight, \"barefoot\" feel that is ideal for all-day urban walking.Heritage DNA: Retains the iconic \"X\" reinforced stitching on the heel and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in red.Full Accessory \"Tricolor\" Kit Includes:Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product TagsBranded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Tricolor)Premium Canvas Carry BagProduct SpecificationsFeatureDetailsQuality Grade7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)Retail PriceRs. 10,500 to Rs. 11,500 (Official Store Price 2026)Market Price (7A)Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,800 (Current Indian Price)Sizes AvailableEuro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)ColorwayWhite / Navy Blue / Red (Tricolor)Upper MaterialPremium Canvas &amp; Synthetic SuedeShipping &amp; Delivery (India)Direct Dispatch: Shipped from major footwear hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai within 24 hours.Estimated Timeline: 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via BlueDart or Delhivery Air.Payment Details:Cash on Delivery (COD): Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of Rs. 300 to 500 to confirm the order.Prepaid Benefits: Often includes Free Shipping and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).Sizing &amp; Care TipFit Note: The Slip-On model has a snug, streamlined fit due to the internal elastic band. While the canvas stretches slightly with wear, those with a high instep or wider feet are encouraged to order a half size up (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9).Care: Since this is a white canvas shoe, it is prone to showing dirt. Use a soft-bristled brush and a mild sneaker cleaning solution for the canvas. Avoid machine washing to protect the internal elastic. A water and stain repellent spray is highly recommended before the first wear.</p></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka TigerMeXico","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
