ed Tiger stripes, creating a sporty, high-contrast look.</li><li><strong>Breathable Heritage Design:</strong> The canvas upper makes this one of the most breathable models in the range, ideal for long summer days or humid urban environments.</li><li><strong>Classic Structural Details:</strong> Retains the signature \"X\" reinforced stitching on the heel and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for authentic stability.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU 1183A360-121 Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Tricolor)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 13,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Royal Blue / Red (France Tricolor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183A360.121</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Usually shipped from premium footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Slip-On models tend to fit <strong>snugger</strong> than lace-up versions due to the elastic band. If you have a high instep or wide feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Since this model is primarily canvas, use a soft-bristled brush for dry dust. For the white base, use a damp cloth with a mild detergent. Avoid machine washing to preserve the tension of the internal elastic.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
