 [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Tsunahiki Slip-On \"Sunflower Yellow / Black\" | 7A Premium</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Retro Tug-of-War Classic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Tsunahiki Slip-On in \"Sunflower Yellow / Black\"</strong> is a unique lifestyle silhouette inspired by traditional Japanese tug-of-war (Tsunahiki) shoes. This model stands out for its wrap-around rubber outsole and laceless slip-on convenience. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition captures the vibrant, high-contrast aesthetic that made the \"Kill Bill\" color palette famous, blending vintage 1980s sports heritage with modern urban functionality.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>durable canvas and suede upper</strong>. The materials are selected to match the original?s flexible, low-profile construction while maintaining a soft, comfortable feel.</li><li><strong>Vibrant Sunflower &amp; Black Palette:</strong> The striking <strong>Sunflower Yellow</strong> base is boldly contrasted by deep <strong>Black Tiger stripes</strong>. This high-visibility colorway is a statement piece that pairs perfectly with black joggers, oversized white tees, or dark denim.</li><li><strong>Wrap-Around Vulcanized Sole:</strong> Features the signature Tsunahiki <strong>high-wall rubber outsole</strong> that wraps around the sides of the shoe. This design provides enhanced lateral stability and a distinct, rugged aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Laceless Slip-On Design:</strong> Engineered for maximum convenience, this variant replaces traditional laces with an <strong>internal elastic gore system</strong>, allowing you to slide the shoes on and off while maintaining a secure, \"locked-in\" fit.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Cushioning:</strong> Includes a cushioned insole designed to provide moisture management and long-lasting comfort for all-day city wear.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Heritage\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (Yellow or Black)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 8,500 to Rs. 10,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,499 to Rs. 3,999</strong>&nbsp;(Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Sunflower Yellow / Black / Gum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Canvas, Suede &amp; Vulcanized Rubber</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear logistics hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore, Kolkata) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and extra discounts for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Tsunahiki Slip-On has a <strong>snug, glove-like fit</strong> due to the elastic gussets. If you have a high arch or wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 8.5) to ensure easy entry.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep the Sunflower Yellow canvas bright, avoid heavy mud or rain. Use a <strong>soft-bristled brush</strong> for the suede overlays and a damp microfiber cloth for the canvas. A protective fabric spray is recommended before the first wear to prevent dust from settling into the yellow fibers.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
