mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Tsunahiki Slip-On \"White / Black\" | 7A Premium</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Minimalist Tug-of-War Icon</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Tsunahiki Slip-On in \"White / Black\"</strong> is a clean, monochromatic evolution of the 1982 tug-of-war archive. By stripping away bold colors, this model highlights the unique <strong>wrap-around rubber outsole</strong> and sleek, laceless profile. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition is crafted for those who value the convenience of a slip-on without sacrificing the heritage aesthetic of a classic indoor sports shoe. It serves as a versatile, low-profile staple that pairs effortlessly with any modern wardrobe.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>soft-grain leather and suede upper</strong>. The materials are chosen to replicate the original's lightweight flexibility and durable construction, ensuring the shoe moves naturally with the foot.</li><li><strong>Classic White &amp; Black Palette:</strong> A crisp white leather base contrasted by sharp <strong>Black Tiger stripes</strong>. This timeless combination is the ultimate versatile colorway, fitting perfectly with everything from tailored trousers to casual denim.</li><li><strong>Signature High-Wall Sole:</strong> Features the iconic Tsunahiki <strong>wrap-up gum rubber outsole</strong>. This distinctive design provides added durability at the edges and a unique vintage grip pattern originally meant for maximum traction.</li><li><strong>Elastic Slip-On Convenience:</strong> Designed for an effortless \"on-and-off\" experience, it features an <strong>internal elastic gusset</strong> that holds the foot securely. While it includes decorative laces for a classic look, they do not require tying.</li><li><strong>Urban Walking Comfort:</strong> Includes a cushioned, moisture-wicking insole that provides a comfortable \"ground feel\" while maintaining the shoe's ultra-slim, low-profile silhouette.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Heritage\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Black)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 9,500 to Rs. 11,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,900 to Rs. 4,900</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Unisex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Black / Gum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Leather &amp; Vulcanized Rubber</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>Export to Sheets</p><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major logistics hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Chennai) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and extra discounts for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Tsunahiki Slip-On has a <strong>very streamlined, glove-like fit</strong>. Because of the elastic system, it can feel tight across the bridge of the foot. It is recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 8.5) for a more relaxed entry.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep the white leather looking sharp, wipe regularly with a <strong>damp microfiber cloth</strong>. For the suede T-toe, use a dry suede brush to lift dust. Applying a <strong>stain protector spray</strong> before the first wear is highly recommended to prevent the white finish from dulling.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
