c leather overlays for long-lasting daily comfort.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Maintains the original 1960s DNA with the classic T-toe reinforcement and the signature branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>Headline:</strong> THE ART OF THE SLIP-ON. 🌿</li><li><strong>Body:</strong> Classic heritage meets artisan craft. Introducing the <strong>Onitsuka Tiger x Panda Prank Mexico 66 Slip-On</strong> in the highly anticipated <strong>White/Green</strong> colorway.<br>&nbsp;</li></ul><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Offers</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Discount Sale:</strong> Limited-time promotional pricing is currently available for this special White/Green Panda Prank edition.</li><li><strong>Full Size Run:</strong> Available in a complete range of sizes to ensure the perfect fit for everyone.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> Enjoy complimentary delivery straight to your door on this special order.</li></ul></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
