strong> and premium <strong>synthetic suede</strong> overlays on the T-toe and heel for a durable, heritage feel.</li><li><strong>Signature Design Elements:</strong> Retains the classic T-toe reinforcement and the iconic foldable heel flap with \"Tiger\" branding.</li><li><strong>Comfort Engineering:</strong> Equipped with a lightweight <strong>cushioned insole</strong> and a flexible rubber outsole, providing a \"barefoot\" feel with adequate protection for daily walking.</li></ul><h3><strong>\"Full Accessories\" Package</strong></h3><p>This premium edition typically comes with the complete retail experience:</p><ul><li><strong>Brand Box:</strong> Accurate Onitsuka Tiger shoe box.</li><li><strong>Branded Tissue:</strong> Custom logo-printed wrapping paper.</li><li><strong>Authenticity Tags:</strong> Attached brand cards and size tags.</li><li><strong>Dust Bag:</strong> A soft cloth bag for protected storage.</li><li><strong>Optional Laces:</strong> Some 7A sellers include \"aesthetic laces\" for those who want to lace them up manually (though the eyelets are often decorative).</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Full Accessories)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,499 (Current Indian 7A Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Canvas &amp; Synthetic Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Shipping</strong></td><td>Free Shipping (Prepaid) or COD (Small Advance)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Slip-ons are designed to fit <strong>snugly</strong> to ensure they don't slide off. Most users find them true to size (TTS). However, if you prefer a looser feel or have very wide feet, it is recommended to <strong>order a half-size up</strong>. To maintain the \"Blood Oil\" depth, avoid liquid cleaners on the canvas; use a soft, dry brush for dust and a damp cloth for the rubber sole. Do not machine wash, as it can weaken the elastic bands.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":0}]
