r:</strong> Typically crafted from high-quality <strong>Blue Chambray or Natural Fiber canvas</strong> with suede overlays on the toe and Tiger stripes for a textured, summer-ready finish.</li><li><strong>Superior Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with an <strong>OrthoLite-style inner sole</strong> that offers enhanced shock absorption and moisture management compared to the flatter standard models.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Finished with the signature Onitsuka Tiger stripes and a slim, true rubber outsole for a classic grounded feel.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / First Copy (Master Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Depending on seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Type</strong></td><td>Convertible Slip-On / Mule</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipping to all major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders typically ship within <strong>24 hours</strong> after verification.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Most premium 7A sellers offer COD. A small advance \"token\" fee (?200??500) is often required to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 5?10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Paraty has a <strong>regular to slightly loose fit</strong> compared to the standard Mexico 66 to accommodate the slip-on design. It is recommended to <strong>order your standard size</strong>. If you are between sizes, go for the smaller size as the canvas will naturally stretch with wear. To clean, wipe with a damp cloth or use a soft brush with mild detergent on the canvas; <strong>do not machine wash</strong> as it can damage the convertible heel's structure.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":"true"}]
