    [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Grey/White\" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Effortless Everyday Essential</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On in \"Grey/White\"</strong> (often officially listed as <strong>Oyster Grey</strong>) is the ultimate fusion of retro athletic heritage and modern convenience. This laceless version of the iconic 1966 trainer removes the hassle of tying laces while maintaining the sleek, low-profile silhouette that made the original a global staple. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition perfectly captures the breathable canvas feel and the secure \"slip-and-go\" fit.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>high-density canvas upper</strong> with synthetic leather Tiger stripes and the signature T-toe suede reinforcement.</li><li><strong>Oyster Grey &amp; White Palette:</strong> A sophisticated, neutral colorway. The soft grey body is accented by crisp white stripes, making it an ideal choice for smart-casual office wear, travel, or weekend errands.</li><li><strong>Lace-Free Convenience:</strong> Features a hidden internal elastic band across the instep that provides a secure, snug fit without the need for laces. The eyelets remain for aesthetic authenticity.</li><li><strong>Lightweight &amp; Breathable:</strong> The canvas construction makes this significantly more breathable and lightweight (approx. 680g per pair) than the full-leather models, perfect for the Indian climate.</li><li><strong>Heritage DNA:</strong> Retains the classic heel cross reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in white.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Slip-On\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU 1183B603.020)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Grey)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500 to Rs. 11,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex sizing available)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Oyster Grey / White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Upper Material</strong></td><td>Premium Canvas &amp; Synthetic Leather</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Fit Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Slip-On model has a <strong>regular to slightly snug fit</strong> due to the internal elastic band. While it stretches, those with very wide feet may find it tight across the bridge. It is generally recommended to <strong>order your standard UK size</strong>, but if you prefer a looser feel, go a half size up.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Since this is a canvas-based shoe, it is best cleaned with a soft brush and mild detergent. Avoid machine washing, as it can weaken the elastic band and the glue on the rubber sole.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"MEN'S SLIP-ON","availability":0}]
