    "><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 VIN "Beige / White / Red" | 7A Premium Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Timeless Vintage Track Legend</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 VIN in "Beige / White / Red"</strong> is the definitive expression of 1960s sports heritage. Part of the <strong>Vintage (VIN)</strong> series, this model is celebrated for its "pre-aged" aesthetic, featuring a rich birch-beige base that offers a more soulful, retro look than standard optic white. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition meticulously recreates the signature tricolor stripes and the classic low-profile silhouette, making it an essential staple for enthusiasts of vintage athletic luxury.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 high-tier replica featuring a <strong>distressed-finish leather upper</strong>. The materials are specifically treated to mimic the "VIN" series' characteristic soft temper and vintage grain.</li><li><strong>Iconic Tricolor Palette:</strong> A warm <strong>Beige/Birch base</strong> accented by the legendary <strong>Navy Blue and Red Tiger stripes</strong>. This versatile combination is the cornerstone of the brand?s identity, pairing seamlessly with indigo denim, khaki chinos, or heritage sportswear.</li><li><strong>Premium Suede Overlays:</strong> Includes the signature <strong>T-toe reinforcement</strong> and heel cross-stitching in high-grade suede, providing a textured, multi-dimensional look.</li><li><strong>Heritage "VIN" Details:</strong> Features the functional "Tiger" branded heel flap in red and the classic <strong>X-shape heel reinforcement</strong> for added stability and vintage charm.</li><li><strong>Slim-Profile Traction:</strong> Equipped with a flexible, thin rubber outsole in a classic gum or off-white finish, featuring the traditional <strong>herringbone tread</strong> for reliable urban grip.</li><li><strong>Full "Premium" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Authentic-style Tissue Paper &amp; Branded Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Socks (Navy or White)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class="table"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Copy (Vintage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500 to Rs. 18,500</strong> (Official VIN Series Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,499 to Rs. 4,800</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (UK 3 to 11 / Unisex)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Beige / White / Red (Birch/Peacoat)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183B391-100 / THL7C2-1685</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Dispatch Hubs:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped from premium hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery Timeline:</strong> Expect delivery in <strong>3?5 working days</strong> for metro cities via premium couriers like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong> * <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available; most sellers require a small advance <strong>"security" deposit of Rs. 200 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.<ul><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 VIN features a <strong>very narrow, racing-inspired silhouette</strong>. For a comfortable fit, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> from your standard UK size (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To preserve the vintage leather finish, avoid harsh liquid cleaners. Use a <strong>soft suede brush</strong> for the T-toe and a <strong>dry microfiber cloth</strong> for the leather panels. Applying a <strong>water-repellent spray</strong> before the first wear is essential to guard against stains and dust.</p></blockquote></div>
