      `    "><h2><i><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | Birch/Blue/Red (Girls's 7A Vintage Sneakers)</strong></i></h2><h3><strong>The Timeless Heritage Original</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in "Birch/Blue/Red" (Tricolor) is the definitive heritage colorway that launched the brand into global sneaker fame. This <strong>7A Master Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica for men captures the essential 1960s track aesthetic, featuring a warm, creamy Birch base accented by the legendary Blue and Red Tiger stripes. The "Vintage" (VIN) series focus provides a slightly matte, pre-aged look, making it the perfect choice for those who want a classic pair that feels authentic and high-end rather than bright and synthetic.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A top-tier 1:1 replica that meticulously recreates the slim racing profile and the signature "barefoot" lightweight feel.</li><li><strong>Iconic Birch Tricolor Palette:</strong> Features a <strong>Birch (Off-White/Cream)</strong> leather upper with high-contrast <strong>Midnight Blue and Fiery Red</strong> stripes for a timeless, nautical-inspired look.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Construction:</strong> Crafted with soft, fine-grain leather and <strong>light tan suede</strong> overlays on the T-toe and heel-cross for structural durability and a vintage texture.</li><li><strong>Vintage Design Details:</strong> Includes the classic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the "Tiger" branded heel flap for added stability and brand heritage.</li><li><strong>Comfort &amp; Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing, <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> to ensure all-day comfort during urban exploration.2</li><li><strong>Thin Traction Outsole:</strong> Features a flexible, low-profile rubber outsole with the traditional herringbone tread pattern for a grounded feel and reliable grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class="table"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Vintage Heritage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500</strong> (Standard 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 41 to 45 (UK 7 to 11 / Men's)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Materials</strong></td><td>Leather / Suede / Rubber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate drawer-style box</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium sellers require a small advance "security" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. For men with standard or narrow feet, stay true to your Euro size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9) for a more comfortable fit across the midfoot. To maintain the vintage look, wipe the birch leather with a soft, dry cloth and use a specific suede brush for the toe overlays; avoid using wet wipes on the stripes to preserve the color intensity.</p></blockquote></div>`,
