_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | Beige/Grass Green (Girls' 7A First Copy)</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Earthy Heritage Staple</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"Beige/Grass Green\" is a standout in the heritage collection, offering a grounded, organic aesthetic inspired by 1960s training shoes. This <strong>7A Premium First Copy</strong> replica for girls and women features a warm, sandy beige base paired with vibrant forest-green stripes. It is a favorite for those who love the \"Birch/Green\" look but want a deeper, more saturated green that provides a fresh pop against neutral tones.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A high-end 1:1 replica meticulously designed to match the original's ultra-slim profile and signature flexible construction.</li><li><strong>Natural Earth Tones:</strong> Features a <strong>Birch-Beige</strong> leather upper with high-contrast <strong>Grass Green</strong> Tiger stripes, delivering a retro-sporty look that pairs perfectly with olive cargos or khaki trousers.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Construction:</strong> Crafted from soft, durable leather with classic <strong>light tan suede</strong> overlays on the T-toe and heel-cross for structural stability and a vintage finish.</li><li><strong>Slim-Profile Comfort:</strong> Designed on the iconic 1966 racing last, ensuring a sleek, feminine silhouette that keeps the foot looking slim and low to the ground.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Insole:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-wicking, cushioned footbed that provides modern impact absorption within a retro frame.</li><li><strong>Classic Traction Sole:</strong> Features the signature thin rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern for reliable grip during urban walking.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Depending on seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's W5 to W10)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183C102.250 (Reference)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs (Surat, Delhi, Mumbai).</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (Rs. 200?Rs. 500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. For girls with standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order UK 6) for better comfort across the midfoot. To clean, use a soft brush for the suede overlays and a damp cloth for the beige leather; avoid liquid cleaners on the green stripes to maintain their vibrant color.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
