[&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger x PATOU Mexico 66 \"Putty Cotton Candy\" | Girls' 7A Premium</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Haute Couture Collaboration</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger x PATOU Mexico 66</strong> is a high-fashion reimagining of the classic track shoe, infused with the \"romantic and girly mood\" of the Parisian Maison, <strong>Patou</strong>. This \"Putty Cotton Candy\" edition is a standout from the 2024-2025 collaboration. It features a sophisticated, neutral \"Putty\" base accented by soft, whimsical \"Cotton Candy\" pink stripes. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> replica is designed for those who want a sneaker that feels like a piece of designer jewelry for their feet.</p><h3><strong>Key Exclusive Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Patou Designer Branding:</strong> The \"PATOU Onitsuka Tiger\" collaboration logo is elegantly placed on the shoe tongue and heel, mirroring the high-fashion aesthetics of the original.</li><li><strong>Playful Tiger Charm:</strong> Includes the exclusive, cute <strong>Tiger charm/keyring</strong> accessory that hangs from the laces?a signature detail of this specific collection.</li><li><strong>Grosgrain Tape Stripes:</strong> Unlike standard leather stripes, the Tiger stripes on this model are partially covered with <strong>grosgrain ribbon</strong> (a ribbed fabric), adding a luxurious, three-dimensional depth linked to Patou's apparel line.</li><li><strong>Romantic Color Palette:</strong> The \"Putty\" (a refined cream/beige) and \"Cotton Candy\" (pastel pink) combination provides a soft, \"French-girl\" aesthetic that pairs beautifully with silk skirts or light denim.</li><li><strong>7A Master Material Mix:</strong> Crafted with a premium blend of soft suede and smooth leather to provide a high-quality, luxurious feel.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Special Collaboration Branded Box (Patou x Onitsuka Tiger)</li><li>Exclusive Tiger Charm / Keyring</li><li>Branded Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (Collaboration Series)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 22,000 to Rs. 25,000</strong> (Original Global Release)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,199 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women?s Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Putty / Cotton Candy / Cream</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183C380.200</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Stocked in major premium hubs like <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, and Mumbai; orders are typically dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 - 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 200 - 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>very slim and narrow profile</strong>. It fits true to size for narrow feet, but if you have wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order a UK 6) to avoid the sides feeling too tight.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Because this model uses a mix of \"Putty\" suede and \"Cotton Candy\" pink grosgrain tape, avoid water at all costs. Use a specialized suede brush for the beige parts and a dry microfibre cloth for the pink ribbon stripes.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
