ong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Authentic-style Tissue Paper &amp; Branded Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Socks (Navy or White)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class="table"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Copy (Vintage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500 to Rs. 18,500</strong> (Official VIN Series Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,499 to Rs. 4,800</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (UK 3 to 11 / Unisex)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Beige / White / Red (Birch/Peacoat)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183B391-100 / THL7C2-1685</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Dispatch Hubs:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped from premium hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery Timeline:</strong> Expect delivery in <strong>3?5 working days</strong> for metro cities via premium couriers like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong> * <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available; most sellers require a small advance <strong>"security" deposit of Rs. 200 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.<ul><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 VIN features a <strong>very narrow, racing-ins