es <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 \"Potau\" collection is designed with a <strong>slim, tapered silhouette</strong>. For a standard fit, stay true to your size. However, if you have wider feet or prefer wearing socks, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5). To clean, wipe the white leather with a damp cloth and use a soft suede brush for the black overlays.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
