rong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>very slim and narrow profile</strong>. It is true to size for narrow feet, but if you have slightly wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order a UK 6). To maintain the white leather and colorful stripes, wipe with a damp cloth and mild detergent; avoid soaking the shoe to preserve the structural integrity of the 7A materials.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
