ayments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, slim-fit design</strong>. If you prefer a more relaxed fit or have wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> from your standard UK size (e.g., if you wear UK 5, go for a UK 6).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep the white leather looking fresh, use a sneaker-specific wet wipe or a damp cloth with mild soap. For the suede toe cap, use a soft suede brush to remove dust and prevent matting.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
