th almost any outfit color.</li><li><strong>Premium Suede Reinforcements:</strong> The iconic <strong>T-toe overlay</strong> and heel cross are finished in fine grey/off-white suede, giving the shoe structural durability and a premium texture contrast.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Ground Feel:</strong> Equipped with a thin, flexible rubber outsole featuring the classic <strong>herringbone tread pattern</strong> for an authentic vintage tracking experience and clean urban grip.</li><li><strong>All-Day Comfort Insole:</strong> Includes an <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned sockliner</strong> for effective moisture management and impact absorption during long walking days.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Metallic\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Socks (White or Grey)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500 to Rs. 16,500</strong> (Official Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current Indian Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Girls/Junior Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Pure Silver / Off White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Leather Upper &amp; Suede T-Toe</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major premium footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> <strong>3–5 working days</strong> across India for metro cities via premium air couriers like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully available. Most top-tier 7A distributors request a small booking advance of <strong>Rs. 300–500</strong> to secure shipping.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant 10% discount for payments finalized via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 features a <strong>slim, tapered silhouette</strong>. For girls with wider feet or those who prefer a little extra toe room, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 4, order a UK 5).</p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
