im skirts, light-wash jeans, or loungewear.</li><li><strong>Classic Archive Architecture:</strong> Features the traditional cross-stitched <strong>T-toe suede overlay</strong> for toe-box reinforcement, thin athletic lacing, and the instantly recognizable fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> detailed with crisp logo branding.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Flexible Outsole:</strong> S sits on a thin, highly flexible rubber frame featuring a textured herringbone layout for dependable urban traction and an authentic retro stride.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Impact Insole:</strong> Outfitted inside with an upgraded, dense <strong>foam cushion bed</strong> designed to provide comfortable daily impact protection and effective arch support.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Silk Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Classic Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 11,500 to Rs. 15,699</strong> (Official Store &amp; Sourced Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Ladies Sizing / UK 3 to UK 6.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Core Black / Crisp White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Full-Grain Leather, Suede Overlays &amp; Textured Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 series is engineered with a <strong>distinctly narrow, form-fitting, and low-to-the-ground profile</strong>. If you have broad feet or fall between sizes, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 4, select a UK 5) to guarantee comfortable toe box room.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the sleek black leather finish and crisp white stripes, avoid using rigid wire brushes or machine washing. Gently clean off surface dust using a <strong>soft, slightly damp microfiber cloth</strong> mixed with a drop of mild sneaker shampoo. Always store them in a cool area out of intense, direct summer sunlight to protect the leather structure.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
