rlays on the T-toe and heel-cross for added durability and a vintage texture.</li><li><strong>Signature Design Details:</strong> Includes the classic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the cross-stitched heel reinforcement for that authentic 1966 track heritage.</li><li><strong>Urban Comfort Insole:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong>, providing superior shock absorption for all-day city walking.</li><li><strong>Flexible Traction Outsole:</strong> Features the traditional thin rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern for a grounded feel and reliable urban grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,500</strong> (Current 2026 market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (UK 3 to 6 / Women's W5 to W9)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Synthetic/Genuine Leather Mix &amp; Suede Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically verified via WhatsApp and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major distribution hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for smaller cities via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. For girls with standard or narrow feet, stay true to your Euro size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5) for better comfort across the midfoot. To clean, use a soft, dry brush for the suede toe and a damp cloth for the cream leather; avoid soaking the shoe to preserve the rich \"Coffee\" stripe color.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
