/li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>narrow, slim silhouette</strong>. For most girls, it fits true to size. However, if you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5) to ensure the slip-on entry isn't too tight. To clean, wipe the white panels with a damp cloth and use a soft brush to remove dust from the suede sections; avoid soaking to maintain the leather's shape.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
