text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | Cream/Black/Gold (Girls' &amp; Women's 7A First Copy)</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Elegant Retro Statement</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"Cream/Black/Gold\" is a premium, high-contrast edition of the iconic 1966 track silhouette, tailored for a slim and feminine fit. This <strong>7A Master Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica captures the refined aesthetic of the original, featuring a soft cream leather base with sharp black Tiger stripes and luxurious <strong>metallic gold accents</strong>. It is the ultimate choice for girls and women who want a vintage-inspired sneaker that offers both urban edge and daily comfort.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A top-tier 1:1 replica designed to mirror the authentic's narrow profile, signature heel flap, and lightweight construction.</li><li><strong>Premium Cream Leather Upper:</strong> Crafted with high-grade leather that provides a soft, supple feel and a sophisticated vintage look.</li><li><strong>Metallic Gold Details:</strong> Highlights include the gold \"MEXICO 66\" side branding and the metallic \"X\" stitching on the heel flap, adding a touch of glamour to the neutral palette.</li><li><strong>Heritage Suede Overlays:</strong> Features the classic greyish-beige suede T-toe cap, maintaining the authentic multi-textured design of the 1960s original.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-wicking, cushioned insole for superior shock absorption and all-day comfort for walking or commuting.</li><li><strong>Flexible Low-Profile Sole:</strong> A thin rubber outsole with a traditional herringbone tread pattern for excellent grip and a grounded, minimalist feel.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,499</strong> (Varies by seller in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Cream Base / Black Stripes / Metallic Gold Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from Indian hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium 7A vendors require a small advance \"token\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI or Bank Transfer.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>narrow, slim silhouette</strong>. For girls with standard feet, it usually fits true to size. However, if you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order UK 6) for a more comfortable fit across the midfoot. To clean, wipe the leather with a damp cloth and use a soft brush for the suede toe cap; avoid liquid cleaners on the gold branding to preserve the metallic finish.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
