amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD PF \"Pure Silver / Cream\" | 7A Premium</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Chunky Metallic Retro Icon</strong></h3><p>The <a href=\"https://google.com/search?q=Onitsuka+Tiger+Mexico+66+SD+PF+Pure+Silver+Cream&amp;prds=headlineOfferDocid%3A9429905246154701742%2Cproductid%3A9429905246154701742%2Cpvo%3A38%2Cpvt%3Ahg&amp;ibp=oshop&amp;gemcid=c_9e3e4e1f88054e5a&amp;gemrid=r_47cd60c14a246670&amp;pvo=38&amp;opi=103135050&amp;gl=IN&amp;hl=en-GB&amp;noiga=1\">Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD PF Pure Silver Cream</a> (Style Code: <strong>1183C156 020 / 1183B543</strong>) takes the futuristic metallic look of the Super Deluxe line and elevates it with a <strong>contemporary platform design</strong>. The \"PF\" designation stands for Platform, featuring a <strong>slightly thicker, modified sole construction</strong> that delivers a bolder visual presence. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> masterfully replicates the high-shine premium metallic leather upper, refined hardware, and augmented sole structure typical of the top-tier PF range.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality PF Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>supple metallic-coated kidskin leather upper</strong>. It captures the dis