ex Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Pure Silver / Cream (Style: 1183C156-020)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Metallic Coated Calf/Kidskin Leather</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
