:</strong> Upgraded with a slightly thicker <strong>platform rubber wedge midsole</strong> that yields reliable city-walking impact absorption while maintaining the iconic clean toe-box lines.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Footbed Tech:</strong> Includes a dense <strong>OrthoLite-style internal footbed</strong> engineered for breathability, shape retention, and premium step-in softness.</li><li><strong>Archive Detailing:</strong> Preserves the standard stitched <strong>T-toe overlay</strong> for structural protection alongside the signature fold-down heel tab showing clean branding.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Platform\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger PF Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; Sizing Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks (Black or White)</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Platform Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 15,500 to Rs. 18,500</strong> (Official Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Black / White / Cream Midsole</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Grained Calf Leather &amp; Durable Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><br><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Quality evaluated and dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong> from dominant premium replica logistics hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, 