tweight, cushioned thick foam sole that provides subtle height elevation without adding heavy bulk.</li><li><strong>Upgraded SD Cushioning:</strong> Fitted with an ergonomic, high-density shock-absorbing sockliner for enhanced arch support during all-day urban wear.</li><li><strong>Cross-Reinforced Heel &amp; Flap:</strong> Retains the iconic X-shaped heel cross reinforcement and fold-down heel tab displaying Onitsuka Tiger branding.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Platform SD Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 16,500 to Rs. 22,000</strong> (Official Boutique &amp; Imported Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Ladies Sizing / UK 3 to UK 6.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Crisp White / Birch Grey / Off-White Platform</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Full-Grain Leather, Suede Overlays &amp; Elevated Rubber Sole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Fits true to size with a comfortable, slightly padded interior. If you have broad feet or fall between sizes, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, choose UK 6) for optimal toe box comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean the white leather upper using a soft, damp microfiber cloth and mild sneaker cleanser. For the front grey suede T-toe cap, brush gently with a dry soft suede brush. Avoid submerging in water.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
