p;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 TGRS \"Ballerina / Mary Jane\" Black | 7A Premium Ladies Edition</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Hybrid Ballet-Sneaker Statement Icon</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 TGRS Ballerina in Jet Black</strong> reimagines the legendary 1966 track chassis as an elegant, feminine Mary Jane ballet flat. Seamlessly blending the delicate silhouette of ballet pumps with the athletic heritage of Onitsuka Tiger, this silhouette is one of the most sought-after trends in contemporary women's footwear.</p><p>This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> faithfully replicates the sleek low-profile footprint, premium soft leather construction, and the adjustable instep strap of the original release. Featuring an all-black leather upper with subtle tonal Tiger stripes and signature archive heel detailing, it serves as the ultimate chic, versatile shoe for everything from feminine dresses and pleated skirts to cropped denim and relaxed trousers.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 premium replica precisely engineered with <strong>supple full-grain black leather</strong> and smooth inner lining for a soft, foot-hugging fit.</li><li><strong>Chic Mary Jane / Ballerina Silhouette:</strong> Features a low-cut pump design with a spacious toe box, delicate instep strap, and flower-cut Onitsuka Tiger stripe accents for a refined, ballet-inspired look.</li><li><strong>Adjustable Instep Strap:</strong> Outfitted with an integrated elastic band and a <strong>3-setting adjustable buckle</strong> over the bridge for a snug, secure, and customizable fit.</li><li><strong>Monochrome Jet Black Palette:</strong> Styled in a sleek, minimalist all-black design with subtle tonal overlays, offering unmatched versatility across casual, edgy, and preppy outfits.</li><li><strong>Archival Heel Details:</strong> Retains the classic crossed-leather heel reinforcement panels and the signature fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> at the collar.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Flexible Outsole:</strong> Sits on a thin, highly flexible rubber frame featuring a textured tread pattern for authentic close-to-the-ground flexibility and daily urban traction.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Daily Insole:</strong> Fitted with a soft, shock-absorbing <strong>foam footbed</strong> engineered to provide long-lasting underfoot comfort and arch support.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Silk Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Ballerina / Mary Jane Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 18,000 to Rs. 28,000</strong> (Official Luxury Marketplace Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Girls / Ladies Sizing — UK 3 to UK 6.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Jet Black / Tonal Black / Off-White Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Full-Grain Leather, Elastic Bridge Strap &amp; Flexible Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express air services like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Ballerina / TGRS collection features a <strong>slim, low-slung pump profile</strong>. While the toe box is designed comfortably, if you have broader feet or fall between sizes, it is recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 4, select a UK 5) to ensure ideal comfort across the bridge.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To preserve the supple black leather finish, avoid machine washing or complete immersion in water. Wipe away surface dust gently using a <strong>soft microfiber cloth</strong> and apply a light coat of clear or black leather cream periodically. Store in a cool, dry area away from direct heat or sunlight.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a mexico","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
