   [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><p>helo</p><p>helo</p><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 TGRS \"Silver / Cream\" | 7A Premium Ladies Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Metallic Ballet-Pump Sneaker Hybrid</strong></h3><p>The <a href=\"https://google.com/search?q=Onitsuka+Tiger+Mexico+66+TGRS+Silver+Cream+(W)+SILVER+/+UK+5+Sneaker&amp;prds=headlineOfferDocid%3A13064979314655438759%2Cproductid%3A13064979314655438759%2Cpvo%3A38%2Cpvt%3Ahg&amp;ibp=oshop&amp;gemcid=c_9e3e4e1f88054e5a&amp;gemrid=r_48a8a6dfb5a3e444&amp;pvo=38&amp;opi=103135050&amp;gl=IN&amp;hl=en-GB&amp;noiga=1\">Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 TGRS Silver Cream</a> brings an avant-garde, feminine transformation to the brand's legendary 1966 track legacy. Blending the casual versatility of a classic sneaker with the sleek shape of a ballerina pump, the <strong>TGRS collection</strong> drops traditional athletic lacing in favor of an elegant, single <strong>midfoot Mary-Jane strap with an adjustable buckle</strong>.</p><p>This coveted edition pairs a shimmering, liquid <strong>metallic silver premium leather body</strong> with soft, vintage <strong>cream overlays</strong> forming the iconic flower-cut tiger stripes. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> masterfully replicates the signature slim profile, structural cross-heel reinforcement, and delicate design details that make this a standout lifestyle fashion piece.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Elegant Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 premium replica designed to mirror the exact low-slung, elongated footprint of this specialized ladies' hybrid. Constructed from soft, supple leather that provides a premium finish entirely free of rough factory seams.</li><li><strong>Liquid Metallic Silver Finish:</strong> Features a reflective <strong>silver leather base</strong> across the upper, providing a polished, futuristic look that is beautifully balanced by contrasting <strong>cream leather racing stripes</strong> featuring specialized <strong>flower-cut edge detailing</strong>.</li><li><strong>Adjustable Instep Buckle Strap:</strong> Outfitted with an elegant mary-jane style midfoot strap anchored by a flexible elastic band, finished with a <strong>three-setting adjustable metal buckle</strong> for a personalized, secure, and supportive fit.</li><li><strong>Spacious Toe Box Engineering:</strong> While maintaining an ultra-sleek, narrow silhouette from the outside, the interior is constructed with <strong>additional room around the toes</strong> to maximize daily comfort and prevent squeezing.</li><li><strong>Classic Archive Accents:</strong> Preserves the authentic crossed leather reinforcement panels at the heel counters, along with the signature fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> in contrasting cream.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Vulcanized Outsole:</strong> Sits on a thin, highly flexible rubber frame with a textured herringbone tread layout for lightweight city traction and a authentic retro stride.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Silk Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 TGRS Ballerina Hybrid Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 14,500 to Rs. 19,999</strong> (Official Store &amp; Sourced Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,600 to Rs. 4,600</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Ladies Sizing / UK 3 to UK 6.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Metallic Silver / Soft Cream / Off White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Cowhide Leather Upper &amp; Durable Textured Rubber Sole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 TGRS series is engineered with a slim, elegant silhouette. Although the toe region features integrated extra room compared to standard track variants, it is built on a narrow matrix. If you have broader feet or fall between sizes, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 4, select a UK 5) to guarantee a perfectly relaxed fit.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the specialized liquid metallic silver finish and cream overlays, avoid rough plastic bristled brushes or intense machine washing. Gently clean off surface dust using a <strong>soft, slightly damp microfiber cloth</strong> mixed with a drop of mild sneaker shampoo. Always store them in a cool area out of intense, direct summer sunlight to protect the leather structure.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+5uk4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
