base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><p>helo</p><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger x Versace Tai Chi \"Sakura Gold Siver \" | 7A Premium Unisex Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Italian Luxury Meets Japanese Artisanal Hybrid</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger x Versace Tai Chi \"Sakura Tan \"</strong> represents an exclusive crossover between Japanese heritage sports performance and Italian high-fashion luxury. Crafted on the iconic low-slung <strong>Tai Chi</strong> martial-arts silhouette, this iteration features a smooth, vintage-washed soft suede and leather upper finished in a delicate <strong>Sakura Tan </strong>tone.</p><p>Accented by double-stitched Onitsuka Tiger racing stripes and a Signature 3D Gold Medusa stud embellishment on the tongue, this <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> faithfully mirrors the luxury craftsmanship, washed patina treatment, and high-end detailing of the runway release.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Luxury Build:</strong> High-tier 1:1 master replica engineered to capture the exact ultra-low, flexible profile of the Tai Chi silhouette with precision stitching throughout.</li><li><strong>Premium Sakura Blue Suede &amp; Leather:</strong> Built with a washed soft-touch Sakura light blue upper paired with contrasting crisp white racing stripes.</li><li><strong>Versace Gold Medusa Hardware:</strong> Features a signature metallic gold 3D Medusa emblem stud integrated onto the tongue, delivering an unmistakable high-fashion accent.</li><li><strong>Vintage Washed Patina Finish:</strong> Hand-treated surface wash accurately replicates the artisanal aged effect seen on the authentic runway collaboration pairs.</li><li><strong>Ultra-Flexible Flat Rubber Sole:</strong> Built with a low-profile, high-flexibility rubber outsole designed for natural foot movement and light urban walking.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Interior Footbed:</strong> Outfitted with an ergonomic, high-rebound foam sockliner featuring dual-branded Onitsuka Tiger x Versace insignia.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger x Versace Dual-Branded Luxury Box</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Monogram Tissue Paper &amp; Authenticity Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 High-Fashion Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 70,000 to Rs. 75,000 (Official Runway &amp; Import Boutique Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 45 (Unisex Sizing / UK 3.5 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Sakura Light Blue / Vintage White / Metallic Gold</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Washed Suede Leather, Premium Leather Stripes &amp; Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express logistics like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipping details and prevent unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Enjoys <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Tai Chi model features a slim, narrow, and low-to-the-ground martial arts fit. If you have wide feet or fall between sizes, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 8, choose a UK 9) for a comfortable fit.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Due to the delicate washed suede upper, do not submerge in water or use harsh detergent cleansers. Clean surface dust using a soft suede brush or dry microfiber cloth. Treat with a suede protector spray to maintain the light blue hue.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+5UK4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
