hioning: Includes a moisture-managing, cushioned footbed designed for all-day urban comfort and shock absorption.Grip &amp; Flexibility: Features the signature thin rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern, providing a grounded feel and reliable urban traction.Product SpecificationsFeatureDetailsQuality Grade7A / Master Copy (Laceless Tier)Price RangeRs. 3,500 (Current 2026 market price in India)Sizes AvailableEuro 36 to 41 (UK 3.5 to 7.5 / Women's)Primary MaterialCanvas / Suede Accents / Rubber OutsolePackagingIncludes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tagsShipping &amp; Delivery (India)Express Dispatch: Orders are typically processed and shipped within 24 hours from major Indian hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.Estimated Timeline: 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express.Payment Options:Cash on Delivery (COD): Available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (Rs. 200 to Rs. 500) to confirm the order.Prepaid Benefits: Often includes free shipping or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.Sizing &amp; Care TipFit Note: The Slip-On model is designed to be snug due to the internal elastic band. If you have standard or narrow feet, stay true to your Euro size. If you have wider feet or a high instep, it is highly recommended to order one size up (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order UK 6) to ensure the elastic doesn't feel too tight across the top of your foot. To clean, use a soft, dry brush for the suede toe and a damp cloth for the birch canvas; avoid soaking the shoe to keep the internal elastic's tension intact.</p></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Copy Onitsuk_a","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
