   [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 TGRS \"Yellow / Black\" | 7A Premium Ladies Sneakers</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Cinematic Kill Bill Ballerina-Sneaker Hybrid</strong></h3><p>The <a href=\"https://google.com/search?q=Onitsuka+Tiger+Mexico+66+Tgrs+Slip-On+Shoe+with+Buckle+Strap+For+Women+(Yellow,+3.5)&amp;prds=headlineOfferDocid%3A18207520727574769983%2Cproductid%3A18207520727574769983%2Cpvo%3A38%2Cpvt%3Ahg&amp;ibp=oshop&amp;gemcid=c_9e3e4e1f88054e5a&amp;gemrid=r_a1636c3d54aee6ee&amp;pvo=38&amp;opi=103135050&amp;gl=IN&amp;hl=en-GB&amp;noiga=1\">Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 TGRS Yellow &amp; Black</a> brings an incredibly bold, cinematic color palette to the brand's premium feminine hybrid lineup. Channeling the legendary graphic energy of the \"Kill Bill\" look, this model swaps out standard lacing for a sleek, adjustable <strong>Mary-Jane midfoot strap with a metal buckle</strong>.</p><p>This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> masterfully executes the striking contrast between the <strong>vivid yellow leather body</strong> and the pitch-black, <strong>flower-cut Onitsuka Tiger stripes</strong>. Combining the low-slung, delicate stance of a ballerina pump with the durable rubber traction of a retro track shoe, this pair makes an absolute statement in street fashion.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Elegant Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 replica precisely crafted to copy the elongated silhouette and narrow, elegant frame of this specialized women's hybrid. Outfitted with soft leather for a premium, seam-free finish.</li><li><strong>Graphic \"Kill Bill\" Palette:</strong> Features a bright <strong>yellow leather upper</strong> sharply offset by rich <strong>black leather racing stripes</strong> engineered with unique <strong>flower-cut detailing</strong> along the edges.</li><li><strong>Adjustable Instep Buckle Strap:</strong> Dropping standard athletic laces, it features a single midfoot strap anchored on a flexible elastic insert with a <strong>three-setting metal buckle</strong> for tailored support and easy slip-on utility.</li><li><strong>Spacious Toe Box Design:</strong> Specially sculpted on the interior matrix to provide <strong>extra wiggle room around the toes</strong>, ensuring all-day urban comfort despite its sleek, low-profile exterior appearance.</li><li><strong>Classic Cross-Heel Counter:</strong> Retains the authentic vintage crossed leather reinforcement panels at the heel counters, along with the iconic fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> in black.</li><li><strong>Flexible Low-Profile Outsole:</strong> Sits on a thin, highly flexible <strong>black rubber outsole</strong> utilizing a textured herringbone tread for dependable daily city grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 TGRS Pump Hybrid Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 13,500 to Rs. 18,999</strong> (Official Store &amp; Sourced Retail Rates in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,600 to Rs. 4,600</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Ladies Sizing / UK 3 to UK 6.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Vibrant Yellow / Core Black / Charcoal</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Synthetic &amp; Cowhide Leather Upper &amp; Durable Rubber Sole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express air couriers like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to protect against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts completed upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 TGRS series is engineered with a slim, elegant silhouette. Although the toe region features integrated extra room compared to standard track variants, it is built on a narrow matrix. If you have broader feet or fall between sizes, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 4, select a UK 5) to guarantee a perfectly relaxed fit.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0n!+5uK@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"