isticated base that hides dirt and wear, accented by crisp white Tiger stripes for an iconic pop.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Mix:</strong> Typically crafted from a high-quality leather/synthetic upper with the signature <strong>greyish suede</strong> T-toe overlay to maintain the classic vintage texture.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Comfort:</strong> Includes a cushioned, moisture-wicking insole designed to provide soft support for all-day urban walking.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Features the classic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement for added stability and retro charm.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Urban Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,499 (Varies by seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's W5.5 to W10.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Type</strong></td><td>Laceless Slip-On (Elastic Instep)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi).</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metro cities; 5–7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available through specialized 7A sellers. A small security deposit (Rs.200–Rs. 500) may be required to confirm shipping.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Many sellers offer <strong>free shipping</strong> or an additional 5–10% discount for UPI/Bank Transfer payments.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>narrow, slim silhouette</strong>. For most girls, it fits true to size. However, if you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5) to ensure the slip-on entry isn't too tight. To clean, wipe with a damp cloth for the black panels and use a soft brush to remove dust from the suede sections; avoid soaking the shoe to maintain the internal elastic's tension.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+$uk@ Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
