/strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Golf model features a streamlined, low-to-the-ground fit. If you have broad feet or plan to wear thick golf socks, select <strong>one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 7, select a UK 8) for optimal toe box comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Wipe dirt and turf residue off the leather upper using a damp microfiber cloth and mild sneaker cleaner. Air dry naturally at room temperature away from direct sunlight.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"0N!+$uk4 Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
