dium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Jeep Outdoor Shoes Women's Low Top \"Beige / Sand Neutral\" | 7A Premium Edition</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Rugged All-Terrain Utility Sneaker</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Jeep Outdoor Women's Low Top in Beige</strong> delivers an elevated, warm-toned utility aesthetic for modern outdoor explorers and gorpcore fashion enthusiasts. Engineered to combine trail-ready ruggedness with a sophisticated earth-toned color palette, this sneaker seamlessly bridges functional adventure footwear and modern urban streetwear.</p><p>This <strong>7A Premium Master Quality edition</strong> faithfully replicates the heavy-duty multi-layer construction, protective rubber mudguards, trail-grip lugged outsole, and supportive footbed of the original outdoor release. Dressed in a monochromatic mix of sandy beige, soft oat, and subtle warm tan accents, it serves as the ultimate neutral footwear anchor for outdoor hikes, travel, and daily casual wear.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality All-Terrain Build:</strong> Engineered with high-density synthetic suede overlays, breathable ripstop mesh, and heavy-duty double stitching designed for durability and weather resilience.</li><li><strong>Versatile Neutral Beige Palette:</strong> Styled in a layered blend of <strong>sandy beige, warm oat, and taupe tones</strong>, offering an effortless match for neutral cargos, denim, and outdoor activewear.</li><li><strong>Reinforced Protective Bumpers:</strong> Outfitted with durable rubberized toe caps and wrap-around mudguards to shield against rocks, gravel, and urban terrain wear.</li><li><strong>High-Traction Lugged Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features a deep-cleat rubber tread designed to deliver maximum grip, slip resistance, and stability across loose soil, wet pavement, and rocky paths.</li><li><strong>Utility Ergonomic Lacing System:</strong> Equipped with reinforced cord loops, metal lace hooks, and thick round utility laces for a tight, customizable, and foot-securing fit.</li><li><strong>Shock-Absorbing Cushion Midsole:</strong> Integrated with a contoured EVA foam midsole that minimizes foot fatigue by absorbing impact during long walks and rugged outdoor treks.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Jeep Branded Box (With Accurate Model &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Outdoor Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 7,500 to Rs. 11,500</strong> (Official Retail / Sourced Import Rates)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Girls / Ladies Sizing — UK 3 to UK 6.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Sand Beige / Warm Oat / Taupe / Off-White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Synthetic Suede Overlays, Ripstop Textile &amp; Lugged Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable express air couriers (BlueDart / Delhivery Air).</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Jeep Outdoor Low Tops feature a <strong>structured protective toe box</strong>. If you plan to wear thick hiking socks or have slightly wide feet, it is recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, select UK 5) for ideal toe room and comfort.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean surface mud or dirt using a <strong>soft-bristled brush</strong> or damp cloth with mild footwear shampoo. Avoid machine washing or soaking in water to preserve the synthetic overlays and lugged outsole bonding. Apply a hydrophobic water-and-stain protector spray before outdoor use to protect the light beige synthetic suede. Store in a cool, ventilated place away from direct heat sources.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"J33p Outdoor","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
