ng</strong>, heel loops, and branding details for an elevated natural aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Reinforced Toe &amp; Heel Bumpers:</strong> Outfitted with protective rubberized mudguards and toe caps to protect against trails, gravel, and urban terrain obstacles.</li><li><strong>High-Traction Lug Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features a deep-tread rubber outsole engineered for superior grip, slip resistance, and stability across uneven trail surfaces and wet pavement.</li><li><strong>Ergonomic Trail Lacing System:</strong> Built with reinforced lace loops and thick round utility laces to ensure a customized, locked-in, and supportive instep fit.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Shock-Absorbing Midsole:</strong> Integrated with a responsive foam midsole core designed to absorb impact and reduce foot strain during long walks, outdoor hikes, or daily urban wear.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Jeep Branded Box (With Accurate Model &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Outdoor Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 7,500 to Rs. 11,500</strong> (Official Retail / Sourced Import Rates)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,200</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Girls / Ladies Sizing — UK 3 to UK 6.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Cream / Light Sage Green / Sand Beige / Off-White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Ripstop Textile, Synthetic Suede Overlays &amp; Lugged Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody>