ng on clouds\" bounce.</li><li>Functional Heel Pull-Tab:&nbsp;Includes the reinforced rear pull-tab with the correct black-and-white dotted stitching,&nbsp;maintaining the classic 2017 silhouette.</li><li>Translucent White Outsole:&nbsp;A milky white TPU cage houses the white Boost core,&nbsp;finished with a rugged herringbone tread for superior urban grip and durability.</li><li>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:<ul><li>Yeezy 350 Branded Box (Correct CP9654 SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>StockX or Goat-style Authentication Tag &amp; Certificate</li><li>Branded Crew Socks (White or Zebra-themed)</li><li>Adidas/Yeezy Dust Bag &amp; Premium Carry Bag</li><li>Set of Round Tonal White Laces</li></ul></li></ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Quality Grade</td><td>Semi-UA / 7A+ (Highest Replica Tier)</td></tr><tr><td>Price Range</td><td>Rs. 3,100 to Rs. 4,500&nbsp;(Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td>Sizes Available</td><td>Euro 41 to 47 (UK 7 to 13 / Men?s)</td></tr><tr><td>Colorway</td><td>White / Core Black / Red (Zebra)</td></tr><tr><td>SKU Reference</td><td>CP9654</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</h3><ul><li>Direct Dispatch:&nbsp;Usually shipped from premium hubs in&nbsp;Surat,&nbsp;Delhi,&nbsp;or Mumbai within&nbsp;24 hours.</li><li>Estimated Timeline:&nbsp;3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai,&nbsp;Bangalore,&nbsp;Delhi) via&nbsp;BlueDart or Delhivery Air.</li><li>Payment Details:<ul><li>Cash on Delivery (COD):&nbsp;Available.&nbsp;Most 7A+ sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of&nbsp;Rs. 500&nbsp;to confirm the order.</li><li>Prepaid Benefits:&nbsp;Often includes&nbsp;Free Shipping&nbsp;and an additional 10 to 15% discount via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</h3><blockquote><p>Fit Note:&nbsp;The Zebra Primeknit is slightly firmer than monochromatic versions. It is highly recommended to&nbsp;order one full size up&nbsp;from your standard UK size (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9) as they run quite snug. To maintain the white knit, use a specialized sneaker foam and a soft brush; avoid wearing them in muddy conditions to prevent staining the white translucent sole.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"4di_das Yeezy","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
