andard UK size (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order UK 9). To protect the reflective stripe, use a soft microfiber cloth and specialized sneaker foam; avoid using stiff brushes on the stripe area as it can fray the 3M reflective fibers over time.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Adi_da$ Yeezy","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
