li><li><strong>Girls/Junior Sizing:</strong> Specifically tailored for a narrower, more compact fit suitable for girls and younger sneakerheads, while maintaining the iconic adult silhouette.</li><li><strong>Full \"Hype\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Adidas Yeezy 350 V2 Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Semi-UA Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 25,000 to Rs. 35,000</strong> (Official Resale Market)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,299 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (UK 3 to UK 6)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Clay / Clay / Clay</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Flexible Primeknit &amp; Rubber</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Dispatch Hubs:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped from regional centers in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery Timeline:</strong> Expect delivery in <strong>3–5 working days</strong> for metro cities via premium couriers like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available; most sellers require a small advance <strong>\"security\" deposit of Rs. 300–500</strong> to confirm the booking.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Yeezy 350 V2s are known for having a very tight, snug fit, especially in the toe box. It is <strong>highly recommended to order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order a UK 5) to ensure a comfortable fit.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the Primeknit upper, avoid using heavy water or machines. Use a <strong>soft sneaker brush</strong> and a dedicated foam cleaner for the fabric. For the translucent sole, a <strong>damp microfiber cloth</strong> will keep it clear and free of yellowing.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"AdiDas Yeezy","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
