zys are known for.</li><li><strong>TPU Ribbed Midsole:</strong> The milky, semi-translucent rubber cage protects the Boost core while offering a sleek, \"frosted\" aesthetic that complements the \"Static\" theme.</li><li><strong>Premium Build Details:</strong> Includes a sturdy <strong>heel pull-tab</strong> with internal stitching and integrated rope laces that also feature reflective detailing.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"UA\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Adidas Yeezy 350 Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Authentication Card &amp; Tags</li><li>Branded Crew Socks (White or Grey)</li><li>Premium Shoe Horn or Keychain</li><li>Yeezy Canvas Dust Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>Semi-UA / 7A+ (Master Quality)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 45,000 to Rs. 75,000</strong> (Official Reflective Resale Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,600 to Rs. 4,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Girls/Youth Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Static / Static / Static (Reflective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>EF2367</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Dispatched from dedicated premium footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> <strong>3 to 5 working days</strong> for metro cities via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Typically requires a small <strong>Rs. 500 advance</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for UPI payments.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The 350 V2 silhouette fits <strong>small and snug</strong>. For growing feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if she wears UK 4, order a UK 5).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To preserve the reflective 3M coating, avoid using harsh chemicals or stiff brushes. Clean with a <strong>soft microfiber cloth</strong> and mild sneaker soap. Always use a <strong>repellent spray</strong> to prevent dirt from settling into the intricate Primeknit weave.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"@didas Yeezy","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
