ium Material Mix:</strong> Crafted with a high-quality <strong>synthetic leather or canvas</strong> upper and the signature <strong>suede T-toe overlay</strong> for added durability and vintage texture.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-wicking, cushioned insole that offers superior shock absorption for all-day city walking.</li><li><strong>Thin Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features the traditional flexible rubber sole with a herringbone tread for reliable grip on urban surfaces.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,500 (Varies by seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's W5 to W10)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Type</strong></td><td>Laceless Slip-On (Elastic Instep)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders typically ship within <strong>24 hours</strong> from Indian hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"token\" fee (Rs. 200?Rs. 500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>narrow, slim silhouette</strong>. For most girls, it fits true to size. However, if you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order UK 6) for a more comfortable fit across the midfoot. To clean, wipe with a damp cloth for the main body and use a soft brush for the suede toe cap; avoid soaking to maintain the shoe's shape.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
