5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Serrano \"Soft Sky / White / Silver\" | 7A Premium</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Lightweight Track-Inspired Classic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Serrano in \"Soft Sky / White / Silver\"</strong> is a fresh, feminine take on the legendary track spike silhouette of the 1970s. Known for its ultra-slim profile and feather-light weight, the Serrano is the perfect lifestyle sneaker for those who prefer a less bulky, more streamlined look. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> captures the delicate \"Soft Sky\" blue palette, making it an ideal choice for girls who want a mix of athletic heritage and modern pastel aesthetics.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A 1:1 premium replica featuring a <strong>breathable nylon and soft suede upper</strong>. The construction maintains the Serrano's signature lightweight feel and flexible forefoot, staying true to its racing roots.</li><li><strong>Pastel \"Soft Sky\" Palette:</strong> The <strong>Soft Sky (Light Blue)</strong> nylon body is accented by crisp <strong>White tiger stripes</strong> and shimmering <strong>Silver heel details</strong>. This airy colorway provides a clean, summery vibe that pairs easily with white denim or athletic skirts.</li><li><strong>Streamlined Slim Silhouette:</strong> Features a thin, low-profile midsole that keeps the foot close to the ground, offering a \"barefoot\" feel while providing enough cushioning for daily city walking.</li><li><strong>Signature Spiked Outsole:</strong> Equipped with a unique <strong>knobby rubber outsole</strong> inspired by vintage track spikes, providing excellent multi-surface grip and a distinctive visual profile.</li><li><strong>Plush Padded Collar:</strong> Includes a soft, lined collar and a cushioned <strong>OrthoLite-style insole</strong> to ensure all-day comfort without adding unnecessary bulk.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Girls Heritage\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Crew or Ankle Socks (White or Light Blue)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 7,999 to Rs. 9,500</strong> (Official Store Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,800 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Girls/Junior Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Soft Sky / White / Silver</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Lightweight Nylon &amp; Premium Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Recommended Lifestyle Options</strong></h3><p>The Onitsuka Tiger Serrano Soft Sky is the definitive choice for this lightweight, track-inspired look. If you are looking for a slightly more structured heritage option in a similar soft blue palette, the Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Blue White offers the same iconic stripes with a slightly firmer leather build.</p><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major logistics hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> <strong>3–5 working days</strong> for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Typically requires a small <strong>Rs. 300–500 advance</strong> as a security fee.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and extra discounts for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Serrano has a <strong>very slim and narrow-fit design</strong>. For girls with wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order a UK 5).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To maintain the \"Soft Sky\" nylon, avoid heavy water exposure. Use a <strong>soft dry brush</strong> for the suede parts and a <strong>mild sneaker wipes</strong> for the nylon panels. Applying a <strong>protector spray</strong> before the first wear will help prevent the light blue fabric from staining.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
