the T-toe and heel-cross for added durability and a vintage finish.</li><li><strong>Slim-Profile Elegance:</strong> Maintains the iconic 1960s track shape that provides a streamlined, feminine look and a \"barefoot\" grounded feel.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-wicking, cushioned insole designed to offer modern impact protection and all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Signature Design Details:</strong> Includes the classic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the cross-stitched heel reinforcement that are hallmarks of the 1966 design.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Tonal Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,600</strong> (Standard 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's W5 to W10)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Style Code</strong></td><td>1183A201.304 (Reference)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs (Surat, Delhi, Mumbai).</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow and streamlined fit</strong>. For girls with standard or narrow feet, stay true to your Euro size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order UK 6) for better comfort across the midfoot. To maintain the \"Airy Green\" hue, wipe the leather gently with a damp cloth and use a soft suede brush for the toe overlays; avoid using harsh chemicals that could fade the delicate green pigments.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
