pping</strong> and an additional 10% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe/GPay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Slip-On model has a <strong>snugger fit</strong> due to the internal elastic. If you have a high instep or prefer a more relaxed feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, go for a UK 5.5 or 6).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Black canvas/leather is excellent at hiding dirt, but the yellow stripes can attract dust. Use a soft brush for the body and a damp cloth with mild soap for the yellow stripes to keep them vibrant. Avoid machine washing, as it may damage the elastic.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
