 a fresh, organic look.</li><li><strong>Laceless Design:</strong> Engineered with a hidden internal elastic band under the tongue, ensuring the shoe stays secure on your foot without the need for laces.</li><li><strong>Suede Reinforcements:</strong> Retains the signature <strong>light grey or tonal suede</strong> overlays on the T-toe and heel-cross for added durability and retro texture.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-wicking, cushioned insole designed to offer all-day comfort for urban exploration.</li><li><strong>Flexible Traction Sole:</strong> Features the traditional thin rubber outsole with a herringbone tread pattern for a grounded feel and reliable grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Canvas Laceless Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400</strong> (Standard 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Durable Canvas / Suede Accents / Rubber Outsole</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs (Surat, Delhi, Mumbai).</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The canvas material provides a bit more \"give\" than leather, but the slip-on elastic keeps the fit <strong>snug</strong>. For girls with narrow or standard feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5) to ensure the elastic doesn't feel too tight across the top of your foot. To clean, use a soft brush with mild soapy water for the canvas; avoid soaking the shoe to maintain the internal elastic's tension.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
