lue and red Tiger stripes, perfectly matching the original Olympic-inspired color scheme.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Comfort:</strong> Includes a cushioned, moisture-wicking insole designed to provide soft, springy support for all-day urban walking.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Features the classic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement for added stability.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Heritage Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,500 (Standard 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's W5 to W10)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Type</strong></td><td>Laceless Slip-On (Elastic Instep)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Fast delivery to major cities like Mumbai, Delhi, Surat, and Bangalore via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metro cities; 5–7 days for other regions.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (Rs. 200–Rs. 500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>narrow and slim cut</strong>. For girls with standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order UK 6) for a more comfortable fit across the midfoot. To clean, wipe with a damp cloth for the white panels and use a soft suede brush for the toe cap; avoid soaking to maintain the leather's shape.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
