&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Beige Grey\" | Girls' 7A Premium Quality</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Sophisticated Neutral</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Beige Grey\"</strong> (often referred to as <i>Pale Beige/Grey Floss</i>) is the ultimate choice for a clean, muted, and aesthetic look. Perfectly blending warm beige tones with cool grey accents, this <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition is specifically tailored for a feminine profile. It is a highly versatile sneaker that fits effortlessly into the \"clean girl\" aesthetic, pairing beautifully with linen trousers, neutral knits, or casual summer dresses.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Leather:</strong> Crafted with soft, premium leather that mirrors the lightweight and flexible feel of the original, ensuring it molds to the foot for long-term comfort.</li><li><strong>Muted Grey Floss Stripes:</strong> The iconic Tiger stripes are finished in a subtle, cool grey that provides a sophisticated contrast against the warm beige base without being overpowering.</li><li><strong>Suede T-Toe Overlay:</strong> Features the characteristic grey suede reinforcement on the toe cap and heel for added texture and a high-end, multi-tonal finish.</li><li><strong>Feminine Slim Silhouette:</strong> Re-engineered with a slightly narrower midfoot and sleek proportions to ensure a flattering and elegant fit for women's feet.</li><li><strong>Signature Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the cross-stitched heel reinforcement that defines the 1966 track icon.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct Pale Beige/Grey Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Invisible or Ankle Socks (Beige or White)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 12,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,200 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Girls' Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Pale Beige / Grey Floss / Cream</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183A201.251 (Typical for Beige/Grey variants)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major footwear hubs like <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium sellers require an advance \"booking\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>narrow, slim-fit design</strong>. If you have wider feet or prefer a bit more room, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order a UK 5.5 or 6).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep the beige leather looking fresh, use a soft damp cloth for the main panels and a specialized suede brush for the grey toe cap. Applying a water-repellent spray is recommended to protect the light colors from dust and liquid stains.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
