 standout lifestyle fashion statement.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Elegant Build:</strong> A high-tier 1:1 premium replica designed to mirror the exact low-slung, elongated footprint of this specialized ladies' hybrid. Constructed from soft, supple leather that provides a premium finish entirely free of rough factory seams.</li><li><strong>Soft Pink Cameo Palette:</strong> Features a muted, pastel <strong>pink leather upper</strong>, delivering a subtle and highly versatile feminine aesthetic that is beautifully balanced by matching leather racing stripes with specialized <strong>flower-cut edge detailing</strong>.</li><li><strong>Adjustable Instep Buckle Strap:</strong> Outfitted with an elegant Mary-Jane style midfoot strap anchored by a flexible elastic band, finished with a <strong>three-setting adjustable metal buckle</strong> for a personalized, secure, and supportive fit.</li><li><strong>Spacious Toe Box Engineering:</strong> While maintaining an ultra-sleek, narrow silhouette from the outside, the interior is constructed with <strong>additional room around the toes</strong> to maximize daily comfort and prevent squeezing.</li><li><strong>Classic Archive Accents:</strong> Preserves the authentic crossed leather reinforcement panels at the heel counters, along with the signature fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> at the collar.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Vulcanized Outsole:</strong> Sits on a thin, highly flexible cream rubber frame with a textured herringbone tread layout for lightweight city traction and an authentic retro stride.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Silk Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\