te. Although the toe region features integrated extra room compared to standard track variants, it is built on a narrow matrix. If you have broader feet or fall between sizes, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 4, select a UK 5) to guarantee a perfectly relaxed fit.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the soft pastel finish and delicate overlays, avoid rough plastic bristled brushes or intense machine washing. Gently clean off surface dust using a <strong>soft, slightly damp microfiber cloth</strong> mixed with a drop of mild sneaker shampoo. Always store them in a cool area out of intense, direct summer sunlight to protect the leather structure</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
