 three-setting metal buckle for tailored support and easy slip-on utility.Spacious Toe Box Design: Specially sculpted on the interior matrix to provide extra wiggle room around the toes, ensuring all-day urban comfort despite its sleek, low-profile exterior appearance.Classic Cross-Heel Counter: Retains the authentic vintage crossed leather reinforcement panels at the heel counters, along with the iconic fold-down Onitsuka Tiger heel flap in black.Flexible Low-Profile Outsole: Sits on a thin, highly flexible black rubber outsole utilizing a textured herringbone tread for dependable daily city grip.Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)Brand-Accurate Logo Silk Tissue Paper &amp; TagsComplimentary Branded Premium SocksPremium Canvas Storage Carry BagProduct SpecificationsFeatureDetailsQuality Grade7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 TGRS Pump Hybrid Tier)Retail PriceRs. 13,500 to Rs. 18,999 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Retail Rates in India)Market Price (7A)Rs. 3,600 to Rs. 4,600 (Current India Market Rate)Sizes AvailableEuro 36 to 40 (Ladies Sizing / UK 3 to UK 6.5)ColorwayVibrant Yellow / Core Black / CharcoalPrimary MaterialPremium Synthetic &amp; Cowhide Leather Upper &amp; Durable Rubber SoleShipping &amp; Delivery (India)Direct Dispatch: Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within 24 hours from premier footwear distribution hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.Estimated Timeline: Delivered directly to major Indian metros within 3–5 business days via reliable express air couriers like BlueDart or Delhivery Air.Payment Terms:Cash on Delivery (COD): Fully supported across India. Most 7A suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of Rs. 300 to Rs. 500 upfront to protect against unconfirmed returns.Prepaid Advantage: Grants Free Shipping and an instant 10% cash discount on checkouts completed upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).Sizing &amp; Care TipFit Note: The Mexico 66 TGRS series is engineered with a slim, elegant silhouette. Although the toe region features integrated extra room compared to standard track variants, it is built on a narrow matrix. If you have broader feet or fall between sizes, it is highly recommended to order one size up (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 4, select a UK 5) to guarantee a perfectly relaxed fit.Care: To safeguard the vibrant yellow finish and black overlays, avoid rough plastic bristled brushes or intense machine washing. Gently clean off surface dust using a soft, slightly damp microfiber cloth mixed with a drop of mild sneaker shampoo. Always store them in a cool area out of intense, direct summer sunlight to protect the leather structure.</p></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
