ong>Premium Material Mix:</strong> Crafted from high-grade <strong>synthetic leather</strong> or core leather with tonal <strong>suede overlays</strong> on the T-toe for that signature multi-textured vintage finish.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the much-loved \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and cross-stitched heel reinforcement for stability and retro charm.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned footbed and a flexible, textured rubber outsole for a grounded feel and reliable urban grip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Replica)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 2,999 to ?3,500 (Varies by seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's W5 to W10)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Type</strong></td><td>Laceless Slip-On (Heritage Lifestyle)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> from major hubs (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi).</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metro cities; 5–7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"token\" fee (Rs. 200–Rs. 500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 5–10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>narrow, slim silhouette</strong>. For most girls, it fits true to size. However, if you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5) to ensure the slip-on entry isn't too tight. To clean, wipe the white panels with a damp cloth and use a soft brush to remove dust from the suede sections; avoid soaking to maintain the leather's shape.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
