rong>White or Digital Lavender</strong> canvas/leather base for maximum contrast.</li><li><strong>Durable Upper:</strong> Typically made from high-grade <strong>Canvas or Synthetic Leather</strong>, reinforced with suede overlays on the T-toe and heel for that authentic heritage texture.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Insole:</strong> Features a replicated <strong>OrthoLite-style sockliner</strong> for moisture management and soft cushioning during long hours of city walking.</li><li><strong>Signature Heel Detail:</strong> Includes the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap that flips up?a hallmark of the Mexico 66 series.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (High-End Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,500 (Standard 7A pricing in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Canvas / Synthetic Leather / Suede Overlays</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Typically includes brand-accurate Onitsuka Tiger box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Nationwide Express:</strong> Shipping available to all major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Usually within <strong>24 hours</strong> of order confirmation.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?20