r added structure and style.</li><li><strong>Comfort Engineering:</strong> Equipped with an <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> for moisture management and all-day impact absorption.</li><li><strong>Slim Rubber Outsole:</strong> Features the traditional thin, flexible rubber tread that provides a grounded feel and vintage track appeal.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (High-End Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,200 (Approx. 7A market price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Colorway</strong></td><td>Cream White with Emerald/Spinach Green stripes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Typically includes brand-accurate Onitsuka Tiger box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Nationwide Reach:</strong> Fast shipping is available to all major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via trusted partners like <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24?48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most 7A sellers may request a small advance \"token\" fee (?200??500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>very snug, narrow fit</strong> due to the internal elastic band. For girls with standard feet, stay true to size. If you have wider feet or prefer a relaxed feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5). To clean, use a soft brush with mild soap for the canvas and a damp cloth for the stripes.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
