cess the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, slim fit</strong>. For most girls, it fits true to size. However, if they have wider feet or are in between sizes, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if they wear UK 4, order UK 5) to ensure comfort. To maintain the \"Iron Navy\" color, avoid direct sunlight which can fade dark leather; use a soft suede brush for the Birch overlays to keep the cream color from looking dingy.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
