.</li><li><strong>Textured Rubber Outsole:</strong> Finished with a slim rubber outsole that wraps slightly up the tooling for added protection and classic archive style.</li><li><strong>Archive Branding:</strong> Includes iconic PUMA branding details on the tongue, lateral side, and heel for an authentic retro vibe.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / First Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,300 (Depending on seller batch)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (UK 3 to 7)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Closure</strong></td><td>Lace-up for a snug, adjustable fit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Often ships with a brand-accurate PUMA box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Nationwide Reach:</strong> Fast shipping is available to all major Indian cities (Delhi, Mumbai, Bangalore, Surat) via trusted partners like <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders typically ship within <strong>24?48 hours</strong> of confirmation.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Most 7A sellers offer COD. Note: A small advance \"booking fee\" (?200??400) may be required to confirm shipping.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Many sellers offer <strong>free shipping</strong> or an additional 5?10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Puma Bella generally has a <strong>regular to narrow fit</strong>. For girls with standard feet, stay true to size. If between sizes or if you prefer a roomier fit, consider <strong>ordering a half-size up</strong>. To clean the canvas parts, use a damp cloth with mild soap; for the yellow synthetic strips, a simple wipe with a dry cloth will maintain the color.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Pum_a Bella","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
