> Typically crafted from a mix of durable synthetic leather/canvas with <strong>tonal suede</strong> overlays on the T-toe and heel-cross for added stability and a vintage finish.</li><li><strong>Signature Design Details:</strong> Includes the classic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the iconic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-managing, cushioned footbed designed for all-day urban comfort and shock absorption.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Laceless Premium Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500</strong> (Standard 2026 7A price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3.5 to 7.5 / Women's)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Leather or Canvas / Suede Accents / Rubber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are usually processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from Indian hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Slip-On model is designed to be <strong>snug due to the elastic band</strong>. If you have standard or narrow feet, stay true to your Euro size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5) to ensure the elastic doesn't feel too tight across the instep. To clean, use a damp cloth for the white panels and a soft, dry brush for the suede toe; avoid soaking the shoe to preserve the elastic's tension.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
