e Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the classic \"cross-stitched\" heel reinforcement and the functional branded heel flap for easy wearability.</li><li><strong>Comfort Cushioned Insole:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-wicking, cushioned footbed that provides superior shock absorption for long days on your feet.</li><li><strong>Durable Thin Rubber Sole:</strong> The low-profile rubber outsole features the traditional herringbone pattern, offering a grounded feel and reliable urban traction.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct Labeling)</li><li>Branded Tissue Paper &amp; Authenticity Card</li><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Carry Bag</li><li>Standard Flat Cream Laces</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Cream / Forest Green / Piquant Orange</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Faux Leather / Suede Accents</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Stocked in major premium hubs like Surat and Delhi; orders are typically dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Kolkata, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance of <strong>Rs. 200?500</strong> to confirm the shipment and protect against RTO (Return to Origin).</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a 10% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>notoriously slim and narrow fit</strong>. While they are true to size in length, if you have slightly wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order a UK 6) for better comfort. To clean, wipe the cream leather with a damp cloth and use a dry suede brush for the toe cap; avoid soaking in water to preserve the quality of the synthetic leather.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
