he Chinese New Year edition often includes symbolic red/gold accents, custom insoles, or unique \"Year of the Snake\" (2025/2026) inspired graphics on the Tiger stripes.</li><li><strong>Panda Monochrome:</strong> A high-contrast Black &amp; White colorway that pairs effortlessly with everything from denims to summer dresses.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct Article Tagging)</li><li>Branded Paper Wrapping</li><li>Authentication/Care Instruction Card</li><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Carry Bag</li><li><i>Note: Being a slip-on model, laces are generally not included unless the specific CNY variant features the \"2-way\" lace option.</i></li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (Specifically for Women / Slim Fit)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Panda Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Black Stripes / Grey Suede Toe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CNY Colorway</strong></td><td>Cream / Samba Red / Gold Accents</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Stocked in major premium hubs like Surat and Delhi; orders are typically dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Kolkata, Bangalore) via <strong>Delhivery or Xpressbees</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance of <strong>Rs. 200?300</strong> to prevent RTO (