um [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Steam Puppet | Girls 7A Premium</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Vintage Steampunk Aesthetic</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 \"Steam Puppet\"</strong> is a unique, character-filled entry into the Mexico 66 family. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition is designed for girls who love a \"vintage-distressed\" look mixed with artistic flair. Characterized by its \"Antique Rave\" leather material and a muted, aged color palette, the Steam Puppet edition offers a more rugged, industrial charm compared to the high-shine metallic or clean leather variants.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Antique Leather:</strong> Crafted with a specialized \"Antique Rave\" core leather that features a natural, slightly distressed texture for an authentic vintage feel.</li><li><strong>Muted Industrial Tones:</strong> Features a base of \"Paper Bag\" tan or \"Clay Canyon\" brown, accented by charcoal or deep slate Tiger stripes, giving it a distinctive \"Steam\" aesthetic.</li><li><strong>Signature Reinforcements:</strong> Includes the classic \"T-toe\" suede cap and the iconic cross-stitched heel tab for structural durability and that recognizable retro silhouette.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Comfort Insole:</strong> Fitted with an OrthoLite-style cushioned insole, providing superior shock absorption for all-day urban exploration.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Gum Sole:</strong> A thin, flexible rubber outsole in a dark gum or charcoal finish provides excellent grip while maintaining the shoe's slim profile.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct SKU/Style Labeling)</li><li>Branded Paper Wrapping &amp; Care Instructions</li><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Carry Bag</li><li>Set of Flat Tonal Cotton Laces</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,600 to Rs. 3,400</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Girls/Women Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Paper Bag / Clay Canyon / Antique Slate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Distressed Antique Leather / Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major hubs in Surat and Delhi; orders are typically dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Delhi, Mumbai, Chennai) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance of <strong>Rs. 200?300</strong> to confirm the shipment and prevent RTO.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and a flat 10% discount for payments via UPI.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>notoriously slim and narrow fit</strong>. Since the Steam Puppet uses a slightly firmer antique leather, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> if you have broader feet. To maintain the \"Steam Puppet\" look, do not use liquid polish; simply wipe with a dry cloth to preserve the distressed \"antique\" finish of the leather.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
