trong>Refined Silhouette:</strong> Maintains the slim, low-profile shape that makes the Samba the perfect companion for everything from oversized cargo pants to mini-skirts.</li><li><strong>Heritage Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a soft textile lining and a cushioned insole designed for all-day urban exploration.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Adidas x St?ssy Special Edition Branded Box</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Two Sets of Laces (Black and White/Cream)</li><li>Complimentary Adidas Crew Socks</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price (Collab)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 18,000 to Rs. 25,000</strong> (Resale Market 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,000 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Girls' Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Core Black / White / Gum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Upper Material</strong></td><td>Full Grain Leather &amp; Hairy Suede</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Shipped from major sneaker hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to 500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Samba has a <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. If you have wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size or one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, go for a UK 6) for a more comfortable fit.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To protect the suede T-toe, use a specialized suede brush for dry cleaning. For the black leather, a damp microfibre cloth works best. Avoid wearing them in heavy rain to prevent the gum sole from losing its grip and the suede from matting.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Adida_s Samba","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
