mp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2>Adidas Yeezy Boost 350 V2 Cloud White For Girls&nbsp; Semi-UA Quality</h2><h3>The Ethereal Blue-White Classic</h3><p>The&nbsp;Adidas Yeezy 350 V2 \"Cloud White\"&nbsp;is widely regarded as one of the cleanest and most visually striking colorways in the Yeezy history. This&nbsp;Semi-UA (Unauthorized Authentic) Quality&nbsp;replica offers the highest level of precision, capturing the delicate, dual-toned Primeknit that blends icy white with faint sky-blue hues. It?s the perfect \"Summer Yeezy,\" providing a bright, airy aesthetic that stands out without being as high-maintenance as a pure white sneaker.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Semi-UA Primeknit Upper:&nbsp;Features the advanced multi-toned weave that creates a \"cloud-like\" texture, alternating between crisp white and pale blue threading for a 1:1 visual match.</li><li>\"Real Boost\" Midsole:&nbsp;Equipped with high-density TPU cushioning pellets, delivering the genuine, ultra-soft, and responsive \"squish\" that made the 350 V2 a comfort icon.</li><li>Translucent Side Stripe:&nbsp;A post-dyed monofilament stripe in a pale blue tint runs along the lateral side, adding breathability and a modern structural break in the knit.</li><li>Heel-Tabless Silhouette:&nbsp;This model follows the streamlined, \"no-pull-tab\" design, offering a cleaner and more aerodynamic look around the ankle.</li><li>Icy Translucent Sole:&nbsp;The midsole is encased in a semi-translucent, pale blue TPU shell that houses the Boost core and flows into a matching traction outsole.</li><li>Full Accessory Kit Includes:<ul><li>Yeezy 350 Branded Box (Correct FW3043 SKU labeling)</li><li>StockX or Goat-style Authentication Tag &amp; Certificate</li><li>Branded Crew Socks (White/Blue)</li><li>Adidas/Yeezy Dust Bag &amp; Premium Carry Bag</li><li>Standard Round Reflective/White Laces</li></ul></li></ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Quality Grade</td><td>Semi-UA / 7A+ (Master Copy Tier)</td></tr><tr><td>Price Range</td><td>Rs. 3,800 to Rs. 4,800&nbsp;(Current 2026 Indian Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td>Sizes Available</td><td>Euro 36 to 46 (UK 4 to 12 / Unisex)</td></tr><tr><td>Colorway</td><td>Cloud White / Citrin / Sky Blue</td></tr><tr><td>SKU Reference</td><td>FW3043</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</h3><ul><li>Express Dispatch:&nbsp;Orders are usually verified via WhatsApp video and shipped within&nbsp;24 hours&nbsp;from major premium hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li>Estimated Timeline:&nbsp;3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Bangalore, Chennai, Mumbai) via&nbsp;BlueDart or Delhivery Air.</li><li>Payment Details:<ul><li>Cash on Delivery (COD):&nbsp;Available. For high-tier Semi-UA pairs, sellers typically require a&nbsp;Rs. 500&nbsp;advance \"security\" fee to confirm the order.</li><li>Prepaid Benefits:&nbsp;Often includes&nbsp;Free Shipping&nbsp;and an extra&nbsp;Rs. 200 to 400 discount&nbsp;for payments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</h3><blockquote><p>Fit Note:&nbsp;The Cloud White 350 V2 has a&nbsp;very snug, shallow toe box. It is almost universally recommended to&nbsp;order one full size up&nbsp;from your standard UK size (e.g., if you wear UK 8, order a UK 9). To keep the \"Cloud White\" looking pristine, use a soft-bristled brush with specialized sneaker foam; avoid machine washing to prevent the icy blue sole from losing its clarity or the Primeknit from fraying.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Adida_s Yeezy","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
