hat makes the 350 V2 a leader in comfort.</li><li><strong>Signature Heel Pull-Tab:</strong> Includes the traditional webbing pull-tab with tonal stitching, maintaining the classic V2 silhouette while aiding in easy on-and-off access.</li><li><strong>Frosted TPU Midsole:</strong> The ribbed cage is finished in a <strong>semi-translucent milky white</strong>, protecting the white Boost core while providing excellent urban grip and a sleek, unified look.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Heritage\" Kit Includes:</strong><ul><li>Yeezy 350 Branded Box (Correct <strong>HQ6316</strong> SKU &amp; Labeling)</li><li>StockX or GOAT-style Authentication Tag &amp; Certificate</li><li>Branded Crew Socks (Triple White)</li><li>Yeezy Premium Dust Bag &amp; Carry Bag</li><li>Standard Round White Laces</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>Semi-UA / 7A+ (Master Copy Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 28,000 to Rs. 38,000</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,500</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 46 (UK 4 to 12 / Unisex)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Bone / Bone / Bone (Triple White)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>HQ6316</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Most premium stock is dispatched directly from major footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> <strong>3 to 5 working days</strong> for metro cities (Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore, Ahmedabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. For high-tier Semi-UA pairs, most sellers require a <strong>Rs. 500 advance \"security\" fee</strong> to verify the order and cover potential RTO costs.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10?15% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe/GPay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The \"Bone\" 350 V2 has a <strong>very snug, reinforced toe box</strong>. It is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> from your standard UK size (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order a UK 6).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Because of the triple-white knit, these are prone to visible dirt. Use a <strong>soft sneaker brush</strong> for the Primeknit and specialized cleaning foam. For the midsole, a damp microfiber cloth works best. Apply a <strong>stain and water-repellent spray</strong> before the first wear to keep the \"Bone\" white looking fresh.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Adi_das Yeezy","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"true"}]
