pastel purple racing stripes</strong> and a matching purple fold-down heel tab, making it an excellent statement shoe to pair with white dresses, pleated skirts, or light-wash denim.</li><li><strong>Classic Archive Architecture:</strong> Retains the traditional thin athletic lacing, stitched overlays, and the instantly recognizable fold-down <strong>Onitsuka Tiger heel flap</strong> detailed with crisp, clean branding.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Flexible Outsole:</strong> Sits on a thin, highly flexible cream rubber sole featuring a textured herringbone pattern for dependable daily urban traction and an authentic retro stride.</li><li><strong>Cushioned Impact Insole:</strong> Outfitted inside with an upgraded, dense <strong>foam cushion bed</strong> engineered to provide breathable impact absorption and reliable arch support for all-day wear.</li></ul><h3><strong>Full Accessory \"Premium\" Kit Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (With Accurate Style &amp; SKU Labels)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Logo Soft Silk Tissue Paper &amp; Tags</li><li>Complimentary Branded Premium Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas Storage Carry Bag</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Classic Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td>Rs. 11,500 to Rs. 14,500 (Official Store &amp; Sourced Retail Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,400 to Rs. 4,400 (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (Ladies Sizing / UK 3 to UK 6.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Light Cherry Pink / Soft Purple / Cream / Lavender</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Leather Upper, Suede Overlays &amp; Textured Rubber Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Thoroughly quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier premium footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered directly to major Indian metros within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> via reliable air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A premium suppliers request a minor booking confirmation fee of Rs. 300 to Rs. 500 upfront to verify shipment details and guard against unconfirmed courier returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on checkouts settled upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The classic Mexico 66 collection is engineered with a <strong>distinctly narrow, form-fitting, and low-to-the-ground profile</strong>. If you have broader feet or fall between sizes, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a standard UK 4, select a UK 5) to guarantee comfortable toe box room.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To safeguard the delicate pastel cherry leather and purple stripes, avoid using rigid wire brushes or machine washing. Gently wipe off surface dust using a <strong>soft microfiber cloth</strong> mixed with a drop of mild sneaker shampoo. Always store them in a cool area out of intense, direct summer sunlight to protect the leather structure and prevent the pastel shades from fading.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
