 [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Nike Air Force 1 Low \"Triple White\" | Girls' 7A Premium Quality</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Timeless Streetwear Icon</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Nike Air Force 1 Low \"Triple White\"</strong> is perhaps the most famous sneaker in the world. Originally a basketball powerhouse in 1982, it has evolved into a global fashion staple. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> edition for girls features a pristine, all-white aesthetic crafted with high-grade leather, offering a clean and chunky silhouette that elevates everything from casual school outfits to trendy streetwear looks.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Leather Quality:</strong> Crafted with premium, full-grain synthetic or genuine leather (depending on the batch) that is structured to hold its shape while being soft enough for all-day comfort.</li><li><strong>Classic Air Cushioning:</strong> Features a high-quality foam midsole with an embedded Air-sole unit, providing that signature bouncy, comfortable ride.</li><li><strong>Ventilated Toe Box:</strong> Precision-engineered perforations on the toe cap ensure breathability, keeping your feet cool during long hours of wear.</li><li><strong>Detailed Craftsmanship:</strong> Includes a silver-tone \"AF1\" metal lace dubrae, crisp double-stitching, and a padded collar for a snug, luxurious fit.</li><li><strong>Durable Pivot-Circle Outsole:</strong> The non-marking rubber outsole features the original 1982 pivot-point design, offering excellent traction and heritage style.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Nike Air Force 1 Branded Box (Correct Triple White SKU)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Wrapping &amp; Product Tags</li><li>AF1 Metal Lace Dubrae (Pre-installed)</li><li>Branded White Crew Socks</li><li>Premium Canvas or Reusable Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 8,195 to Rs. 10,795</strong> (Official Nike Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,600 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Girls' Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Triple White (White/White/White)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>DD8959-100 (Women's/Girls' standard)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Usually shipped from premium footwear warehouses in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Pune) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available with most sellers. A small advance \"booking fee\" of <strong>Rs. 200?500</strong> is typically required to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an additional 10% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe/GPay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> Air Force 1s are known to <strong>run slightly large</strong>. For a secure, snug fit, it is recommended to <strong>order a half size down</strong> from your regular Nike size. If you prefer a roomy fit or wear thick socks, stay with your true size.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> To keep them \"Triple White\" crisp, use a soft-bristled brush or a damp cloth with mild sneaker soap. Avoid machine washing, as it can damage the leather finish and the Air unit. A dedicated sneaker protector spray is highly recommended before the first wear to repel stains.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Nik_e Air","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
