l-cross, providing the classic texture-on-leather contrast typical of the '66 model.</li><li><strong>Ultra-Slim Silhouette:</strong> Maintains the iconic low-profile racing shape that makes the foot look sleek and elegant, rather than bulky.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the signature \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the distinctive cross-stitched heel counter for added stability and retro appeal.</li><li><strong>Daily Comfort Insole:</strong> Equipped with a cushioned, OrthoLite-style footbed for moisture management and all-day shock absorption during urban exploration.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Vintage Series)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,500 (Standard 7A price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's W5 to W10)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Materials</strong></td><td>Vintage Leather / Suede / Rubber Outsole</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Fast delivery to major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metro cities; 5–7 days for other regions.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?200–?500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>narrow, streamlined fit</strong>. For girls with standard or narrow feet, stay true to size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order UK 6) for better comfort across the midfoot. To clean, use a soft brush or damp cloth for the leather; for the suede parts, use a dedicated suede eraser to maintain the \"vintage\" texture without flattening the nap.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":"false"}]
