;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Dunhuang Mirage\" | Girls' Full Kit First Copy</strong></h2><h3><strong>A Desert-Inspired Masterpiece</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Dunhuang Mirage\"</strong> is an artistic tribute to the ancient Silk Road and the vibrant murals of the Dunhuang caves. This <strong>7A Premium Quality (Full Kit)</strong> replica captures the ethereal, sandy aesthetic of the \"Mirage\" edition, blending dusty desert tones with intricate detailing. Designed for girls and women who appreciate sneakers with a story, this lace-free model offers a sophisticated, limited-edition look that stands out in any premium collection.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A top-tier \"Full Kit\" replica meticulously engineered to mirror the unique textures and color depth of the 2024/2025 Dunhuang collection.</li><li><strong>Lace-Free Slip-On Design:</strong> Features the signature internal elastic band for a secure, \"locked-in\" fit, combining the ease of a loafer with the soul of a track runner.</li><li><strong>\"Dunhuang Mirage\" Palette:</strong> A stunning mix of <strong>Sand Beige, Dusty Rose, and Sky Blue</strong> stripes, inspired by the shifting sands and cave paintings of the Gobi Desert.</li><li><strong>Mixed-Texture Upper:</strong> Crafted from a premium blend of <strong>distressed canvas and calf suede</strong> to give it a \"vintage relic\" feel while maintaining modern durability.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Cushioning:</strong> Equipped with a high-density foam insole for moisture management and all-day comfort during urban exploration.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the iconic \"Tiger\" heel flap and cross-stitched heel reinforcement for stability and authentic retro appeal.</li></ul><h3><strong>What's in the \"Full Kit\"?</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Full Kit</strong> designation ensures a luxury unboxing experience, typically including:</p><ul><li><strong>Branded Premium Box:</strong> Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate packaging.</li><li><strong>Dust Bag:</strong> A protective fabric bag for travel and storage.</li><li><strong>Brand Tags &amp; Authenticity Cards:</strong> Replicated documentation and care guides.</li><li><strong>Optional Accessories:</strong> Some premium batches include a branded carry bag or extra laces (for the classic look).</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Full Kit Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 4,500 (Full Kit premium in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3.5 to 7.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Distressed Canvas / Suede Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are usually shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs.</li><li><strong>Estimated Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros like Mumbai, Delhi, and Bangalore; 5?7 days for other regions.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. A small advance \"token\" fee (?300??500) may be required by specialized 7A sellers to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>snug and narrow fit</strong> due to the internal elastic bands. For girls with standard feet, stay true to size. If you have wider feet or prefer a relaxed feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5). To clean the \"Mirage\" palette, use a soft suede brush for the sandy overlays and a dry cloth for the canvas; avoid liquid cleaners to preserve the distressed finish.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
