verlays on the toe cap and heel for added protection and texture.</li><li><strong>Girls' Specific Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a <strong>comfort-cushioned insole</strong> (OrthoLite-style) and a lightweight, flexible rubber outsole to support natural foot movement and reduce fatigue.</li><li><p><strong>Retro Iconography:</strong> Retains the original Limber-Up features, including the much-loved heel flap and reinforced ankle panels.2</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Slip-On Series)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,200 (Current Indian 7A Market Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 30 to 40 (UK K12 to 7)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Canvas or Synthetic Leather / Suede Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipped via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong> from major hubs.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically confirmed and dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for smaller regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Most premium 7A sellers offer COD. A small advance \"token\" fee (?200??500) may be required to process the shipment.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Slip-On has a <strong>tapered, snug fit</strong> due to the elasticated tongue. For girls with standard feet, it fits true to size. However, if she has wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if she wears UK 2, order UK 3) to prevent the elastic from feeling too tight. To maintain the bright yellow color, wipe with a damp cloth; avoid heavy detergents on the canvas sections to prevent the yellow from fading or bleeding into the white stripes.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
