nd a multi-textured finish.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Includes the classic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the iconic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for an authentic retro feel.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a <strong>comfort insole</strong> and a heel-cross reinforcement designed to provide better stability and support for all-day urban play.</li><li><strong>Reliable Traction:</strong> Features a textured rubber outsole that provides excellent grip while maintaining the signature \"grounded\" feel of the Mexico 66 line.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Replica)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.4,699 (Depending on seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (UK 3 to 7)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Synthetic Leather / Suede Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Often ships with an Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate or custom \"OG\" box</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Fast delivery to major hubs like Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, and Bangalore via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24?48 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"token\" fee (?200??500) to confirm the order, with the balance due at delivery.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 5?10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 is known for its <strong>slim, narrow silhouette</strong>. For most girls, it fits true to size. However, if they have wider feet or prefer a bit of extra room for growth, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if she wears UK 4, order UK 5). To maintain the \"White/Blue/Pink\" look, wipe the white panels with a clean, dry cloth and use a soft brush to remove dust from the suede sections.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
