[&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 | White/Blue/Red (Girls' 7A Quality)</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Iconic Heritage Original</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66</strong> in \"White/Blue/Red\" is the most famous colorway in the brand's history?the quintessential \"Tricolor\" that debuted during the 1966 pre-Olympic trials. This <strong>7A Premium Quality (First Copy)</strong> replica for girls captures the timeless Olympic spirit, featuring a crisp white leather base with the legendary blue and red Tiger stripes. It is the gold standard for retro sneakers, offering a versatile, sporty look that has remained a fashion staple for over 60 years.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A high-end replica meticulously designed to replicate the original's lightweight, ultra-slim silhouette and classic '60s racing profile.</li><li><strong>Signature Tricolor Design:</strong> Features the iconic <strong>White</strong> leather upper with <strong>Directoire Blue</strong> and <strong>Classic Red</strong> Tiger stripes?the brand's most recognizable and sought-after palette.</li><li><strong>Premium Material Construction:</strong> Crafted from high-quality <strong>smooth matte leather</strong> (or core leather antique rave) and reinforced with tonal beige or white <strong>suede overlays</strong> on the T-toe and heel.</li><li><strong>Heritage Heel Components:</strong> Includes the signature cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the iconic \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for an authentic vintage finish.</li><li><strong>Kids-Specific Comfort:</strong> Often features <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioning</strong> in the insole to provide better shock absorption and moisture management for active girls.</li><li><strong>Low-Profile Rubber Outsole:</strong> A thin, flexible rubber sole that provides a \"barefoot\" feel with reliable urban grip, staying true to its track-and-field roots.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,400 (Typical 7A pricing in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 30 to 40 (UK K12 to 7)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Synthetic/Artificial Leather &amp; Suede</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipping available to major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders typically ship within <strong>24?48 hours</strong> after verification.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available through top 7A sellers. A small advance \"token\" fee (Rs. 200? Rs. 500) may be required to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or an additional discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>notoriously slim and narrow fit</strong>. For girls with standard feet, stay true to size. However, if they have wider feet or are growing quickly, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if she wears UK 1, order UK 2) to ensure a comfortable fit. To maintain the bright \"Tricolor\" look, wipe the white leather with a damp cloth and use a soft brush for the suede toe cap; avoid liquid cleaners on the red/blue stripes to prevent color bleeding.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
