ger\" branded heel flap in matching blue or grey for authentic '60s flair.</li><li><strong>Child-Friendly Comfort:</strong> Most girls' editions feature a <strong>slip-on construction or elasticated laces</strong> to ensure easy on-and-off functionality for younger users.</li><li><strong>All-Day Support:</strong> Equipped with an <strong>OrthoLite-style cushioned insole</strong> designed to provide superior moisture management and shock absorption for active daily use.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs.3,800 (Typical 7A pricing in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 30 to 40 (UK K12 to 7)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Color</strong></td><td>White / Fresh Ice Blue</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Logistics:</strong> Shipping to all major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders typically ship within <strong>24 hours</strong> after verification via WhatsApp.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most sellers require a small advance \"token\" fee (?200??500) to confirm the shipment.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 has a <strong>slim and narrow fit</strong>. For most girls, it fits true to size. However, if your child has wider feet, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one size up</strong> (e.g., if she wears UK 1, order UK 2) for better comfort. To maintain the \"White/Blue Ice\" look, wipe the leather with a damp cloth and use a soft suede brush for the grey toe cap overlays; avoid liquid cleaners on the blue stripes to prevent color fading.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
