Premium Leather Finish:</strong> Crafted with a soft, smooth white leather or high-quality synthetic leather base, reinforced with ivory suede on the T-toe and heel.</li><li><strong>Spacious Toe Box:</strong> Despite its slim ballerina aesthetic, it retains the Mexico 66?s <strong>wide toe design</strong>, ensuring toes aren't pinched during all-day wear.</li><li><strong>Heritage Details:</strong> Finished with the iconic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded heel flap for authentic 1966 DNA.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / First Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,500 (Approximate price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (UK 3 to 7)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Color</strong></td><td>White / Crystal Pink</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate drawer box</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Fast delivery to major hubs like Surat, Delhi, Mumbai, and Bangalore via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?200??500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Fit Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Ballerina is designed with a <strong>very slim silhouette</strong>. While the toe box is roomy, the midfoot is narrow. It is highly recommended to <strong>order your standard size</strong> for a secure fit, or <strong>one size up</strong> if you have wider feet or intend to wear them with lace socks. To maintain the white leather and pink stripes, wipe clean with a damp cloth; avoid heavy detergents which may fade the delicate pink flower-cut details.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
