mantic, girly detail.</li><li><strong>Heritage Contrast Stripes:</strong> Iconic <strong>White</strong> Tiger stripes set against a premium <strong>Black</strong> leather or suede base, maintaining the authentic sporty DNA of the Mexico 66.</li><li><strong>Slim Protective Outsole:</strong> A thin, flexible rubber sole that provides a \"barefoot\" feel while offering enough grip for urban walking.</li><li><strong>Signature Heel Detail:</strong> Includes the classic cross-stitched heel reinforcement and the \"Tiger\" branded pull-tab, which are hallmarks of the 1966 original.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 3,600 (Depending on seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7.5)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Synthetic Leather / Suede Overlays</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Nationwide Express:</strong> Shipping available to all major cities (Delhi, Mumbai, Surat, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong><ul><li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> Usually within <strong>24?48 hours</strong> of order confirmation.</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> 3?5 working days for metros; 5?7 days for other regions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Most 7A sellers offer COD. A small advance \"token\" fee (?200??500) may be required to prevent RTO (Return to Origin).</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 Ballerina has a <strong>slim and narrow fit</strong>. It is highly recommended to <strong>order your standard size</strong> for a snug, flat-like fit. If you have slightly wider feet, consider <strong>going one size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 4, order UK 5) for better comfort. To clean, wipe the black panels with a damp cloth and use a soft brush for any suede accents to keep the \"Black/White\" contrast sharp.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
