 the day.<br>&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Signature Wrapped Outsole:</strong> The thin rubber outsole features a unique texture and slightly wraps around the heel and toe for added durability and a distinct retro character.<br>&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Puma Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Sizing Label)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Wrapping &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Ankle Socks (White or Navy Blue)</li><li>Premium Cloth Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Copy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 5,499</strong> (Official Store Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,100 to Rs. 3,600</strong> (Current 2026 Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 40 (UK 3.5 to 7.5 / Women?s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White / Blue / Nimbus Cloud</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Textile (Canvas) with Synthetic Overlays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Usually shipped from footwear hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Chennai) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 200?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an extra 10% discount via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Puma Bella UT has a <strong>narrower, tailored fit</strong>. If you have wider feet or prefer a more relaxed feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order a UK 5.5 or 6).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Since this is a white canvas shoe, it can attract dust quickly. Use a soft brush for dry dirt and a damp cloth with mild sneaker soap for stains. Air dry in the shade?never use a dryer or direct sunlight as it can cause the white canvas to yellow.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Pum_a Bella","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
