 iconic beige suede T-toe cap and heel reinforcement, preserving the multi-dimensional texture of the classic 1960s design.</li><li><strong>OrthoLite-Style Comfort:</strong> Equipped with a moisture-wicking, cushioned insole designed to provide soft, springy support for all-day urban walking.</li><li><strong>Signature Heel Flap:</strong> Retains the traditional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap and the cross-stitched heel reinforcement for authentic heritage appeal.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Finish)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,499</strong> (Varies by seller batch in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Women's &amp; Girls' Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>White Base / Beige (Birch) Stripes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Onitsuka Tiger brand-accurate box and tags</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Orders are typically processed and shipped within <strong>24 hours</strong> from major Indian hubs like Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities; 5?7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (<strong>Rs. 200 to Rs. 500</strong>) to confirm the shipment.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI or Bank Transfer.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Mexico 66 features a <strong>slim and narrow cut</strong>. For girls with standard or narrow feet, stay true to your usual size. If you have <strong>wider feet</strong>, it is highly recommended to <strong>order one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order UK 6) for a more comfortable fit across the midfoot. To clean, wipe the white leather with a damp cloth and use a soft suede brush for the beige overlays to keep them looking fresh.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
