[&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Onitsuka Tiger x Panda Prank Mexico 66 Slip-On \"Pink\" | 7A Premium Quality</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Sweet Streetwear Fusion</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Onitsuka Tiger x Panda Prank \"Pink\" Slip-On</strong> is a high-concept collaboration that blends the classic Japanese track aesthetic with the playful, custom-culture spirit of the <strong>Panda Prank</strong> design house. This edition features a dreamy, soft pink palette (often referred to as <i>Sakura</i> or <i>Cotton Candy Pink</i>) accented by the signature \"Panda Prank\" branding. This <strong>7A Premium Quality</strong> replica is perfect for those who want a feminine, \"kawaii\" aesthetic without sacrificing the edge of a limited-edition streetwear collab.</p><h3><strong>Key Exclusive Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A premium 1:1 replica featuring a high-grade canvas and suede mix, maintaining the signature lightweight and slim-line profile of the Mexico 66.</li><li><strong>Custom Panda Prank Branding:</strong> Includes the unique \"Panda Prank\" graphic details on the insole, tongue, and the characteristic collaboration hangtags that give it a \"custom-shop\" feel.</li><li><strong>Soft Pink &amp; White Palette:</strong> The upper is bathed in a delicate pastel pink with crisp white Tiger stripes, creating a fresh, aesthetic look perfect for spring and summer.</li><li><strong>Laceless Convenience:</strong> Designed with a hidden internal elastic band for a secure, \"locked-in\" fit, allowing you to slip them on and off instantly while keeping the classic eyelet look.</li><li><strong>Heritage Heel Cross:</strong> Features the iconic \"X\" reinforced stitching on the heel and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in matching pink or white.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li><strong>Panda Prank x Onitsuka Tiger Special Edition Box</strong></li><li><strong>Panda Prank Authentication Card/Certificate</strong> (Replica)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Invisible or Ankle Socks (White or Pink)</li><li>Premium Canvas or Cloth Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (Custom Series)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Custom Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 25,000+</strong> (Original Panda Prank Custom)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 5,200</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Girls' Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Pastel Pink / White / Cream</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>PP-MEX66-PNK</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Usually shipped from premium warehouses in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities like Mumbai, Bangalore, and Delhi via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A+ sellers require an advance \"security\" fee of <strong>Rs. 300?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an additional 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Slip-On model has a <strong>snug fit</strong> across the top of the foot. If you have a high instep or prefer a more relaxed feel, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order a UK 6).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> The soft pink canvas and suede are sensitive to dirt. Use a specialized suede eraser for scuffs and a dry soft-bristled brush for dust. Avoid wearing them in the rain to prevent the pink pigment from water-spotting.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
