\" branded heel flap, providing essential stability and authentic 1966 track-and-field character.</li><li><strong>Thin-Sole Ground Feel:</strong> Equipped with a low-profile, flexible rubber outsole with the traditional herringbone tread for a natural walking experience.</li><li><strong>Full Accessory \"Full Kit\" Includes:</strong><ul><li>Onitsuka Tiger Branded Box (Correct Light Blue/White Labeling)</li><li>Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product Tags</li><li>Branded Invisible or Ankle Socks (White or Light Blue)</li><li>Premium Canvas Carry Bag</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 10,500</strong> (Official Store Price 2026)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 2,999 to Rs. 3,800</strong> (Current Indian Price)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 36 to 41 (UK 3 to 7 / Girls' Sizing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Light Blue (Sky Blue) / White / Cream</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SKU Reference</strong></td><td>1183B815-107</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Usually shipped from footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3?5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Details:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"booking\" fee of <strong>Rs. 200?500</strong> to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an additional 10% discount for payments via UPI/PhonePe.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Slip-On model has a <strong>snugger fit</strong> due to the elastic band across the top. If you have a high instep or prefer a bit more room, it is highly recommended to <strong>order a half size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear UK 5, order a UK 5.5 or 6).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Because this is a light-colored shoe, avoid wearing it in heavy rain or muddy conditions. Use a soft-bristled brush for the canvas/suede parts and a damp cloth with mild soap for the white stripes.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuk_a Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Women's Shoes","availability":0}]
