lt on a durable, solid white outer outsole that stabilizes your step, shielding the softer inner cushioning layer from rough, abrasive road surfaces.</li><li><strong>Multi-Directional Outsole Traction:</strong> The bottom sole utilizes a high-traction, wave-inspired grip pattern designed to keep you steady across wet surfaces, tile flooring, or dry city pavements.</li><li><strong>Pivoting Turbo Heel Strap:</strong> Features a secure, matching black heel strap that swings back for a locked-in fit on active walks, or flips forward for instant slip-on convenience.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 5,995 to Rs. 6,995</strong> (Official Store Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 1,899 to Rs. 2,499</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Core Black / Crisp White / Charcoal</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Matlite™ Resin Upper &amp; Dual-Density Foam Outsole</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Quality evaluated and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> across major Indian metros via reliable premium air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A vendors request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to protect against unconfirmed returns.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders processed upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The LiteRide 360 collection offers a slightly more <strong>tailored, athletic fit</strong> compared to the wide, roomy silhouette of classic Crocs clogs. If you normally wear a half-size or prefer a loose, relaxed fit with socks, it is highly recommended to <strong>go one full size up</strong> (e.g., if you wear a UK 8, select a UK 9).</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Clean dirt or mud effortlessly by rinsing with normal water and wiping down with a mild soapy cloth. <strong>Do not expose these clogs to extreme direct heat or leave them under the hot Indian summer sun</strong> for extended periods, as high temperatures can cause the premium resin materials to warp or shrink.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Crocs LiteRide","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Flip Flops/ Slides","availability":"true"}]
