n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Crocs Classic All-Terrain Sandal \"Black\" | 7A Premium Mens Sandals</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Rugged Utility Evolution</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Crocs Classic All-Terrain Sandal in Black</strong> takes the legendary comfort of the iconic clog and optimizes it for the rugged adventurer. Stripping away the full toe coverage for a highly breathable two-strap sandal architecture, this silhouette is built to handle tougher environments—from rocky terrain to unpredictable weather. This <strong>7A Premium edition</strong> meticulously replicates the heavy-duty design, featuring a matte black Croslite™ body paired with an adjustable woven heel strap and a deeply lugged traction system.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Rugged Build:</strong> A 1:1 high-tier replica featuring the exact density, structural strength, and weight of the original trail-ready model. It is completely molded with a smooth, premium finish without rough factory seams.</li><li><strong>Dual-Strap Breathable Upper:</strong> The classic two-strap slide configuration keeps the foot securely locked in place while offering maximum airflow. The straps are topped with ventilation holes perfect for customization with Jibbitz™ charms.</li><li><strong>Adjustable Turbo Heel Strap:</strong> Equipped with an upgraded, heavy-duty woven heel strap featuring a hook-and-loop adjustable patch. It allows you to fine-tune the tension for a perfect, secure fit while a padded heel cushion prevents chafing.</li><li><strong>Iconic Comfort Footbed:</strong> The interior features signature Croslite™ foam cushioning with molded massage pods that cradle the foot, offering all-day shock absorption and active foot recovery.</li><li><strong>All-Terrain Lugged Outsole:</strong> Reinforced with a thick, rugged rubber outsole featuring deep, multi-directional tread channels. This enhanced lug pattern pushes away water and mud, delivering exceptional grip on slippery or uneven surfaces.</li><li><strong>Easy-Clean &amp; Quick-Dry:</strong> Completely water-friendly and buoyant. Perfect for monsoon wear, outdoor trails, or casual streetwear, it dries in minutes and shrugs off mud with a simple rinse.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A Premium / Master Quality (1:1 Outdoor Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Retail Price</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 3,995 to Rs. 4,495</strong> (Official Store Price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Market Price (7A)</strong></td><td><strong>Rs. 1,499 to Rs. 1,999</strong> (Current India Market Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>Euro 40 to 45 (Mens Sizing / UK 6 to UK 11)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Tactical Black / Charcoal Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Material</strong></td><td>Premium Water-Resistant Croslite™ Resin &amp; Rugged Rubber Lugs</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Direct Dispatch:</strong> Quality checked and shipped out within <strong>24 hours</strong> from premier footwear distribution hubs in <strong>Surat</strong>, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Delivered within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> across major Indian metros via reliable premium air express options like <strong>BlueDart</strong> or <strong>Delhivery Air</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Fully supported across India. Most 7A vendors request a minor booking confirmation fee of <strong>Rs. 300 to Rs. 500</strong> upfront to verify shipment details.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Advantage:</strong> Grants <strong>Free Shipping</strong> and an instant <strong>10% cash discount</strong> on orders processed upfront via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The Classic All-Terrain Sandal runs <strong>true to size</strong> and offers a roomy, generous fit typical of iconic Crocs models. However, because the adjustable turbo strap allows you to pull the foot forward, if you wear a half-size (e.g., UK 8.5), it is recommended to <strong>size down</strong> to the nearest whole size (UK 8) rather than sizing up.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Incredibly low-maintenance. Clean mud, dirt, or trail dust effortlessly by rinsing with normal water and wiping down with a mild soapy cloth. <strong>Do not leave these sandals under the direct, scorching Indian summer sun</strong> or near extreme heat sources for extended periods, as intense heat can cause the specialized resin materials to warp or shrink.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Crocs Classic","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Flip Flops/ Slides","availability":"true"}]
