xt whole size (e.g., UK 5) for the best fit. To clean, simply wipe with a damp cloth or hand wash with mild soap; avoid leaving them in high heat or direct sunlight for extended periods, as the foam material can shrink or warp.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Crocs LiteRide","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Flip Flops/ Slides","availability":"true"}]
