ckquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \"><h2><strong>Crocs LiteRide 360 Clog | Grey/Brown/White Multi (Premium 7A First Copy)</strong></h2><h3><strong>The Evolution of Comfort</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Crocs LiteRide 360 Clog</strong> in \"Grey/Brown/White Multi\" is the most advanced comfort system in the Crocs lineup, designed for an active, on-the-go lifestyle. This <strong>Premium 7A First Copy</strong> replica captures the multi-tonal, sophisticated aesthetic of the 360 series, featuring a neutral grey upper, earthy brown accents, and a clean white sole. Unlike the classic Crocs, the 360 model uses a specialized pressure-mapped design to provide cushioning exactly where your feet need it most.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>7A Master Quality Build:</strong> A high-end replica designed to mirror the authentic's innovative \"Matlite Motion\" upper and dual-density construction.</li><li><strong>360-Degree LiteRide Foam:</strong> Replicates the ultra-soft, featherweight, and resilient LiteRide foam footbed that surrounds the entire foot for sink-in softness.</li><li><strong>Matlite Motion Upper:</strong> Features a flexible, perforated upper that mimics the movement of knit fabric, providing maximum breathability and a \"broken-in\" feel from day one.</li><li><strong>Pressure-Mapped Support:</strong> Designed to provide targeted support and breathability based on heat and pressure points of the human foot.</li><li><strong>Durable Traction Outsole:</strong> Equipped with a rubberized Croslite outsole for enhanced grip, durability, and a steady stride on various surfaces.</li><li><strong>Personalization Ready:</strong> Includes four Jibbitz holes per pair, allowing you to add your own charms for a custom look.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Premium First Copy (Master Quality)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 1,800 to Rs. 2,500 (Standard 7A price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>UK 6 to UK 11 (Men's / Unisex)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Grey Upper / Brown Accents / White Sole Multi</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Matlite Motion Upper / LiteRide Foam Footbed</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Fast delivery to major cities (Surat, Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore) via <strong>BlueDart or Delhivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metros; 5–7 days for other regions.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. Most premium sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee (?200–?500) to confirm the order.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> The LiteRide 360 typically has a <strong>relaxed fit</strong> but runs slightly large. If you usually wear a half-size (e.g., UK 8.5), it is highly recommended to <strong>size down</strong> to the next whole size (e.g., UK 8) for the best fit. To clean, simply wipe with a damp cloth or hand wash with mild soap and cold water; avoid leaving them in direct sunlight or high heat, as Croslite material can shrink if exposed to extreme temperatures.</p></blockquote></div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Crocs LiteRide","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Flip Flops/ Slides","availability":"true"}]
