der variety of outfits.</li><li><strong>Rubberized Traction Outsole:</strong> Equipped with a durable rubber outsole for added grip and stability on urban surfaces, ensuring they last through heavy daily use.</li><li><strong>Adjustable Heel Strap:</strong> Features the signature pivoting heel strap for a secure fit in \"sport mode\" or a quick-on, quick-off experience.</li></ul><h3><strong>Product Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Quality Grade</strong></td><td>7A / Master Copy (Premium Tier)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Price Range</strong></td><td>Rs. 1,800 to Rs. 2,600 (Standard 7A price in India)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sizes Available</strong></td><td>UK 6 to UK 11 (Men's / Unisex)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Colorway</strong></td><td>Grey (Slate) / White Midsole / Grey Outsole</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Includes Crocs brand-accurate zip-bag or box</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Express Dispatch:</strong> Most 7A vendors process and ship within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> from hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai.</li><li><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> 3–5 working days for metros; 5–7 days for other regions via <strong>BlueDart, Delhivery, or Ecom Express</strong>.</li><li><strong>Payment Options:</strong><ul><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Widely available. A small advance \"token\" fee (Rs. 200 – Rs. 500) is standard to confirm shipping.</li><li><strong>Prepaid Benefits:</strong> Often includes <strong>free shipping</strong> or a 10% discount for payments via UPI/Google Pay.</li></ul></li></ul><h3><strong>Sizing &amp; Care Tip</strong></h3><blockquote><p><strong>Fit Note:</strong> LiteRide 360 models generally have a <strong>relaxed fit</strong> but can run slightly large. If you typically wear a half-size (e.g., UK