semibold [&amp;_h4]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h5]:text-base md:[&amp;_h5]:text-md [&amp;_h5]:font-medium [&amp;_h5]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_h6]:text-sm md:[&amp;_h6]:text-base [&amp;_h6]:font-medium [&amp;_h6]:mb-4\n      [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-lg [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:opacity-70\n      [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-gray-300  [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_blockquote]:my-4\n      [&amp;_table]:w-full\n      [&amp;_table]:border\n      [&amp;_table]:border-collapse\n      [&amp;_table]:mb-6\n      [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:px-4 [&amp;_th]:py-2\n      [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:px-4 [&amp;_td]:py-2\n      [&amp;_li]:mb-2\n      [&amp;_section]:mb-6\n    \">Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD \"Yellow/Black\" | 7A Premium SneakersThe Definitive \"Kill Bill\" Luxury UpgradeThe Onitsuka Tiger Mexico 66 SD in \"Yellow/Black\" is the high-spec evolution of the brand's most famous colorway. While the standard version is legendary for its appearance in martial arts cinema, the SD (Super Deluxe) version elevates the icon with premium materials and modern comfort technology. This 7A Premium Quality edition captures the striking contrast of the vibrant yellow and deep black stripes while replicating the superior build of the SD series.Key Features7A SD-Series Build: A 1:1 premium replica featuring a supple, high-grade leather upper that is softer and more durable than the standard canvas or basic leather versions.Modern Comfort Tech: Replicates the SD-specific upgrades, including a thinner, more cushioned midsole and a high-rebound OrthoLite? style insole, making these far more comfortable for long-distance walking than the original 1966 model.Refined Details: Features polished metal eyelets and slimmer, more precise Tiger stripes. The heel features the signature \"X\" reinforcement and the functional \"Tiger\" branded heel flap in black.High-Traction Outsole: Equipped with a specialized rubber compound and a modified herringbone tread pattern designed for better grip on urban surfaces.Cinematic Palette: The bold \"Tai-Chi\" Yellow base with jet-black stripes?a timeless look that pairs perfectly with black denim, joggers, or tech-wear.Full Accessory \"SD Premium\" Kit Includes:Onitsuka Tiger SD Series Branded Box (Correct SKU &amp; Labeling)Brand-Accurate Tissue Paper &amp; Product TagsBranded Crew or Ankle Socks (Yellow or Black)Premium Canvas Carry BagProduct SpecificationsFeatureDetailsQuality Grade7A Premium / SD Master Quality (1:1)Retail PriceRs. 16,500 to Rs. 18,500 (Official SD Price 2026)Market Price (7A)Rs. 3,500 to Rs. 5,200 (Current Indian Price)Sizes AvailableEuro 40 to 45 (UK 6 to 11 / Men?s)ColorwayYellow / Black / Cream MidsoleSKU Reference1183A391-752Shipping &amp; Delivery (India)Direct Dispatch: Shipped from premium sneaker hubs in Surat, Delhi, or Mumbai within 24 hours.Estimated Timeline: 3 to 5 working days for metro cities (Mumbai, Bangalore, Delhi, Hyderabad) via BlueDart or Delhivery Air.Payment Details:Cash on Delivery (COD): Available. Most 7A sellers require a small advance \"security\" fee of Rs. 300 to 500 to confirm the order.Prepaid Benefits: Often includes Free Shipping and an extra 10% discount for payments via UPI (GPay/PhonePe).Sizing &amp; Care TipFit Note: The SD series is built on a narrower, more modern last. It provides a very secure, streamlined fit. It is highly recommended to order a half size up (e.g., if you wear UK 9, order a UK 10) for the best daily comfort.Care: To keep the yellow leather vibrant, use a damp microfibre cloth for regular cleaning. Avoid using harsh chemical cleaners. For the black stripes, a simple leather conditioner will keep them from cracking over time.</div>","productDescription":null,"productBrand":"Onitsuka Tiger","sizeName":"[]","catName":"Men's Shoes","availability":0}]
